<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">Ɛ̃SAL</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɛ̃sal mi Antam</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ɛ̃sal</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ɛ̃sa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ɛ̃sal mi Antam</para>
  <para style="imt">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan wu Ɛ̃sal mi Antam</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃swɛn-ɔ̃nkaan wu Ɛ̃sal mi Antam wu eli Luk. Wu ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ wa mviaal ke mbee a ŋ'ekel ndɛ wa Nsia yi Ngesɛ. Ndɛ áyuɔɔl ndɛ ola mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuun Tehofil. Kɛn emfa kiki, onge b'ekel ndɛ k'obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ wu ɛ̃kwel, ndɛ ata «ɔ̃sam wu ãndɔɔ m'ãbwel» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:3">Luk 1.3</ref></char>), ke mbee a ŋ'efuul-efuul ndɛ nsia a mɔ̃ ngesɛ-ngesɛ, m'emfa ki ébwel mɔ̃, fa obɛɛn b'Ebvɔɔn. Luk ndyam ámwɛn k'ébwel ãndɔɔ m'eswɛn ndɛ mã bvool oli ngɔmɔ̃ onse b'ábɛɛn mɔ̃. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, nsa bibi onse ɔ̃nkaan wu, ndɛ aliaal ndiri «bee» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:10-13">16.10-13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Luk osi ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki ɔ̃yɛɛl wu otal oyi b'eyɛn Ebvɔɔn nkwel onse etswi nsie ki Meditelane. Okyɛ emfa ki étam Yeso ndyam ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ye k'eyi ndɛ ywel ndiri: «Byɛ èyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ ke Yelusalem, ke nsie yueel yi Yude, ke Samali, tiil ke ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">1.8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ke yam, akoo k'akab ɔ̃nkaan wu m'ebaal etyel.</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse ebaal ki ɛ̃kwel, Luk asuo emfa ki ebɛɛn Ebvɔɔn ke Yelusalem, me tsoo e Pantekote, ŋ'eyɔɔ antam Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu éwi Yeso bɔ lɔɔ. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, antam bu abvi Nsia yi Ngesɛ otsal ke Yelusalem (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-8:3">1.1–8.3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse ebaal ki bviaal, Luk asuo emfa ki eyɛn Ebvɔɔn nkwel k'etswi e nsie kieel ki Yuda (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 8:4-12:25">8.4–12.25</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse ebaal ki etyel, Luk asuo emfa ki etsɔɔn Nsia yi Ngesɛ me nsie yi Meditelane tiil bviil li Lom (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-28:31">13.1–28.31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Baal b'Ebvɔɔn áketsal Nsia kɛn onge otsal, onkyam ŋɛn bɔ ákemwɛn fool li emfa bwɛn emfa li éketuaal Ayuda bɔ, y'ãmpal m'ãli onse bam. Ebvɔɔn ékekwel tswa-a-tswa. Me lio olɔ, ntam Piɛɛl wu áli mbiri a lɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 2:1-7:60">2.1–7.60</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ke mbee a fool li ebiri Etyɛn k'epfu, ndɛ wu mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel wu ábam me ndɔɔ a okiool o ndɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 7">7</ref></char>), Ebvɔɔn eyɛn nkwel onse etswi e nsie ki Yude ye ki Samali. Baal b'Ebvɔɔn b'atsɔɔn m'etswi e nsie obvɛ ákeyi atsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ ola baal b'ékemwɛɛn a bɔ. Baal b'émwɛɛn a bɔ éli baal ba Samali, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu Etiopi wu ákebwel nkuul (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 8:1-40">8.1-40</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Me nkuul a bviil li Damas, Ɔ̃falisaye ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Sol wa bviil li Taase, wu áketuaal Ebvɔɔn mpal, ámwɛɛn ye Yeso, bu aswɛɛl ɔ̃kwal. Yeso wu ápal ola ndɛ átam ndɛ k'ayetsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-16">9.1-16</ref></char>). Kɛn a tiil me lio li ékaal Sol ɔ̃kwal, mbiri a Ebvɔɔn kɛn éli ntam Piɛɛl. Mfam ásuo Piɛɛl kwɛn obvuul oli hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9:31-12:25">9.31–12.25</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Onkyam ŋɛn áketuaal baal b'Ebvɔɔn mpal kɛn onge otuaal, ntam Dzak ábam, ntam Piɛɛl átyel me bwal, kɛn a Nziã ápaal ndɛ kwɛn ndɛ anɔɔn k'asal ɔ̃sal a ndɛ. Me b'otal Sol, onge bɛn ndɛ ákaal ɔ̃kwal, Yeso-Mãsia osi kwɛn ndɛ akal étam wu ɔ̃nɛn wu atsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ tiil ke ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-28:31">13.1–28.31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Obɔbɔ, ɔ̃nkaan a Luk wa mviaal wu ayɛɛn m'ãdzuu ãtyel m'éyɛn Sol wu abeta me Pool, me ndɔɔ yi ayetsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ ke nsie yi Meditelane, k'ãbviil mã swipele, Maseduaan, Ngelek, nsie yi Adzi tiil ye k'ásiin ndɛ ke Yelusalem (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 20-23">20–23</ref></char>). Onge bɛn Pool áli ke Tsedzale ku esi ndɛ bvel yuaal me bwal, ndɛ osɔɔ kwɛn ayuɔɔl ndɛ Lom ol'ɔ̃kwɛn (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 24-26">24–26</ref></char>). Obɔ otsɛn bɛn owi ndɛ nkuul yi ayi odzuu tiil Lom, okɔ, ku ásuul ndɛ ndii etsi-tsiri. Obobɔ, Pool k'ayɔɔl k'atsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ wɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 27-28">27–28</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Otsal o Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi emwã bvool yi emfa ekyam k'eli kɛn ɔ̃sal wu atam ye b'ákesal ye bɔ wɛ, eli hɛ̃ ɔ̃sal wu Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu asa kwɛn Ebvɔɔn ekwel. Luk ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ a Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal nsa bibi. Ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal bɛɛn ke Pantekote oli hɛ̃ y'ɔ̃bvɛn bibi me ndɔɔ Ebvɔɔn li nɔnɔ̃ ŋã, li ebebii ãtee y'owam onse ɔ̃nkaan wu, me ndɔɔ yɛn lɔ eyetsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ m'ɔ̃kiri.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Nziã àwa Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Mfam Tehofile, onse ɔ̃nkaan a mɛ̃ wu ɛ̃kwel mɛ̃ éti ɔ̃sam wu ãndɔɔ m'ébɛɛn Yeso osa ye m'éyiool ndɛ, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />tiil tsoo li éyɛn ndɛ ywel. Ye k'eyi ndɛ okɔ, me mpɛn a Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, ndɛ olieel antam b'ésueel ndɛ ãndɔɔ m'àsa. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Ke mbee epfu e ndɛ, ndɛ opal ola bɔ m'omwiĩ, bu asuo bɔ m'emfa bibi kwɛn ndɛ osiool. Ndɛ opal ola bɔ ãtsoo ãku-ãnã, olieel bɔ ãndɔɔ m'Okwɛn o Nziã. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, ŋ'ébvɔɔn ndɛ ye bɔ, ndɛ owi bɔ ngel yi: «Ebee ombal ke Yelusalem, kɛn a byɛ èkiaal tiil ye k'ewa Taal kab li éwi ndɛ lɔɔ, onge b'élieel mɛ̃ byɛ. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Dzaã áwi baal opongo b'ãdza, kɛn a byɛ, ke mbee ãtsoo ke kwɛ, byɛ èwal opongo b'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal.»<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andɛɛl Yeso oyɛn ywel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Baal b'ábvɔɔn afuul Yeso bubu: «Mfam, li lio li èbveel yɛ okwɛn me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal b'Isalayel?»<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ bubu: «K'awi byɛ nkuul yi eyɛɛ ãlio y'ãtal m'éwɛɛ Taal ãndɔɔ osa m'okwɛn o ndyam wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Kɛn a ŋ'ekieel esool Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal nkal a byɛ, byɛ èbɔɔ mpɛn, obobɔ byɛ èyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ ke Yelusalem, ke nsie yueel yi Yude, ke Samali, tiil ke ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri.»<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Ke mbee ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, andɛɛl Yeso oyɛn ywel me lio li éketal bɔ ndɛ, epɛn efoo ndɛ ke mviil ã bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Bɔ áketal ywel kɛn yuul, me lio li ékeyi ndɛ. Pfa, abɔɔl buaal apal tsotsoo ye bɔ m'ekɔ bvi afuu-fuu. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Baal obɔ alieel bubu: «Afi-Ngalile, ki ekɛɛn byɛ oŋɔ̃ ebetal ywel yuul emã? Yeso wu abiri ywel ke mviil ã byɛ wu, akieel ayebvool kɛn a m'emfa kiki ki emwɛn byɛ ndɛ oyɛn ywel.»<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu àkiri ke mboo a Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Antam bu ambal nkio yi ata me nkio a ɛ̃ti mi Olibve, bu abvool Yelusalem. Nkio oyɔ eli tsotsoo ye Yelusalem, nku-a-nku a kilometele ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Ŋ'ekɔɔl bɔ, bɔ anɔɔn k'etswi e nzɔ ki ke ywel, ke mboo yi ékekal bɔ tsɔɔn. Ãnkuũ ã bɔ ã́li mã: Piɛɛl, Dzaã, Dzak, Andele, Filipe, Toma, Baatelemi, Matie, Dzak wu muaan a Alefe, Simɔ̃ wu áketa hɛ̃ me Dzelot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adzelot éli nkel a Ayuda ba y'ebal ki ɔ̃kiri a bɔ. Bɔ ákedzwaan me ndɔɔ yi apaal ɔ̃kiri a bɔ onse okwɛn o baal a Lom.</char></note>, ye Yuda wu muaan a Dzak. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Ãtsoo mbueel, bɔ ákebvɔɔn m'obuɛɛn, y'akaal ke kwɛ, ye Mali wu ngoo a Yeso, ye baan-ngoo a Yeso.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />M'ãtsoo omɔ̃, akiool onse ab'ɔ̃nkam y'ãku-mbuaal (120) abvɔɔn. Piɛɛl ayetɛɛn onse bɔ, obvi oyɛɛn bubu: <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />«Baan-ngoo a mɛ̃, ebvaan kwɛn asa ãndɔɔ m'élieel Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã m'ɔ̃nywã a David, me ndɔɔ a Yuda. Ndɛ wu Yuda áli mbiri a b'asiin Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Ndɛ áli ngɔmɔ̃ onse bia-byɛ, bvool áli y'ɔ̃sal wu áwi ndɛ osa onge bia-byɛ. <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />– Me nzi yi afuru ndɛ m'obi b'esi ndɛ, ndɛ osuun nsie. Ndɛ obvi ɔ̃tswɛ ke nsie oŋɔ̃, ɔ̃la obɔɔl, ɛ̃la ɛ̃ mwiĩ mvieel bu ɛ̃tsɔɔn me nsie. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Baal a Yelusalem bueel ayɛɛ ndɔɔ oyɔ. Obobɔ, bɔ aloo nsie oyɔ m'ɔ̃nywã a bɔ m'Hakeledama, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri “nsie a ãkel”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bakyɛ atsam ndiri ɔ̃luo wa 18 ye wa 19 ãndɔɔ m'ébɛɛl Luk me ndɔɔ a Yuda.</char></note>.– <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan wu Ãnziĩ ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">“Yɔɔl kwɛn mboo a ndɛ ekal ndii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ abee ke yɔ okal”,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Bvool ndiri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">“Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul ɔ̃kyam awal ɔ̃sal a ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:26">Ãnz 69.26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:8">109.8</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Obobɔ, ebvaan kwɛn bia-byɛ esuaal mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ onse baal b'ákedzuu ye bia-byɛ, me lio lueel li ékebiri Mfam Yeso bia-byɛ m'ɔ̃kiri wueel, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />bɛɛn ŋ'éwi Dzaã ndɛ opongo, tiil ŋ'ábiri ndɛ ke ywel. M'emfa okyɛ, mbuul ondɛ àyɛɛn me ndɔɔ osiool o Yeso ye bia-byɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Bɔ asuo baal ange-buaal ba: Dzedzef wu ata hɛ̃ me Balasabas, wu aloo me Dzusitus, ye Matias. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Bɔ abuɛɛn bubu: «Mfam, yɛ wu yɛɛ ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ baal bueel, suo bee wu esueel yɛ onse baal ba ange-buaal, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />kwɛn onse ɔ̃sal wu ontam wu, ndɛ akiri mboo a Yuda yi esiil ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi ayi ke mboo yi ebvaan me ndɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Bɔ ati ebie, lɔ ebvi me Matias. Bɔ bu alɔ ndɛ onse nkel a antam kuun y'ɔ̃mɔ̃.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal osool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Ŋ'ekoo tsoo li pfuun li Pantekot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pantekot éli pfuun li Ayuda li ákesa ke mbee ãtsoo ãku-ãtaan (50) mã pfuun li Onduru (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lev 23.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-11">Det 16.1-11</ref></char>).</note>, akiool bueel abvɔɔn mboo ngamɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Enseel oŋɔ̃, nkyal yɛn onge mfel wa kokɔ yi efi ywel, ekɔɔn me nzɔ yueel yi éli bɔ me nsɛn. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Obobɔ, eluɔ onge ndam e mbaa epal, ekab nzuru, ebvi nkal ngɔmɔ̃-ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Bɔ bueel aluul m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, bu abvi ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃kyam oyɛɛn, m'emfa ki éketam Ɔ̃fel bɔ oyɛɛn.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Onkyel ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Ayuda b'ákuru nzuru me Nziã, b'áfi m'ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃ nsie mvieel, ákekal ke Yelusalem. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Ŋ'eyoo bɔ nkyal oyɔ, ekiin ebvi onse bɔ, bɔ akam bibi, ke ngwel wɛ mbuul mbwɛn a mbuul ákeyoo ŋ'ékeyɛɛn bɔ ɔ̃nywã a ndɛ wu ola. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Ebangɛɛ y'ɛ̃kam ɛ̃si bɔ. Bɔ bu ayɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Baal b'ayɛɛn ba k'Afi-Ngalile wɛ? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ndɔɔ mã yɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul onse bia-byɛ ayoo k'eyɛɛn bɔ ɔ̃nywã a ndyam wu ola? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Bia-byɛ eli Afi-Palat, Afi-Mede, Afi-Elam, bia-byɛ ekal ke nsie yi Medzopotame, yi Yude, yi Kapados, yi Ponte, y'Adzi, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />yi Filidzi, yi Pamfili, yi Edzipito, yi Libi yi eli tsotsoo a Silɛn, y'Afi-Lom. <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Bia-byɛ bueel ŋã, bɛn Ayuda b'emburu-ngoo, bɛn b'ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃kyam b'akiool onkɔɔ b'Ayuda, bɛn Afi-Kelet, bɛn Afi-Alabi, kwɛn ŋɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul onse bia-byɛ ayoo k'eyɛɛn bɔ ãndɔɔ m'ɛ̃kam m'esi Nziã, onse ɔ̃nywã a ndɛ wu ola!» <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Bɔ bueel aluul m'ɛ̃kam bvool ãyal ãfi. Bɔ ákeyɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Otsɛn o ndɔɔ yi omã?» <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Kɛn a baal bakyɛ ákesɔɔl akiool ndiri: «Bɔ oŋɔ̃ mbal ãbɔɔ bɔ mam!»<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piɛɛl oyɛɛn y'embuul e baal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Obobɔ, Piɛɛl otɛɛn y'antam kuun y'ɔ̃mɔ̃, ondɛɛl nkii, bu alieel baal bubu: «Byɛ b'Afi-Yude ye byɛ bueel b'ekal ke Yelusalem, epio ãtswi, eyoo ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃, bvool ekwaal otsɛn o m'ãbwel! <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Baal ba mbal k'ãbɔɔ onge b'etsam byɛ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bia-byɛ ŋã kɛn eli me lio li bva li epal. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Kɛn a ŋã, ŋ'asi ãndɔɔ m'élieel Dzowel wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, ndiri:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />Nziã oyɛɛn bubu: “M'ãtsoo ã tɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">mɛ̃ ekieel esa kwɛn Ɔ̃fel a mɛ̃ akɔɔn me baal bueel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">baan a byɛ b'abɔɔl ye b'akaal akieel ayɛɛn ãndɔɔ m'ãfa ola mɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">ãnsanga ã byɛ ãkieel ãkal y'emwɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">ekukwel e byɛ ekieel eluaal ãnduaal.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Taa-taa bam, m'ãtsoo omɔ̃, mɛ̃ ekieel esa kwɛn Ɔ̃fel a mɛ̃ akɔɔn m'asal a mɛ̃, ekal b'abɔɔl, ekal b'akaal,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">bɔ akieel ayɛɛn ãndɔɔ m'ãfa ola mɛ̃.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Mɛ̃ ekieel esa ãndɔɔ m'ɛ̃kam ke ywel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ekieel esa eliĩ me nsie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">Ekieel ekal y'ãkel, ye mbaa, ye yoo.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Tal ekieel ekɔɔl empeel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">nswii akieel akɔɔl ãkel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">tiil ye k'ekoo tsoo e Mfam, tsoo e ndɛ li enɛn, tsoo e ndɛ li omfam.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />M'emfa okyɛ, mbuul ndyam wueel wu akieel ata Mfam mbel akieel abvuul.”<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Byɛ baal b'Isalayel, eyoo ãyɛɛn mã: Byɛ eyɛɛ ngesɛ wɛn Yeso wa Nadzalet oli mbuul wɛn me nkuul a ndɛ, Nziã osi emvieel, y'emwã y'eliĩ onse byɛ. Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãsuo byɛ kwɛn Yeso ofi ola Nziã. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Mbuul ondɛ, átiɔ byɛ ndɛ. Nziã áyɛɛ ndɔɔ oyɔ bam ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, bvool áwɛɛ yɔ. Byɛ embaal ndɛ m'ɔ̃kiri ŋ'ebɛɛl byɛ ndɛ m'enkulusu me nkuul a baal bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Kɛn a Nziã oseel ndɛ, bu apaal ndɛ onse mpal a epfu, ke ngwel wɛ epfu ale k'ekoo m'obvel ndɛ mpɛn wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Nzal-a-ŋɛn David áyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a Yeso bubu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">“Mɛ̃ ékemwɛn Mfam Nziã ãlio mbueel ke nkwel a mɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ oli me kuɔɔl e mɛ̃ ki elam, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbee otiɔɔl.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ɔ̃kwal a mɛ̃ oluul m'esɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃ ãli m'osia mpaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">Nzuru a mɛ̃ ekieel ewuun onse kaã.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ kieel k'ayiri mɛ̃ k'ola o b'ákwi-ákwi wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">yɛ kieel k'asuul kwɛn mɛ̃ wu nkuru nzuru me yɛ mbwal onse mpiɛɛn wɛ.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Yɛ suo mɛ̃ ãnkuul m'elaã,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">Yɛ akieel aluul mɛ̃ m'esɛ ke nkwel a yɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Baan-ngoo a mɛ̃, emeeyɔɔl mɛ̃ mengyɛɛn byɛ bam kal-a-kal bubu: Nkiɔɔn a bia-byɛ David ákwi, ádziool ndɛ, mpiɛɛn a ndɛ eli kɛn ola bia-byɛ tiil nonɔ̃ ŋã. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Onge bɛn ndɛ áli ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, ndɛ áyɛɛ kwɛn Nziã álab ndɛ ɔ̃kyel wɛn ndɛ akieel amviaal ngɔmɔ̃ onse atiɔɔl a ndɛ nsɛn nkal a kiri e ndɛ li okwɛn. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />David ŋ'ámwɛn ŋ'ɛ̃kwel osiool o Mãsia, ndɛ bu ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ndɛ ndiri k'áyiri ndɛ k'ola o b'ákwi-ákwi wɛ, nzuru a ndɛ k'ébwel onse mpiɛɛn wɛ.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Yeso ondɛ, Nziã aseel ndɛ, bia-byɛ bueel emwɛn ndɔɔ oyɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Andɛɛl ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi akal me kuɔɔl e Nziã ki elam. Me ba ŋã, ndɛ oyɔɔ Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu éwi Taal lɔɔ, ndɛ bu asi kwɛn ndɛ okɔɔn me bee, onge b'emwɛn byɛ, onge b'eyoo byɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Ke ngwel wɛ, k'eli David mbuul wu oyɛn ywel wɛ, kɛn a ndyam oyɛɛn bubu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">“Mfam Nziã olieel Mfam a mɛ̃ bubu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">Bva nsɛn me kuɔɔl e mɛ̃ ki elam,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />tiil ye k'esa mɛ̃ kwɛn yɛ dziaal ataal a yɛ m'odziaal.”<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Yɔɔl kwɛn yam li Isalayel lueel eyɛɛ ngesɛ bubu: Yeso wu ébɛɛl byɛ m'enkulusu ondɛ, Nziã osuul ndɛ Mfam, bvool osuul ndɛ Mãsia!»<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akiool amiil atyel (3.000)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Ŋ'eyoo baal ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃dzueel, bɔ bu afuul Piɛɛl y'antam bakyɛ bubu: «Baan-ngoo, bee eyii bwɛn esa?» <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Piɛɛl obveel bɔ bubu: «Ekaal ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ, bvool yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul onse byɛ awal opongo me nkuũ a Yeso Mãsia. M'emfa okyɛ, Nziã àdzeel ãbi ã byɛ, bvool àwa byɛ Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Ke ngwel wɛ, lɔɔ eli li byɛ, li baan a byɛ, li atiɔɔl a byɛ, ye baal bueel b'ali lela, b'ekieel eta Mfam wu Nziã a bia-byɛ mbel.»<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Piɛɛl bvool olieel ãndɔɔ ãkyam bibi, me ndɔɔ yi awa bɔ mpɛn, bvool yi asa kwɛn bɔ akiool. Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Epal onse baal b'abi-abi ba nonɔ̃ ba.» <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Baal b'akiool m'eyɛɛn Piɛɛl awel opongo. Tsoo olɔ, baal nku-a-nku amiil atyel (3.000) akool onse akiool ba tsɔɔn.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkel a akiool b'ɛ̃kwel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Akiool k'ákeywɛn k'anɔɔn ãndɔɔ m'ékeyiool antam wɛ, k'ákeywɛn k'akal mboo mɔ̃ me dzii e Nziã wɛ, k'ákeywɛn k'adza ɔ̃laan a Mfam mboo mɔ̃ wɛ, k'ákeywɛn k'abuɛɛn mboo mɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Antam ákesa ãndɔɔ m'ɛ̃kam y'emvieel bibi, obobɔ baal áli ye buɔ bibi. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Akiool bueel áli mboo mɔ̃, eluɔ bvieel bvi éli a bɔ éli bvoo. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Bɔ áketiɔ ãnsie ã bɔ, y'eluɔ bvi éli a bɔ. Bɔ bueel ákekab nzi yi ékebɔɔ bɔ, ákewa mbuul bwɛn a mbuul m'emfa e kɔɔ e ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Tsoo bwɛn a tsoo, bɔ ákemwɛɛn kɛn omwɛɛn ke Nzɔ a Nziã ãtsam ngãmɔ̃, bɔ ákedza ɔ̃laan a Mfam mboo mɔ̃, bvool ákedza mboo mɔ̃ k'ãnzɔ ã bɔ y'esɛ, ondɛɛl o nzuru pyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Bɔ ákelweel Nziã, baal bueel ákedzii bɔ. Obobɔ, tsoo bwɛn a tsoo Mfam ákelweel nkel a bɔ akiool.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Obvuul b'ekal ke Nzɔ a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Piɛɛl ye Dzaã áyɛn Nzɔ a Nziã me ndɔɔ ãbuɛɛn mã lio li ãtyel ŋ'emeekɔɔl tal. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, éli ye mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu ekal ki emburu-ngoo wu áli oŋɔ̃. Tsoo bwɛn a tsoo baal ákebiri ndɛ bvool ákesuul ndɛ k'ɔ̃nywã wu ekɔɔ e Nzɔ a Nziã wu ata m'«Ɔ̃nywã wu ompal», kwɛn ndɛ alaa nzi ola b'ákesam onse Nzɔ a Nziã. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Ŋ'emwɛn mbuul ondɛ Piɛɛl ye Dzaã ayesam onse Nzɔ a Nziã, ndɛ olaa nzi ola bɔ.<verse eid="ACT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Piɛɛl ye Dzaã alɔ ndɛ etɔ, Piɛɛl bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Tal bee!» <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Mbuul ondɛ otal bɔ y'onkyab bueel, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ áketa kaã li abɔɔ ki otwal ola bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Kɛn a Piɛɛl olieel ndɛ bubu: «Mɛ̃ ke ndi ye nzi wɛ, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ke ndi ye ɔɔl wɛ, kɛn a ki ndi a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ŋ'èwa yɛ kyɛ: Me nkuũ a Yeso Mãsia wa Nadzalet, tɛɛn bvool dzuu!»<verse eid="ACT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Piɛɛl osiin ndɛ me kuɔɔl ki elam, bu atɛɛl ndɛ. Kɛn a me lio alili, ntaã y'ãbwel ã mviil ã mbuul ondɛ ãwam, <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />ndɛ ayebiri kab, otɛɛn, obvi odzuu. Ndɛ osam onse Nzɔ a Nziã ye bɔ, adzuu, abiri ãkab m'esɛ, bvool alweel Nziã.<verse eid="ACT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Baal bam bueel amwɛn k'edzuu ndɛ ye k'elweel ndɛ Nziã. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Bɔ ayɛɛ ndiri ondɛ mbuul wu ákelaa nzi me nsɛn k'ɔ̃nywã a Nzɔ a Nziã wu ompal. Obobɔ, bɔ ongɛɛ obɔɔ, ɛ̃kam hɛ̃ ɛ̃si bɔ, me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ m'ãbwel me mbuul ondɛ.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãyɛɛn ã Piɛɛl onse Nzɔ a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Mbuul ondɛ k'ákeyɔɔl Piɛɛl ye Dzaã wɛ. Ŋ'emwɛn baal ndɛ, bɔ bueel akam bam bibi, atsuu ntiin ayedzii bɔ ke pfoo a Nzɔ wu ata me «pfoo a Salomɔ̃». <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Ŋ'emwɛn Piɛɛl obobɔ, ndɛ olieel baal bueel bubu: «Baal b'Isalayel, otsɛn omã b'ekam byɛ me m'ãbwel mã? Otsɛn omã b'etal byɛ bee obobɔ? Bee k'esi kwɛn mbuul wu adzuu me mpɛn a bee myam wɛ, k'eli hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ yɛn bee b'ekuru nzuru me Nziã wɛ! <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Nziã a Abalayam, Nziã a Isak, Nziã a Dzakab, Nziã a ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ, mbuul wu owi Yeso wu ɔ̃sal a ndɛ dzuun, ŋ'eboo ndɛ mbuul ondɛ. Kɛn a byɛ, byɛ etiɔ Yeso ondɛ, bvool etwɛn ndɛ ke nkwel a Pilate. Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, ndɛ wu Pilate ákuru k'ayɔɔl ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Byɛ, byɛ etwɛn mbuul wu ɔ̃nsensal bvool wa dzu, byɛ bu esɔɔ ola Pilate kwɛn ndɛ ayɔɔl byɛ mbuul wu abebam baal. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Obobɔ, byɛ ebam mbuul wu awa elaã li taa-taa. Kɛn a Nziã oseel ndɛ onse b'ákwi-b'ákwi, bee emwɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Meba ŋã, byɛ ebemwɛn mbuul wu, byɛ eyɛɛ ndɛ hɛ̃: Nkuũ a Yeso ewɛɛl ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bee eli y'okiool me ndɛ. Okiool me nkuũ a Yeso b'osi kwɛn ndɛ ndyam wueel akal kɛɛ-kɛɛ ke nkwel a byɛ.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Andoo a mɛ̃, eyɔɔl kwɛn mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ wɛn byɛ m'odzɛɛn esi, onge amfam a byɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Kɛn a Nziã ŋ'asi ãndɔɔ m'élieel ndɛ tsɔɔn m'ɛ̃nywã mi aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã bueel, ndiri: Mãsia a ndɛ ákeya fool omwɛn. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Oŋɔ̃ ekaal ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ bvool ekɔɔl ola Nziã, kwɛn ndɛ adzeel ãbi ã byɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Obobɔ, Mfam Nziã àwa byɛ ãlio m'owuun, bvool ndɛ àyuɔɔl byɛ Mãsia wu émeesuaal ndɛ me ndɔɔ a byɛ, Mãsia ondɛ Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Kɛn a meba ŋã, ebvaan kwɛn Yeso Mãsia akal kɛn ke ywel, tiil ye k'ekoo lio li èsuul Nziã eluɔ bvieel enyiɔɔn, onge b'élieel ndɛ tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn m'ɛ̃nywã mi aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a ndɛ ba ngel. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Obobɔ, Moyize áyɛɛn ndiri: “Mfam Nziã, Nziã a byɛ àpaal byɛ ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a ndɛ ngɔmɔ̃ wu àkal onge mɛ̃, onse baan-ngoo a byɛ. Ebvaan byɛ eyoo ndɛ m'ãndɔɔ mam mbueel m'ekieel eyɛɛn ndɛ byɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Kɛn a mbuul ndyam wueel wɛn k'àyoo ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ondɛ wɛ, àpaal ndɛ onse yam e Nziã, bvool àbam ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Det 18.15</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Andoo a mɛ̃, aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã bam bueel bɛɛn Samiɛɛn ye b'ánɔɔn a ndɛ, ál'ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ ãlio m'ãbebwel meba mã. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Byɛ eli atiɔɔl b'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã obɔ, bvool byɛ esam onse ondoo b'étɛn ndɛ y'ankiɔɔn a byɛ ŋ'élieel ndɛ Abalayam ndiri: “Mɛ̃ ekieel endɔɔl ãyam ã nsie mam mbueel kuɔɔl me yam e yɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Obɛ 22.18</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel kɛn me ndɔɔ a byɛ, kwɛn Nziã apaal ɔ̃sal a ndɛ, bvool ayuɔɔl byɛ ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi andɔɔl byɛ kuɔɔl, ŋ'embaal ndɛ mbuul bwɛn a mbuul onse ãndɔɔ ã ndɛ m'ãbi-ãbi.»<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Abiri Piɛɛl ye Dzaã ke mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Me lio li ékeyɛɛn Piɛɛl ye Dzaã kɛn y'embuul, angaa-a-Nziã ye mfam a ankiaal a Nzɔ a Nziã y'Asaduseyɛ̃, apal ola bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Bɔ ayii mpuru bibi me ndɔɔ yi emwɛn bɔ antam ange-buaal abeyiool baal bvool abetsal bɔ nsia ndiri, onge bɛn Yeso osiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi, b'ákwi-ákwi hɛ̃ akieel asiool. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Bɔ asiin bɔ, bu alɔ bwal tiil k'etsi bviil, ke ngwel wɛ tal al'emeeyel. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, baal bibi onse b'ayoo ãtee ã bɔ akiool Yeso. M'emfa okyɛ, ɔ̃bvɛn wu akiool otɔ nku-a-nku amiil ataan (5.000).<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Ŋ'etsi bviil, amfam b'Ayuda, y'akuul-kuul b'ola, y'ayiool b'ãngel abvɔɔn ke Yelusalem. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Ãnã wu ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn, ye Kayife, ye Dzaã, y'Alekesandele bvool ye baal bam bueel ba yam li ngaa-a-Nziã, áli oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Bɔ asuul Piɛɛl ye Dzaã kal-a-kal a bɔ, bu abvi bɔ ɛ̃mfuul ofuul ndiri: «Me mpɛn a nã yi eboo byɛ mbuul wu? Me nkuũ a nã yi esi byɛ obobɔ?»<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Obobɔ, Piɛɛl wu oluul m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, obveel bɔ bubu: «Amfam b'ola y'akuul-akuul, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />nonɔ̃, abvi bee ɛ̃mfuul ofuul me ndɔɔ obvɛ b'esi bee mbuul nga-elyam, bvool me ndɔɔ emfa ki ebvuul ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Ngesɛ! Ebvaan kwɛn byɛ bam bueel ye yam li Isalayel eyɛɛ ngesɛ wɛn, eli me mpɛn a nkuũ a Yeso Mãsia wa Nadzalet, yɛn mbuul wu otɛɛn ŋã ke nkwel a byɛ nzuru kɛɛ-kɛɛ. Yeso ondɛ, wu ébɛɛl byɛ m'enkulusu, bvool wu éseel Nziã. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Ndɛ wu Yeso oli mbuul wu eyɛɛn Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">“Nkɔɔn yɛn, byɛ b'atuu ebee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">yɔ eyii nkɔɔn yi nkiin a nzɔ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Ãnz 118.22</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Obvuul abɔɔ kɛn a me ndɛ. Nzal-a-ŋɛn, k'eli ye nkuũ nkyam yi éwi Nziã baal, yɛn bia-byɛ ol'ebvuul me yɔ wɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Ŋ'emwɛn baal a mbal yi nɛn ãŋã m'éli a Piɛɛl ye Dzaã, esi bɔ ɛ̃kam bibi, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ amwɛn kwɛn bɔ áli baal ba ngwel-a-ngwel, bɛn k'ási ekɔɔl wɛ. Bɔ bu ayeyɛɛ kwɛn Piɛɛl ye Dzaã b'áli ye Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Kɛn onge bɛn bɔ amwɛn mbuul wu ábvuul ondɛ tɛ tsotsoo antam ange-buaal, bɔ k'abebɔɔ ndɔɔ yi abveel wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Obobɔ, bɔ atam antam ndiri apal onse mbal yi nɛn. Bɔ abvi otsuun bam-a-bam ndiri: <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />«Bia-byɛ baal ba bwɛn esa bɔ? Ke ngwel wɛ, baal bam bueel b'akal ke Yelusalem ayɛɛ bam taa-taa ndiri bɔ baal b'asi emvieel ki, bia-byɛ olɔ k'ebee ndɔɔ oyɔ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Oŋɔ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn nsia yi ebee onse baal bam bueel okɔɔn, bia-byɛ edzuru bɔ ãtswi wɛn bɔ mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ me nkuũ a Yeso obeyɛɛn wɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Obobɔ, ati Piɛɛl ye Dzaã mbel, bu awi bɔ ãnkunkwa bam ndiri abee bvool obeyɛɛn, wuo obeyiool me nkuũ a Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Kɛn a Piɛɛl ye Dzaã abveel bɔ bubu: «Emeetal bam me byam: Eli ngesɛ ke nkwel a Nziã kwɛn bee eyoo ndyam wu Nziã wuo eyoo byɛ? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Me b'otal bee, bee k'ekoo m'okal pi m'ãndɔɔ m'emwɛn bee ye m'eyoo bee wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, baal a mbal adzuru bɔ k'ãtswi bvool, bu ayɔɔl bɔ. Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ k'abɔɔ elyal ki awa bɔ etumbu wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn baal bueel ákelweel Nziã m'ãndɔɔ m'ã́bwel. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Mbuul wu ábvuul m'emvieel okyɛ áli me mvel ãku-ãnã (40) y'esiɔ.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãbuɛɛn m'akiool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Ke mbee a ŋ'ayɔɔl Piɛɛl ye Dzaã, bɔ ayɛn ol'andoo a bɔ, bu alieel bɔ mam bueel m'éyɛɛn angaa-a-Nziã b'anɛn y'akuul-kuul bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Ŋ'eyoo bɔ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ bam bueel ãtsam ngãmɔ̃ abuɛɛn Nziã bubu: «Mfam, yɛ mbuul wu ábuo ywel, ye nsie, y'ãdza ye bvieel bvi eli onse eluɔ obvɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Yɛ mbuul wɛn me nkuul yi Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, áyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã a nkiɔɔn a bee David wu ɔ̃sal a yɛ ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">“Ndɔɔ mã yi eli ɛ̃kiri onse kɔɔ-kɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">bvool yɛn ãyam ãbekuru ãmfoo mɛn otsɛn pyɛ?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Akwɛn a nsie awel ɔ̃yɛɛl me ndɔɔ a mvel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">bvool amfam abvool mfoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">m'obee o Mfam Nziã ye Mãsia a ndɛ.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Ãnz 2.1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Ke ngwel wɛ, eli bam taa-taa kwɛn Elode ye Ponse Pilate ál'abvool mfoo onse bviil li y'anzii, bvool ye baal b'Isalayel. Éli m'obee b'ɔ̃sal a yɛ wu ɔ̃nsensal, Yeso, wu ésuul yɛ Mãsia. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Obobɔ, bɔ asi ãndɔɔ mam mbueel m'édzii yɛ, ye m'ékuru yɛ ye waan lueel. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Me lio li, Mfam, tal emfa ki eŋaan bɔ bee, oŋɔ̃ sa kwɛn asal a yɛ atsal Nsia a yɛ y'ãŋã bibi. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Ndɛɛl kuɔɔl e yɛ, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ baal abɔɔ obvuul, bvool kwɛn eliĩ y'emvieel emɔɔn me nkuũ a Yeso wu ɔ̃sal a yɛ wu Ɔ̃nsensal.»<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Ŋ'eman bɔ obuɛɛn, nsie ebvi nzuru onziool ke mboo yi éli bɔ, bɔ bam bueel aluul m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, bu atsal Nsia a Nziã y'ãŋã mbueel.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akiool akab eluɔ e bɔ onse bam-a-bam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Akiool bam bueel ákekal m'ɔ̃dzi, ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃, ãtsam ngãmɔ̃. Mbuul wu ákeyɛɛn ndiri eluɔ e ndɛ bvi ndyam k'áli wɛ, kɛn eluɔ bvieel éli bvi bvoo. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Ye waan li nɛn lueel, antam ákesuo kwɛn Yeso Mãsia ásiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi, nyiĩ a Nziã yi nɛn éli ye bɔ bueel. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Mbuul si ekal ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ wu ákekaan m'eluɔ k'áli wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bueel b'áli y'ãnguun wuo ãnzɔ áketiɔ mɔ̃, ákeya ye nzi oyɔ, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />ákewa yɔ ol'antam. Bɔ ákekab yɔ, mbuul bwɛn a mbuul ákebɔɔ boo li ekoo me kɔɔ e ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Obobɔ Dzedzef, wu éloo antam me Balanabas, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri «mbuul wu awa baal mpɛn», wu áli mbuul wa yam li Lebvi wu ola bo Swipele, <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />otiɔ nguun a ndɛ, bu ayewa nzi ol'antam.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananias ye Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Éli ye mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Ananias. Ndɛ y'ɔ̃kal a ndɛ Safila atiɔ nsie yi bɔ hɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Ndɛ olwɔɔn epie e nzi mfoo y'ɔ̃kal, oyewa antam epie ki esiil. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Kɛn a Piɛɛl olieel ndɛ bubu: «Ananias, ndɔɔ mã yi ewi yɛ Ɔ̃pfu nkuul yi asam onse ɔ̃kwal a yɛ? Yɛ apfuru Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal bvool alwɔɔn epie e nzi ki etiɔ yɛ nsie! <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Yɛ ale koo k'asuul nsie a yɛ ekal wuo k'asa b'edzii yɛ me nzi yi etiɔ yɛ yɔ. Ndɔɔ mã yi ebɔɔ yɛ ãtsam m'asa ndɔɔ yi bubu? Yɛ ke baal pfuru wɛ, yɛ Nziã pfuru.» <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ŋ'eyoo Ananias ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, ndɛ obvi, bu akwi. Baal bueel b'ayoo ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, buɔ bo bibi obɔɔ bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Ãnsanga ãtɛɛn, ãkuru ebiĩ, ãbiri kyɛ, bu ãyedziool.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Ke mbee ãlio ab'ãtyel, ɔ̃kal a Ananias osam, k'ayɛɛ m'ãbwel wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Piɛɛl ofuul ndɛ ndiri: «Meyɛɛn mɛ̃, byɛ nsie a byɛ m'ɔ̃bvɛn ondɛ etiɔ yɔ?» Ɔ̃kaal obveel ndiri: «Taa-taa, m'ɔ̃bvɛn ondɛ etiɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Kɛn a Piɛɛl olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Ke ndɔɔ mã yi ekuru yɛ mfoo y'ɔ̃lam me ndɔɔ yi embio Ɔ̃fel a Mfam? Yoo, enkiin e b'afi ɔ̃lam a yɛ odziool emeetɔ k'ɔ̃nywã a nzɔ, bɔ ŋ'abiri yɛ hɛ̃.» <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Kɛn a me lio lili, ɔ̃kaal ondɛ obvi ke nsɛn a ntaã e Piɛɛl, bu akwi. Ŋ'esam ãnsanga, bɔ ayebɔɔ ndɛ amaakwa. Bɔ andɛɛl ndɛ, bu ayedziool ndɛ tsotsoo y'ɔ̃lam. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Buɔ bo bibi osam onse Ebvɔɔn lam lueel ye baal bueel b'ayoo ãndɔɔ omɔ̃.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Antam asi emvieel bvi bibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Me mviɔɔl mi antam, eliĩ y'emvieel bibi ékemɔɔn onse baal. Akiool bam bueel ákebvɔɔn onse ekɔɔ e Nzɔ a Nziã ke pfoo a Salomɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Onse baal b'asiil, mbuul ɔ̃kyam wu ákembio k'asyal tsotsoo a bɔ k'áli bam wɛ, kɛn a baal bam bueel ákewal bɔ ye bvɛɛ bibi. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Embuul e baal ékelɔɔ kɛn olɔɔ, akaal y'abɔɔl ákekiool Mfam, bvool ákekool onse nkel a akiool. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />M'emfa okyɛ, baal abvi ba y'ãluũ opaal nkal abal-bal, ákesuul bɔ nkal ãntal wuo nkal ekal, me ndɔɔ yɛn ŋ'ebwel Piɛɛl, onkyam edzel-a-dzel e ndɛ enywɛn me mbuul ɔ̃bi pyɛ onse bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Embuul e baal hɛ̃ ékefa ãla mã nku-a-nku a Yelusalem. Bɔ abiri b'áli y'ãluũ ye b'áli y'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi, bɔ bueel abvuul.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Osiin y'opaal b'antam onse bwal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Obobɔ, ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn ye baal b'áli ye ndɛ bueel, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri nkel a Asaduseyɛ̃, aluul m'ɔ̃kwal-nsɔɔ me ndɔɔ antam, bɔ bu akuru k'asa ndɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Bɔ asiin antam, bu alɔ bɔ bwal e baal bueel. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Kɛn a me tsia, ãnzwel ã Mfam Nziã ngãmɔ̃ ãyedzweel edzoo e bwal, ãpaal antam, bu ãlieel bɔ bubu: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />«Eyi onse Nzɔ a Nziã, bvool eyɛɛn baal ãyɛɛn mam mbueel m'omwiĩ b'alili.» <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Antam ayoo ãndɔɔ omɔ̃. Epal-epal kwɔɔl, bɔ ayɛn onse Nzɔ a Nziã, bu abvi oyiool.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn ye baal b'áli ye ndɛ abvool baal a mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda, ye nkel a akuul-kuul b'Isalayel, bu ayuɔɔl baal ayewal antam onse bwal.<verse eid="ACT 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ŋ'etɔ ambwel-mbwel, bɔ k'amwɛn antam onse bwal wɛ. Bɔ akɔɔl, bu ayɛɛn bubu: <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />«Bee eyebɔɔ bwal lam m'okuru, ambwel-mbwel b'akiaal ali ke nkwel edzoo. Kɛn a ŋ'edzweel bee edzoo, bee k'emwɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ onse okɔ wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Ŋ'eyoo bɔ nsia oyɔ, mfam a ankiaal a Nzɔ a Nziã y'amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã ãyal ãfi me ndɔɔ antam, bɔ abvi bam-a-bam ofuul ndiri: «Oyɔ olɔ ndɔɔ mã yi ebwel?» <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Etɔ oŋɔ̃, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ oyi oyewa bɔ nsia ndiri: «Emeeyoo, baal b'elɔ byɛ bwal ayii onse Nzɔ a Nziã abetee baal!»<verse eid="ACT 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Obobɔ, mfam a ankiaal a Nzɔ a Nziã oyɛn y'ambwel-mbwel a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi ayewal antam. Kɛn a bɔ k'asi antam me kɔɔ-kɔɔ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ ákebal owɛɛl baal ayebam bɔ b'ambwel-mbwel m'ãnkɔɔn. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Ŋ'eyi bɔ y'antam, bɔ asuul bɔ ke nkwel a mbal yi nɛn. Ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn obvi bɔ ɛ̃mfuul ofuul bubu: <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />«Bee k'ewi byɛ ãnkunkwa wɛn byɛ bam me nkuũ yi obeyiool wɛ wɛ? Emeetal kwɛn ãtee ã byɛ ãmaãkɔɔn Yelusalem ndyam wueel: Byɛ edzii k'esa kwɛn etseb ki epfu e mbuul wu ebva nkal ɔ̃tswɛ a bee!»<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Kɛn a Piɛɛl y'antam bakyɛ abveel bubu: «Ebvaan alweel Nziã, ke baal wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Nziã a ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ áseel Yeso wɛn byɛ, byɛ ebam ndɛ ŋ'ebɛɛl byɛ ndɛ m'enkulusu. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Nziã ondɛɛl ndɛ ke kuɔɔl e ndɛ ki elam, bu asuul ndɛ Mfam y'Ɔ̃mvuul, me ndɔɔ yɛn baal b'Isalayel akaal ɛ̃kwal, bvool abɔɔ odzeel b'ãbi ã bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Bee eli baal b'eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ m'emwɛn bee, bee y'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu ewi Nziã baal b'abelweel ndɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Ŋ'eyoo baal a mbal ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ mpuru eyi bibi, bu ayi abii k'abam antam. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Kɛn a Ɔ̃falisaye ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ wɛn nkuũ Gamalyel otɛɛn kal-a-kal a mbal. Ndɛ áli ɔ̃yiool-ãngel wu ɔ̃nɛn wu ékewa baal bueel bvɛɛ. Ndɛ otam ndiri apaal antam onkwel-a-nzi me ndɔɔ a muaan-lio. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ olieel mbal bubu: «Baal b'Isalayel, ekal y'onkyab me b'eyesa byɛ baal obɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Kɛn eyiil wɛ, bia-byɛ emwɛn mbuul wɛn nkuũ Tehudas wɛn ndiri áli mbuul wu ɔ̃nɛn bvool wɛn baal nku-a-nku ɛ̃nkam ɛ̃nã (400) ánɔɔn. Abam ndɛ, bueel b'ákenɔɔn a ndɛ atsɔɔn, nkel a ndɛ bu ekwi. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Ke mbee a ndɛ, Dzuda wu ɔ̃fi-Ngalile opal, me lio li ɔ̃tsiɔ. Ndɛ odzuru ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal ke mbee a ndɛ. Abam ndɛ hɛ̃, bueel b'ákenɔɔn a ndɛ bu atsɔɔn. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn: Ebee baal ba obesiɔɔl, eyɔɔl bɔ ayi. Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn ãtsam y'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ mi ɛ̃fa ola baal, obvɛ ekieel efa. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Kɛn ãtsam y'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ okɛɛn mi ɛ̃fa ola Nziã bam taa-taa, byɛ k'ekoo m'otɛɛl o mɔ̃ wɛ. Ebee okie k'eyedzwaan eta ye Nziã!» Baal a mbal akiool ɔ̃dzoo a Gamalyel. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Bɔ ati antam mbel, atam kwɛn apfel bɔ ɔ̃dzii, bvool awi bɔ ãnkunkwa ndiri abee me nkuũ a Yeso bvool obeyɛɛn, bu apaal bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Obobɔ, antam ambal ke mbal. Bɔ bam bueel áli onse esɛ, ke ngwel wɛ Nziã owi bɔ dzuun me fool li emwɛn bɔ me ndɔɔ a nkuũ a Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Obobɔ, tsoo bwɛn a tsoo, bɔ k'ákeyɔɔl k'atee wuo k'atsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ ndiri Yeso oli Mãsia wɛ, ekal ke Nzɔ a Nziã, ekal ke nzɔ bwɛn a nzɔ.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Baal nsiaan b'asueel me ndɔɔ yi awuaal antam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />M'ãtsoo omɔ̃, onge bɛn ɔ̃bvɛn wu ayio ákelɔɔ kɛn olɔɔ, akiool b'Ayuda b'ákeyɛɛn ɔ̃nywã wa Ngelek abvi onyiin me ndɔɔ akiool b'Ayuda b'ákeyɛɛn onywã wu Ebel. Bɔ ákeyɛɛn ndiri tsoo bwɛn a tsoo li ákekab bvi-odza, ákedzɛɛn akaal a bɔ b'apfiil. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Obobɔ, antam ange-kuun ye buaal abvool ayio bam bueel, bu alieel bɔ bubu: «K'eli ngesɛ wɛ kwɛn bee eyɔɔl k'etee Endɔɔ e Nziã, me ndɔɔ okab o bvi-odza. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Andoo a dzii, obɔ otsɛn bɛn, esuaal baal nsiaan onse byɛ b'ebetuɛɛn baal, b'aluul m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal y'ontwel. Obobɔ, bee èwa ɔ̃sal ondɛ me bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Me b'otal bee, bee ènɔɔn k'ebuɛɛn ye k'etee Endɔɔ e Nziã.»<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Ebvɔɔn lueel ekiool ɔ̃dzoo ondɛ. Obobɔ, bɔ asueel Etyɛn, wu áluul m'okiool y'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal. Bɔ hɛ̃ asueel Filipe, ye Polokɔɔl, ye Nikanɔɔl, ye Timɔ̃, ye Paamenas, ye Nikolas wa bviil li Antioswe wɛn k'áli Ɔ̃yuda wu emburu-ngoo wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ ákekiool ãngel m'Ayuda. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Bɔ ayi ye bɔ ol'antam. Antam abuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a bɔ, andɔɔl bɔ mviɔɔl.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Endɔɔ e Nziã éketsɔɔn kɛn otsɔɔn, ɔ̃bvɛn wu ayio ákelɔɔ kɛn olɔɔ ke Yelusalem. Onkyam angaa-a-Nziã bibi akiool Yeso.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asiin Etyɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Etyɛn oluul me waan ye nyiĩ a Nziã. Obobɔ, ndɛ obvi ãndɔɔ m'ɛ̃kam ye m'emwã osa onse baal. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Kɛn a baal ke kwɛ ba nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn yi ata me «nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn yi ankyal b'apeel», y'Ayuda b'ola bo Silɛn, b'Alekesandele, ba Silisi ye b'Adzi, abvi otsuun ye ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Kɛn a bɔ k'ákekoo k'abal ndɛ wɛ, me ndɔɔ ãyal m'oyɛɛn m'ékewa Ɔ̃fel ndɛ.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />M'emfa okyɛ, bɔ afuru baal nzi, kwɛn baal obɔ ayɛɛn ndiri: «Bee eyoo Etyɛn asiaan Moyize ye Nziã!» <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Obobɔ, bɔ asi ndɛ nsiɔɔl ol'Ayuda b'oŋɔ̃, y'akuul-kuul, y'ayiool b'ãngel. Bɔ asyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, asiin ndɛ, bu abiri ndɛ mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Oŋɔ̃, bɔ apaal baal a mfya b'ákeburu ndɛ ãndɔɔ ndiri: «Mbuul wu emwɛn byɛ wu, k'abewuun wɛ m'oyɛɛn obi-obi me Nzɔ a Nziã yi ɔ̃nsensal, ye ngel a Moyize! <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Taa-taa bam, bee eyoo ndɛ ayɛɛn ndiri: “Yeso wa Nadzalet akieel atsal Nzɔ a Nziã yi, bvool akieel aswɛɛl onkɔɔ b'éwi Moyize bia-byɛ.”» <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Baal a mbal bam bueel alɔ Etyɛn etɔ, bɔ amwɛn kwɛn osu o ndɛ óli onge osu b'ãnzwel.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Oyɛɛn b'Etyɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn ofuul Etyɛn bubu: «Ãndɔɔ m'abeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a yɛ omɔ̃, taa-taa ãli?» <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Etyɛn obveel bubu: «Baan-ngoo y'atal a mɛ̃, emeeyoo mɛ̃! Nziã nga-omfam ápal ol'Abalayam wu nkiɔɔn a bia-byɛ, me lio li ékekal ndɛ kɛn ke Medzopotame, ye k'eyɛn ndɛ okal k'Halã. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Nziã álieel ndɛ ndiri: “Mbal k'ɔ̃kiri a yɛ, siil eburu e yɛ, yi k'ɔ̃kiri wu ekieel esuo mɛ̃ yɛ.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Obɛ 12.1</ref></char></note>” <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Obobɔ, Abalayam ombal ɔ̃kiri wa Swalade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔ̃kiri wa Swalade abeta hɛ̃ me Babilone (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 11:28">Obɛ 11.28</ref></char>).</note>, bu ayekal ke bviil li Halã. Ke mbee a ŋ'ekwi tal a ndɛ, Nziã osuul ndɛ k'ɔ̃kiri wu eli byɛ nonɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Nziã k'áwi Abalayam nsie onse ɔ̃kiri ondɛ wɛ, onkyam embo-mboo ki asuul etaã. Kɛn a ndɛ áwi Abalayam lɔɔ ndiri ɔ̃kiri ondɛ akieel akal wa ndɛ ye yam e ndɛ li eya ke mbee a ndɛ. Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Abalayam k'áli kɛn ye muaan wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Nziã bvool áyɛɛn ye ndɛ bubu: “Atiɔɔl a yɛ akieel ayekal onse ɔ̃kiri wu onzii. Okɔ obɔ, akieel akaal bɔ ankyal, bvool atuaal bɔ fool mvel ɛ̃nkam ɛ̃nã (400).” <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Kɛn a Nziã bvool álweel ndiri: “Mɛ̃ ekieel ewa ɔ̃kiri wu akaal bɔ ankyal etumbu, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ bɔ àmbal k'ɔ̃kiri ondɛ, àya ŋã me ndɔɔ yi alweel mɛ̃ ke mboo yi.” <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />M'emfa okyɛ, Nziã otɛn ondoo o ndɛ y'Abalayam. Eliĩ ki esuo ondoo obɔ, eli otsiil b'abɔɔl. Obobɔ, Abalayam ayeburu muaan a ndɛ Isak, ndɛ otsiil ndɛ me tsoo li mpuɔ̃, ke mbee a ŋ'aburu ndɛ. Isak osi emfa kiki me muaan a ndɛ Dzakab, Dzakab hɛ̃ osi bubu me baan a ndɛ, b'áli ankiɔɔn ange-kuun ye buaal b'ãyam ã bia-byɛ.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Baan a Dzakab, me ndɔɔ ɔ̃kwal-nsɔɔ, atiɔ Dzedzef wu mvɔɔl a bɔ kwɛn ndɛ ayesal onkyal k'Edzipito. Kɛn a Nziã áli ye ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />Obobɔ, Nziã opaal ndɛ onse fool lam lueel olɔ, owi ndɛ ãyal, bvool osi kwɛn Falahɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kwɛn a Edzipito adzii ndɛ. Falahɔ̃ bu asuul ndɛ mfam wa buaal wu Edzipito ye wa nzɔ a ndɛ yam yueel. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Tal kwɛn ɔ̃lɔɔ osam m'Edzipito kyam kieel ye Kanaan: Éli lio li fool bibi. Ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ k'abebɔɔ bvool ki adza wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Ŋ'eyoo Dzakab ndiri k'Edzipito éli ye nsia e bele, ndɛ otam baan a ndɛ b'áli ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ nsa yi ɛ̃kwel okɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Ŋ'eyɛn bɔ okɔ li nsa yuaal, Dzedzef osuo nzuru ola baan-ngoo a ndɛ, obobɔ Falahɔ̃ oyeyɛɛ ku éfi Dzedzef. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Dzedzef bu atam Dzakab wu tal a ndɛ owal, ye yam e ndɛ lam lueel li éli me baal ɛ̃kuun-nsiaan y'ataan (75). <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Dzakab bu ayɛn Edzipito. Ndɛ okwi okɔ, ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ hɛ̃ akwi okɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Abiri ebiĩ e bɔ ke Sisem, bvool adziool bvɛ k'ãpiɛɛn m'ésuun Abalayam me nzi ola baan b'Amɔɔl b'abɔɔl ke Sisem.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Ŋ'eyii ekoo lio li éwi Nziã Abalayam lɔɔ, baal b'Isalayel alɔɔ bvool ayii bam boo-boo k'Edzipito. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Ɔ̃kwɛn ɔ̃kyam wɛn k'áyɛɛ Dzedzef wɛ, okiri ke mpu k'Edzipito. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Ɔ̃kwɛn ondɛ opfeel yam e bia-byɛ, otueel ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ mpal, otam bɔ k'ayiri baan a bɔ b'abwee, kwɛn bɔ akwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Me lio olɔ, aburu Moyize, ndɛ áli y'ompal ke mviil ã Nziã. Akuul ndɛ onse nzɔ a tal a ndɛ tiil nswii tyel. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyiri eburu e ndɛ ndɛ, muaan a mfam Falahɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal otwel ndɛ, bu akuul ndɛ onge muaan a ndyam. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />M'emfa okyɛ, akuul Moyize onse ontwel bam bueel bo baal b'Edzipito. Ndɛ ákeyɛɛn bvool ákesa ãndɔɔ ye waan lueel. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Ŋ'ebɔɔ ndɛ mvel ãku-ãna (40), ndɛ okuru k'ayetal baan-ngoo a ndɛ b'Afi-Isalayel. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Ndɛ omwɛn ɔ̃fi-Edzipito abetuaal ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ mpal, ndɛ osam ongwel a ndɛ, bu abam ɔ̃fi-Edzipito. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Ndɛ áketsam ndiri baan-ngoo a ndɛ al'olɔ abɔɔ otsɛn ndiri Nziã abwel me ndɛ m'obvuul o bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Ela esiool, Moyize opal ke mboo yɛn baan-ngoo a ndɛ buaal ákedzwaan, ndɛ oyesoo bɔ mvel, m'obveel o bɔ ondoo. Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: “Andoo a mɛ̃, byɛ baan-ngoo eli, otsɛn omã b'ebetuaal byɛ bakyɛ mpal?” <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Kɛn a wu áketuaal wukyɛ mpal otsɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: “Wu osuul yɛ mfam wu atsiil ãndɔɔ ã bee nã? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Yɛ dzii k'abam mɛ̃ onge b'ebam yɛ ɔ̃fi-Edzipito ãtsio?” <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Ŋ'eyoo Moyize ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, ndɛ obal oyekal m'onzii k'ɔ̃kiri wa Madiã. Okɔ, ndɛ oburu baan b'abɔɔl buaal.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Ke mbee a mvel ãku-ãnã (40), ãnzwel ã Nziã ãpal ola ndɛ onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ ke nkio yi Sinayi, onse mbaa yi ékekaan me muaan-ɔ̃ti. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Ŋ'emwɛn Moyize obobɔ, ɛ̃kam ɛ̃si ndɛ bibi. Onge bɛn ndɛ al'ayii asyal tsotsoo me ndɔɔ yi atal, nkii a Mfam Nziã eyɛɛn ndɛ bubu: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />“Mɛ̃ ndi Nziã a ankiɔɔn a yɛ, Nziã a Abalayam, Nziã a Isak, Nziã a Dzakab.” Moyize obvi otiɔɔl me buɔ, k'abekoo k'aseel mviil wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Obobɔ, Mfam Nziã olieel ndɛ bubu: “Dzuul asimpal a yɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mboo yi eli yɛ yi, eli nsie yi ɔ̃nsensal. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Mɛ̃ mwɛn mpal a baal a mɛ̃ k'Edzipito. Mɛ̃ ngyoo elel e bɔ, mɛ̃ bu nsool me ndɔɔ yi epaal bɔ. Meba ŋã, yi: Mɛ̃ ètam yɛ Edzipito.”<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Moyize wuwu ondɛ, wɛn tsɔɔn bɔ ábee ndiri: “Wu osuul yɛ mfam wu atsiil ãndɔɔ ã bee nã?” Ndɛ ondɛ wu étam Nziã onge mfam bvool onge ɔ̃mvuul, me nkuul ãnzwel m'ã́pal ola ndɛ onse muaan-ɔ̃ti. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Ndɛ wu Moyize wu ápaal bɔ k'Edzipito. Ndɛ ási emvieel y'emwã onse ɔ̃kiri ondɛ, k'Ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa mã Bɛ bvool k'ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ mvel ãku-ãnã (40). <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Moyize ondɛ hɛ̃ wu áyɛɛn baal b'Isalayel ndiri: “Nziã àpaal byɛ ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a ndɛ ngɔmɔ̃, wu àkal onge mɛ̃, onse baan-ngoo a byɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Me lio li ébvɔɔn yam onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ, ndɛ mbuul wu áli ɔ̃kaal-ãndɔɔ mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a yam y'ãnzwel m'ã́keyɛɛn ye ndɛ nkal a nkio yi Sinayi. Obobɔ, Moyize oyɔɔ ãyɛɛn ã Nziã m'elaã me ndɔɔ yi awa bia-byɛ mɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Kɛn ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ ábee k'akiool ndɛ, bɔ áketiɔ ndɛ eboo. Onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ, bɔ al'amaabvool Edzipito. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Obobɔ, bɔ alieel Alona ndiri: “Buo bee anziã b'etiɔ b'abiri bee. Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ wu Moyize wu apaal bee k'Edzipito, bee k'eyɛɛ ndɔɔ yi eyi me ndɛ okɔ wɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Obobɔ, bɔ abuo etiɔ ki muaan-ngwɛmbɛ, bu awi kyɛ ãkab. Bɔ abɛɛl pfuun me ndɔɔ eluɔ ki ebuo bɔ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ bam. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />M'emfa okyɛ, Nziã otiɔ bɔ eboo, ndɛ oyɔɔl bɔ alweel eluɔ bvi engal ke ywel, onge b'ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan wu aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">“Yam li Isalayel, wu éwi byɛ anyam y'ãkab mãkyɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">mvel ãku-ãnã (40) onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ, mɛ̃?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Mfya! Kɛn a byɛ ebiri nzɔ yi abebuɛɛn Molok.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Byɛ ebiri hɛ̃ etiɔ kyɛn onge ngam-a-ngam wa nziã a byɛ Lafan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Obvɛ etiɔ bvi ebuo byɛ m'olweel o bvɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ èyuɔɔl byɛ onzii ke mboo yi enduru Babilon me la.”<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ, ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ áli ye nzɔ yi m'ebaan bvi anyam, yi ékesuo kwɛn Nziã áli ye bɔ. Moyize átuu yɔ onge b'étam Nziã ndɛ. Ndɛ ási yɔ m'emvɛɛl li ésuo ndɛ ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Baal b'áyi ke mbee ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ awel nzɔ oyɔ. Ŋ'éli Dzodzue mbiri a bɔ, bɔ awel ɔ̃kiri wu ãyam m'étswɛɛl Nziã ke nkwel a bɔ. Bɔ ayi ye nzɔ oyɔ onse ɔ̃kiri ondɛ, yɔ ekal oŋɔ̃ tiil me lio li David. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Ndɛ wu David obɔɔ nyiĩ ke mviil ã Nziã. Obobɔ, ndɛ osɔɔ nkuul yi atuu Nziã a Dzakab nzɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Kɛn a Salomɔ̃ wu átuu Nziã nzɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Ke yam, Nziã-a-Mpuu k'abekal onse ãnzɔ m'atuu me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal wɛ, onge b'élieel Mfam Nziã m'ɔ̃nywã wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a ndɛ, ndiri:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />“Ywel eli kiri e mɛ̃ li okwɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">nsie eli mboo yi edziaal ntaã e mɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Nzɔ yi etuu byɛ mɛ̃ yi emã,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">oyɔ mboo mã yi ekieel ewuun mɛ̃?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Wu ábuo eluɔ obvɛ bvieel ke mɛ̃ wɛ?”»<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Etyɛn bvool olieel bubu: «Byɛ baal b'ɛ̃tswɛ mpɛn eli, byɛ ekuru ɛ̃kwal y'ãtswi ã byɛ. Byɛ ãlio mbueel ebeta enkyam y'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, emfa ngemɔ̃ onge ankiɔɔn a byɛ! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Mbuul nã onse aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã wɛn ankiɔɔn a byɛ k'átueel mpal wɛ? Bɔ abam b'ákeliaal nsia yi oya o mbuul wa dzu, wu Mãsia. Meba ŋã, byɛ, byɛ etiɔ ndɛ bvool ebam ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Byɛ b'eyɔɔ ngel a Nziã me nkuul a ãnzwel, byɛ ebee yɔ okiaal!»<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Epfu li Etyɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Ŋ'eyoo baal a mbal ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ ayoo nkyee bibi, bu ayii atiɛɛn miin me mpuru me ndɔɔ Etyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Kɛn Etyɛn oluul m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, oseel mviil ke ywel, omwɛn okuun o Nziã, Yeso tɛ me kuɔɔl e Nziã ki elam. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Obobɔ ndɛ oyɛɛn ndiri: «Eyoo, mɛ̃ mwɛn ywel edzweel nzuru, Muaan a mbuul tɛ me kuɔɔl e Nziã ki elam!» <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Ŋ'eyoo bɔ ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, bɔ akuru ãtswi, abvi ɛ̃sɔɔl okuaal mi bibi. Ekuu ngemɔ̃, bɔ ayiool m'Etyɛn, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />apaal ndɛ onse bviil, bu abvi ndɛ ãnkɔɔn otyal m'obam o ndɛ. B'áfɛn ndɛ asuul ekɔ e bɔ k'ɛ̃mpal ɛ̃ nsam a bɔɔl yi ata me Sol.<verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Ŋ'éketyal bɔ Etyɛn ãnkɔɔn oŋɔ̃, ndɛ ákebuɛɛn bubu: «Mfam Yeso, yɔɔ ɔ̃fel a mɛ̃!» <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Ndɛ obvi ãbuo, bu abiool bam kokɔ ndiri: «Mfam, dzeel bɔ obi ba!» Ke mbee a ŋ'eyɛɛn ndɛ ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, ndɛ otsuul mwiĩ.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Obobɔ, Sol áli ngɔmɔ̃ onse b'ákiool kwɛn abam Etyɛn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Bɛɛn tsoo olɔ, abootuaal Ebvɔɔn li éli ke Yelusalem mpal yam bibi. Ayio bueel atsɔɔn me nsie yi Yude ye yi Samali, antam k'átsɔɔn ye bɔ wɛ.<verse eid="ACT 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sol atuaal Ebvɔɔn mpal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Baal b'ákuru nzuru me Nziã adziool Etyɛn, bɔ alel ndɛ bibi.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Me b'otal Sol, ndɛ áketsal Ebvɔɔn. Ndɛ ákesam onse ãnzɔ, ákebvuru akaal y'abɔɔl, ákelɔ me bwal.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipe otsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ ke Samali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Akiool b'átsal-átsal, k'ãmboo m'ékebwel bɔ, áketsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />M'emfa okyɛ, Filipe wu áyɛn onse bviil li Samali, otee Nsia a Mãsia. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Baal bueel ákeyoo ãndɔɔ ngesɛ-ngesɛ m'ékeyɛɛn Filipe, ŋ'eyoo bɔ bvool amwɛn emwã bvi ékesa ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi ɛ̃́kepal onse baal bibi, ɛ̃kuaal ɛ̃sɔɔl. Ekal bibi ye b'áli y'elyam abvuul. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />M'emfa okyɛ, esɛ ngamfɛn éli onse bviil olɔ.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Simɔ̃ ál'ayii abekal onse bviil olɔ. Ndɛ ákesa ongaa, bvool ákesuul baal a Samali onse ɛ̃kam. Ndɛ ákeyɛɛn ndiri ndɛ oli mbuul wu ɔ̃nɛn. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Obobɔ, baal bam bueel, bɛɛn m'akiɔɔl tiil akuul, ákeyoo ndɛ ngesɛ-ngesɛ, bvool ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Mbuul wu, wu abeta me “waan e Nziã li nɛn.”» <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Bɔ ákeyoo ndɛ ngesɛ-ngesɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn etel-nziil, ndɛ ákesuul bɔ onse ɛ̃kam m'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ mi ongaa. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Kɛn a ŋ'ekiool bɔ Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi éketsal Filipe bɔ me ndɔɔ Okwɛn o Nziã ye nkuũ a Yeso Mãsia, bɔ awel opongo, akaal y'abɔɔl. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simɔ̃ ndyam hɛ̃ oyii ɔ̃kiool, ndɛ owel opongo, ndɛ k'ákesiil Filipe wɛ. Ndɛ áli y'ɛ̃kam bibi ŋ'ékemwɛn ndɛ emwã y'emvieel bvi enɛn bvi ákesa.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Ŋ'eyoo antam b'áli ke Yelusalem ndiri baal a Samali akiool Endɔɔ e Nziã, bɔ ayuɔɔl bɔ Piɛɛl bwɛn a Dzaã. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Ŋ'etɔ antam ange-buaal ola bɔ, bɔ abuɛɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal aya nkal akiool. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal ale kɛn asool nkal a mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ wɛ. Bɔ awel opongo kɛn a me nkuũ a Mfam Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Obobɔ, Piɛɛl ye Dzaã andɔɔl bɔ mviɔɔl, bɔ bu ayɔɔ Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Ŋ'emwɛn Simɔ̃ kwɛn baal ákeyɔɔ Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal ŋ'ékendɔɔl antam bɔ mviɔɔl, ndɛ oyebuun bɔ nzi, bu ayɛɛn ndiri: <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />«Ewa mɛ̃ hɛ̃ waan li, me ndɔɔ yɛn baal b'endɔɔl mɛ̃ mviɔɔl ayɔɔ Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal.»<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Kɛn a Piɛɛl obveel ndɛ bubu: «Onge b'etsam yɛ wɛn yɛ olɔ suun kab e Nziã me nzi, yɔɔl kwɛn yɛ kwa ye nzi e yɛ! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Yɛ onse ndɔɔ yi, ke li ye ki abɔɔ kyam wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ɔ̃kwal a yɛ k'ali dzu ke mviil ã Nziã wɛ! <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Pal onse ãtsam ã yɛ m'ãbi-ãbi, buɛɛn Mfam, owɛɛl ndɛ odzeel yɛ m'ãtsam m'ebɔɔ yɛ omɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ emwɛn kwɛn ɔ̃kwal a yɛ oluul me nsɔɔ, yɛ hɛ̃ li ɔ̃nkyal a obi.» <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simɔ̃ bu abveel bubu: «Yɔɔl kwɛn byam ebuɛɛn Mfam me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃, kwɛn ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ onse m'eyɛɛn byɛ ebee me mɛ̃ otɔ.»<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Antam ange-buaal ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ a Mfam Yeso, atee Endɔɔ e ndɛ. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, bɔ akɔɔl Yelusalem. Me nkuul a nkuul, bɔ áketsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ onse ãla bibi mã Samali.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipe omwɛɛn y'ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃nɛn wu Etiopi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Ãnzwel ã Mfam ãlieel Filipe bubu: «Tɛɛn, yi me li etswi ki nsɛn, me nkuul yi efa Yelusalem eyi Gadza, me li ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Filipe otɛɛn oyɛn. Me nkuul, ndɛ omwɛn mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃fi-Etiopi. Ndɛ áli ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃nɛn wu áketal opfel bam bueel b'ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃kaal wu Etiopi. Ámbaal ndɛ obɔɔl<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Me lio olɔ, amfam b'anɛn b'ákesal ke nsɛn ɔ̃kal a ɔ̃kwɛn, ákembaal bɔ obɔɔl.</char></note>. Ndɛ áyi Yelusalem me ndɔɔ yi alweel Nziã, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />bu ayii abvool ola. Ndɛ áli me nsɛn onse swaal a ndɛ, bvool áketsiɔ ɔ̃nkaan wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã Edzayi.<verse eid="ACT 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Ɔ̃fel olieel Filipe ndiri: «Syal tsotsoo a swaal wu!» <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filipe oyɛn me ntiin, bu ayoo ɔ̃fi-Etiopi abetsiɔ ɔ̃nkaan wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã Edzayi. Ndɛ ofuul ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ ŋ'abebɔɔ ãndɔɔ m'ebetsiɔ yɛ otsɛn?» <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Ɔ̃fi-Etiopi obveel bubu: «Mɛ̃ mɔ̃ otsɛn bwɛn a bwɛn ebɔɔ, okɛɛn mbuul wu abɛɛl mɛ̃ mɔ̃ pyɛ?» Obobɔ, ndɛ olieel Filipe ndiri asam onse swaal, m'obva o nsɛn tsotsoo a ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Ãndɔɔ m'ákel m'éketsiɔ ndɛ ã́li mɔ̃ mã:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">«Ábiri ndɛ onge emɛmɛɛ̃ ke mboo yi abam anyam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">bvool onge muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ wɛn yi ayɛɛn pyɛ ke nkwel a wu akuul ndɛ mfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">ndɛ k'adzweel ɔ̃nywã wɛ.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Ásiaan ndɛ, ɔ̃dzoo a ndɛ ábam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">wu akieel ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ a yam e ndɛ nã?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Ke ngwel wɛ, ámbaal omwiĩ o ndɛ me nsie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Edz 53.7-8</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Ɔ̃fi-Etiopi ofuul Filipe bubu: «Mɛ̃ nduɔɔn yɛ, meyɛɛn mɛ̃, ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ me nã aliaal? Me ndyam wuo me mbuul ɔ̃kyam?» <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Filipe ayebvuru oyɛɛn, obɛɛn m'ɔ̃luo wu éketsiɔ ndɛ ondɛ, bu atee ndɛ Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi etal Yeso.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Ŋ'ebenɔɔn bɔ nkuul a bɔ, bɔ atɔ ke mboo yi eli ãdza. Obobɔ, ɔ̃fi-Etiopi olieel Filipe ndiri: «Ãdza mɔ̃ bu, ki eluo mɛ̃ opongo owal emã?» [ <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipe olieel ndɛ bubu: «Ŋɛn yɛ kiool m'ɔ̃kwal a ye ndyam wueel, yɛ koo k'awal opongo.» Ndɛ obveel ndiri: «Taa-taa, mɛ̃ nkiool wɛn Yeso Mãsia oli Muaan a Nziã<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Nziã mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>.»] <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Ndɛ bu atam ndiri atɛɛl swaal. Bɔ ange-buaal asool onse ãdza, Filipe bu awi ndɛ opongo.<verse eid="ACT 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Ŋ'epal bɔ onse ãdza, Ɔ̃fel a Mfam ombaal Filipe. Ɔ̃fi-Etiopi k'abemwɛn ndɛ wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ onɔɔn nkuul a ndɛ y'esɛ kyam kieel. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Me b'otal Filipe, ndɛ oyetɔɔn k'Adzote, ndɛ áketsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ onse ãbviil mam mbueel m'ékebwel ndɛ tiil ŋ'etɔ ndɛ Sedzale.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Sol okaal ɔ̃kwal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Sol ákeŋaan kɛn oŋaan k'atuaal ayio a Mfam mpal bvool k'abam bɔ. Ndɛ oyɛn oyetal ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn. <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />Ndɛ oyesɔɔ ɛ̃nkaan ola ndɛ mi ewa ndɛ nkuul yi asam onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn mã Damas, kwɛn ndɛ amwɛn akaal wuo abɔɔl b'abenɔɔn a nkuul a Yeso, asiin bɔ, abiri Yelusalem. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Ŋ'eyii eyi ndɛ Damas, ndɛ ayetɔ tsotsoo ye bviil olɔ, enseel oŋɔ̃, ndɛ omwɛn mbaa yi enyɛɛn efi ywel, edzii ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Ndɛ obvi me nsie, bvool oyoo nkii ngamɔ eyɛɛn ndɛ bubu: «Sol, Sol, ki ebetuaal yɛ mɛ̃ mpal emã?» <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Sol ofuul ndiri: «Yɛ nã li, Mfam?» Nkii oyɔ ebveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ndyam, ndi Yeso wɛn yɛ, yɛ abetuaal mpal. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Oŋɔ̃ tɛɛn, sam onse bviil, okɔ, àyɛɛn yɛ bɛn ebvaan yɛ asa!»<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Baal b'ákeyi ye ndɛ atɛɛn yuul, ebɔɔ e nsie edziɔɔn bɔ: Bɔ ákeyoo nkii, kɛn a bɔ k'ákemwɛn mbuul wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sol otɛɛn, bvool odzweel mviil, kɛn a ndɛ k'abemwɛn wɛ. Asiin ndɛ me kuɔɔl, abiri ndɛ Damas. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Sol osi ãtsoo ãtyel k'amwɛn wɛ, k'adza wɛ, k'anywã hɛ̃ wɛ.<figure style="fig" alt="Conversion de Saul" file="WA03960b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade, © United Bible Societies, 1989" ref="9.3-9" /><verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ, ɔ̃yio ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Ananias áli ke Damas. Mfam oyɛɛn ndɛ onse emwɛn ndiri: «Ananias!» Ndɛ obveel ndiri: «Mɛ̃ bu, Mfam!» <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Mfam olieel ndɛ bubu: «Tɛɛn, yi bam tswa-tswa me bal-bal wu wɛn nkuũ “Dzu”, y'afuul ke nzɔ a Yudas, mbuul wu ata me Sol, ɔ̃fi-ola bo Taase. Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ abebuɛɛn. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Onse emwɛn, ndɛ omwɛn mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu ata m'Ananias opal ola ndɛ, osam onse nzɔ, bu andɔɔl ndɛ mviɔɔl, kwɛn ndɛ amwɛn bvool.» <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananias obveel bubu: «Mfam, mɛ̃ ebeyoo baal bibi abeyɛɛn m'obi bam bueel b'ebesa mbuul ondɛ baal a yɛ ba ngel ke Yelusalem. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Ŋ'eyɛɛn ŋã, ndɛ oyi ŋã nzal-a-ŋɛn amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã awi ndɛ omfam b'akuru baal bam bueel b'abuɛɛn yɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Kɛn a Mfam obveel ndɛ bubu: «Yi e yɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ nsueel mbuul ondɛ, kwɛn ndɛ asa ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃, asa kwɛn ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃kyam, y'amfam a myɛ̃, ye baal b'Isalayel hɛ̃, ayɛɛ nkuũ a mɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Myam ekieel esuo ndɛ fool lueel li èmwɛn ndɛ me nkuũ a mɛ̃.»<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Obobɔ, Ananias oyɛn. Ŋ'etɔ ndɛ onse nzɔ, ndɛ ondɔɔl Sol mviɔɔl, bvool olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Sol, ndoo a mɛ̃, Mfam Yeso, wu apal ola yɛ me nkuul ŋ'ekeya yɛ, oyuɔɔl mɛ̃ ola yɛ, kwɛn yɛ mwɛn bvool, luul hɛ̃ m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal.» <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Kɛn a me lio alili, eluɔ bvɛn onge mpie e nswi embal me mviil ã Sol. Obobɔ, ndɛ obvi omwɛn bvool. Ndɛ otɛɛn, oyewal opongo. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Ke mbee a ŋ'edzi ndɛ, ndɛ obɔɔ mpɛn. Ndɛ okal ãtsoo ke kwɛ y'ayio b'áli ke Damas.<verse eid="ACT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sol otee Nsia a Yeso ke Damas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Alili oŋɔ̃ hɛ̃, Ndɛ obvi otee m'ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn ndiri: Yeso oli Muaan a Nziã. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Baal bam bueel b'ákeyoo ndɛ ákekam bibi, bvool ákeyɛɛn bubu: «Mbuul wu, ke wu aketuaal baal b'abebuɛɛn me nkuũ a Yeso ke Yelusalem mpal wɛ? Ndɛ ŋ'ayi ŋã, ke me ndɔɔ yi akuru akiool ba ŋã, bvool abiri bɔ ola amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã wɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Kɛn a ndɛ áketee ye mpɛn yam bibi tsoo bwɛn a tsoo. Ndɛ ákesa kwɛn Ayuda b'ákekal ke Damas aywɛn a b'ayɛɛn, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ ákesuo bɔ kwɛn Yeso oli Mãsia.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Ke mbee ãlio bibi, Ayuda bakyɛ akuru k'abam ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Ndɛ obɔɔ nsia a mfoo a bɔ. Tsia ye mwiĩ, bɔ ákekyab ãnkuul mam mbueel m'esam baal ye m'epal baal onse bviil olɔ, me ndɔɔ yi abam ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Kɛn a me tsia ngɔmɔ̃, ayio a ndɛ alɔ ndɛ onse pɛɛ̃, bu asuul ndɛ asool me li ebɔɔ-ebɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sol ke Yelusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Sol oyɛn Yelusalem. Ŋ'etɔ ndɛ okɔ, ndɛ oyii abii ãyal m'asam onse nkel a ayio, kɛn a bɔ bam bueel áli ye buɔ o ndɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ k'ákekiool ndiri taa-taa bam ndɛ aleyii ɔ̃yio wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Obobɔ, Balanabas owel ndɛ, obiri ndɛ ol'antam, olieel bɔ emfa kyɛn me nkuul ndɛ amwɛn Mfam, Mfam bu ayɛɛn ye ndɛ. Ndɛ hɛ̃ olieel emfa kyɛn ke Damas Sol atee y'ãŋã mbueel me nkuũ a Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Bɛɛn oŋɔ̃, ndɛ obvɔɔn ye bɔ. Ndɛ ayi akɔɔl ye bɔ onse Yelusalem, atee y'onzɔɔ̃ bueel me nkuũ a Mfam. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Ndɛ ákeyɛɛn bvool áketsuun y'Ayuda b'abeyɛɛn ɔ̃nywã wu Ngelek. Kɛn a bɔ hɛ̃ ákebii ndɛ wu abam. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Ŋ'ebɔɔ andoo a dzii nsia oyɔ, bɔ abiri ndɛ ke Sedzale. Okɔ, bɔ asuul ndɛ oyɛn Taase.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Me nsie a Yude yam yueel, ye yi Ngalile, ye yi Samali, Ebvɔɔn éli onse opi. Lɔ ékewam onse okiool, bvool éli ye lweel e Mfam. Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal áli ye lɔ. Obobɔ, baal ákelɔɔ kɛn olɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obvuul b'Ene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Me lio olɔ, Piɛɛl ákedziɔɔn ɔ̃kiri ndyam wueel. Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, ndɛ oyɛn oyetal akiool b'ákekal ke bviil li Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Onse bviil olɔ, éli ye bɔɔl ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Ene. Ndɛ ál'amaasa mvel mpuɔ̃ yi ékekal ndɛ kɛn a bɔ nkal a ntal. Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ mviil ɛ̃́kwi. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Piɛɛl olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Ene, Yeso Mãsia obvuul yɛ! Tɛɛn bvool wal ntal a yɛ!» Kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, Ene otɛɛn. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Baal bam bueel ba bviil li Lida ye bakyɛ b'ɔ̃baan wa Salɔ̃ amwɛn Ene, bu akiool Mfam Yeso.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piɛɛl oseel Tabita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Onse bviil li Dzope<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Meba, abeta bviil e Dzope me Dzafa.</char></note>, éli y'ɔ̃yio ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal wɛn nkuũ Tabita. M'ɔ̃nywã wa Ngelek, abeta nkuũ oyɔ me Dolokas, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri «nsee». Ãlio mam mbueel, ndɛ ákesa baal obvɛ, ndɛ hɛ̃ ákewuaal a baal b'akaan. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />M'ãtsoo omɔ̃, ndɛ obɔɔ oluu, bu akwi. Asuɔɔl ebiĩ e ndɛ, asuul kyɛ k'etswi e nzɔ ki ywel. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Ayio ba Dzope ayoo nsia ndiri Piɛɛl oli ke Lida. Lida oli tsotsoo ye Dzope. Bɔ ayuɔɔl ndɛ baal buaal ayelɛɛn ndɛ bubu: «Meya bam tswa-a-tswa ola bee!»<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Piɛɛl otɛɛn, oyɛn ye bɔ. Ŋ'etɔ ndɛ, abiri ndɛ k'etswi e nzɔ ki ywel. Akaal b'apfiil bam bueel ayeyɔɔ ndɛ m'elel. Bɔ asuo ndɛ ɛ̃nkuru y'ekɔ bvikyɛ bvi ékebaan Dolokas bɔ ŋ'éli ndɛ ye bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Piɛɛl opaal baal bam bueel nkwel-a-nzi, obvi ãbuo, bu abuɛɛn. Ndɛ okɔɔl osɔɔn ebiĩ, bu ayɛɛn bubu: «Tabita, tɛɛn!» Tabita odzweel mviil, omwɛn Piɛɛl, bu abvi nsɛn. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Piɛɛl osiin ndɛ me kuɔɔl, bu atɛɛl ndɛ. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ oti akiool y'akaal b'apfiil mbel, bu asuo bɔ Tabita m'omwiĩ. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Nsia oyɔ etsɔɔn me Dzope ndyam wueel, baal bibi akiool Mfam. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Piɛɛl okal ãtsoo boo-boo ke Dzope, ke nzɔ a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Simɔ̃, wu ákefaal ebaan bvi anyam.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Emwɛn e Kooneye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Ke bviil li Sedzale, éli ye bɔɔl ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Kooneye. Ndɛ áli mbiri a ambwel-mbwel ba Lom b'onse nkel yi ata m'ambwel-mbwel b'ɔ̃kiri wu Itali. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Ye baal a nzɔ a ndɛ bam bueel, ndɛ ákelweel Nziã, bvool ákuru nzuru me ndɛ. Ndɛ ákesa ãndɔɔ m'asio baal nyiĩ. Ndɛ hɛ̃ ákebuɛɛn Nziã lio bwɛn a lio. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, sua lio li ãtyel ŋ'emeebɔɔn tal, onse emwɛn, ndɛ omwɛn ãnzwel ã Nziã ngãmɔ̃ kal-a-kal ãsam onse nzɔ a ndɛ, bu ãti ndɛ mbel ndiri: «Kooneye!» <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Ndɛ olɔ ãnzwel etɔ, ebangɛɛ ebɔɔ ndɛ, ndɛ bu afuul mɔ̃ ndiri: «Emã, Mfam?» Ãnzwel ãbveel ndɛ bubu: «Ãbuɛɛn ã yɛ y'ãndɔɔ m'esio yɛ baal nyiĩ ãtɔ ola Nziã. Ndɛ hɛ̃ k'adzɛɛn yɛ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Meba ŋã, yuɔɔl baal ke Dzope ayeta Simɔ̃ wu abeta me Piɛɛl mbel. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Ndɛ oli lɔɔ ke nzɔ a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ hɛ̃ Simɔ̃, wu abefaal ebaan bvi anyam. Nzɔ a ndɛ eli nku-a-nku ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa.»<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Ŋ'eyɛn ãnzwel m'ã́keyɛɛn ye Kooneye, ndɛ oti asal a ndɛ buaal ye ngɔmɔ̃ wu ákuru nzuru me ndɛ onse ambwel-mbwel a ndɛ mbel. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyɛɛn ndɛ bɔ ãndɔɔ mam mbueel m'ãbwel, ndɛ otam bɔ Dzope.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emwɛn e Piɛɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Ela esiool, asal ange-buaal ye mbwel-mbwel b'éyuɔɔl Kooneye kɛn áli me nkuul. Ŋ'eyii bɔ tsotsoo ye bviil li Dzope, sua tal dzu, Piɛɛl onɔɔn nkal a sɛɛ e nzɔ li pɛɛl, me ndɔɔ yi abuɛɛn. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Ndɛ nzal ewel, bu ayii adzii k'adza. Me lio li ákelaan ndɛ bvi-odza, ndɛ obɔɔ emwɛn. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Onse emwɛn olɔ, ywel edzweel nzuru, ndɛ omwɛn eluɔ ngemɔ̃ onge ekɔ ki enɛn ki asiin k'ãnswɛ ãnge-ãnã esool tiil nsie. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Onse mwiĩ a eluɔ okyɛ, éli y'anyam b'ɛ̃mpal ɛ̃nã, ye b'adzuu me bal-a-bal, y'anywɛn. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Nkii ngamɔ̃ eyɛɛn ndɛ bubu: «Piɛɛl, tɛɛn, bam bvool dza!» <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Piɛɛl obveel ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, Mfam! Lɔɔ-okal, mɛ̃ kɛn a nzi eluɔ ki eluo ngel a bee b'Ayuda, ki ye mbiin wɛ.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11">Lev 11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Nkii oyɔ eyɛɛn ye ndɛ nsa yi yuaal ndiri: «Eluɔ ki elieel Nziã ndiri eli tsɛtsɛ, oyɛɛ ke wal kyɛ onge ki ye mbiin wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Esi obobɔ nsa tyel. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, andɛɛl eluɔ okyɛ ebvool ywel.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Piɛɛl ãyal ãfi, ndɛ oyii abii otsɛn b'ãndɔɔ m'emwɛn ndɛ, kɛn a me lio olɔ, antam b'eyuɔɔl Kooneye atɔ k'ɔ̃nywã a nzɔ, ke mbee a ŋ'emeefuul bɔ mboo yi eli nzɔ a Simɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Bɔ abiool, bvool afuul okɛɛn lɔɔ e Simɔ̃ wu ata me Piɛɛl eli oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Onge bɛn Piɛɛl áketsam me ndɔɔ otsɛn b'emwɛn olɔ, Ɔ̃fel a Nziã olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Tal, baal atyel afuul yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Sool, yi ye bɔ, oyɛɛ ke sa ãnkɛn wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ mbuul wu ngyuɔɔl bɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Piɛɛl osool, oyɛɛn ye baal obɔ bubu: «Wu ebebii byɛ mɛ̃. Ndɔɔ mã yi eyi byɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Wu otam bee Kooneye wu oli mbiri a ambwel-mbwel ɔ̃nkam wa Lom. Ndɛ oli mbuul wa dzu, ndɛ abelweel Nziã. Ayuda bueel abeyɛɛn obvɛ me ndɛ. Ãnzwel ã Nziã ngãmɔ̃ ãyɛɛn ndɛ ndiri ata yɛ mbel ke nzɔ a ndɛ, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ ndɛ ayoo b'eyɛɛn yɛ ndɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Obobɔ, ndɛ oswɛɛl bɔ onse nzɔ, bvool ofaal bɔ mboo yi ala twal.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Ela esiool, Piɛɛl otɛɛn oyɛn ye bɔ. Andoo ke kwɛ ba Dzope ayesuul ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Ke mbee a tsoo ngelemɔ̃, ndɛ otɔ Sedzale. Kooneye ákedzel ndɛ, ndɛ ábvool eburu e ndɛ y'andoo a ndɛ b'ɔ̃kwal. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Ŋ'etɔ Piɛɛl, Kooneye wu oyeyɔɔ ndɛ, opfɔɔn tiil obvi ãbuo ke nkwel a ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Kɛn a Piɛɛl otɛɛl ndɛ y'ayɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Tɛɛn, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ kɛn a mbuul ndi!» <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Ŋ'ékesam Piɛɛl onse nzɔ, ndɛ áketa ɔ̃sam ye Kooneye. Ndɛ oyebɔɔ baal bibi amaabvɔɔn.<verse eid="ACT 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Byam eyɛɛ wɛn ãngel ã bee b'Ayuda ãluo Ɔ̃yuda k'akal mboo mɔ̃ ye mbuul wɛn k'Ɔ̃yuda wɛ, wuo k'asam onse nzɔ a ndɛ. Kɛn a Nziã osuo mɛ̃ kwɛn mɛ̃ ke nkoo k'ewal mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ onge wa ye mbiin wɛ, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ke nkoo k'ebee k'ekal mboo mɔ̃ ye ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ŋ'etam byɛ mɛ̃ mbel ota, mɛ̃ k'esi ãnkɛn wɛ, bu ngyi. Oŋɔ̃ emeeyɛɛn mɛ̃ otsɛn b'etam byɛ mɛ̃ owal.»<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kooneye obveel Piɛɛl bubu: «Nonɔ̃ ãtsoo ãyii ãnã, mɛ̃ ekebuɛɛn onse nzɔ a mɛ̃, me lio li ãtyel ŋ'emeebɔɔn tal. Enseel oŋɔ̃, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu alaal ekɔ bvi engal opal ke nkwel a mɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Ndɛ olieel mɛ̃ bubu: “Kooneye, Nziã okiool ãbuɛɛn ã yɛ. Ndɛ hɛ̃ oyeel ãndɔɔ m'ebesio ye baal nyiĩ. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Oŋɔ̃ yuɔɔl baal ke Dzope ayeta Simɔ̃ wu abeta me Piɛɛl mbel. Ndɛ oli lɔɔ ke nzɔ a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ hɛ̃ Simɔ̃, wu abefaal ebaan bvi anyam. Nzɔ a ndɛ eli nku-a-nku ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ ntam yɛ owal. Yɛ si ngesɛ ŋ'eyi yɛ. Meba ŋã, bia-byɛ bueel eli ke nkwel a Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi eyoo mam mbueel m'etam Mfam yɛ oyɛɛn.»<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãtee ã Piɛɛl onse nzɔ a Kooneye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Obobɔ, Piɛɛl ayebvuru oyɛɛn, olieel bubu: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ ŋe ngyɛɛ kwɛn Nziã k'ali y'ɔ̃bɛɛ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Kɛn a m'ɛ̃kiri mvieel, mbuul ndyam wueel wu alweel Nziã, bvool asa ãndɔɔ mã dzu, ndɛ asa Nziã esɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Nziã oyuɔɔl Endɔɔ e ndɛ ola baal b'Isalayel, m'otsal o bɔ Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi etal opi b'abɔɔ me Yeso Mãsia. Ndɛ wu Yeso Mãsia oli Mfam a baal bam bueel. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Byɛ bam eyɛɛ m'ãbwel, bɛɛn ke Ngalile bvool ye Yude wueel, ke mbee a ŋ'éketa Dzaã baal mbel k'ayewal opongo. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Byɛ eyɛɛ kwɛn Nziã áluul Yeso wa Nadzalet m'Ɔ̃fel ye waan e ndɛ. M'ãmboo mbueel m'ékebwel ndɛ wu Yeso, ndɛ ákesa baal obvɛ, bvool ákebvuul baal bam bueel b'éketuaal ɔ̃pfu mpal. Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã áli ye ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Bee eli baal b'émwɛn ãndɔɔ mam mbueel m'ési ndɛ k'ɔ̃kiri wu Ayuda, bvool ke Yelusalem. Ndɛ wu ébam bɔ, ŋ'ébɛɛl bɔ ndɛ m'ɔ̃ti. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Kɛn a Nziã áseel ndɛ me tsoo li ãtyel. Ndɛ áwi ndɛ nkuul yi apal ola baal. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Ndɛ k'ápal ola baal bam bueel wɛ, kɛn ola bee b'etsɔɔn ésueel Nziã k'ekal baal b'amwɛn ndɛ, bee b'édzi bvool énywi ye ndɛ, ke mbee a ŋ'ésiool ndɛ onse b'ákwi-ákwi. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Ndɛ átam bee k'eyɛɛn baal ndiri ndɛ oli mbuul wu ésueel Nziã me ndɔɔ yi atsiil ãndɔɔ ã baal b'amwiĩ-mwiĩ ye b'ákwi-ákwi. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã bam bueel áyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, ndiri: “Mbuul ndyam wueel wu akiool ndɛ abɔɔ odzeel b'ãbi me nkuũ a ndɛ.”»<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ ayɔɔ Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Piɛɛl kɛn oyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã, Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal osool nkal a baal bam bueel b'ákeyoo Endɔɔ e Nziã. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Akiool bam bueel b'áli Ayuda b'áyi ye Piɛɛl ɛ̃kam ɛ̃si bɔ myam bibi, ŋ'emwɛn bɔ kwɛn Nziã okab Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal me baal bɛn k'áli Ayuda wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ ákeyoo baal obɔ ákeyɛɛn ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃kyam, bvool ákelweel Nziã. Obobɔ, Piɛɛl oyɛɛn bubu: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />«Baal ba amaayɔɔ Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal onge bia-byɛ, mbuul nã wu okoo k'aluo k'apongo bɔ m'ãdza?» <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Piɛɛl bu atam k'apongo bɔ me nkuũ a Yeso Mãsia. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, bɔ aluɔɔn ndɛ k'akal ãtsoo ke kwɛ ye bɔ.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Ke Yelusalem, Piɛɛl owi otsɛn o ndɔɔ yi ési ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Antam y'andoo b'áli ke Yude ayoo nsia ndiri baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ ayɔɔ Endɔɔ e Nziã. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Me lio li ebvool Piɛɛl Yelusalem, akiool b'áli Ayuda awi ndɛ mbyel. <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />Bɔ alieel ndɛ bubu: «Yɛ ye sam ola baal bɛn k'átsiil wɛ, bvool dzi ye bɔ!» <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Obobɔ, Piɛɛl obvi bɔ ãndɔɔ m'ãbwel oyɛɛn m'ɔ̃mɔ̃-ɔ̃mɔ̃, m'emfa ki: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />«Mɛ̃ eli ke bviil li Dzope. Me lio li ekebuɛɛn mɛ̃, mɛ̃ Ɔ̃fel osiin, bu mbɔɔ emwɛn li: Mɛ̃ mwɛn eluɔ ngemɔ̃ onge ekɔ ki enɛn ki asiin m'ãnswɛ ãnge-ãnã esool fa ywel tiil ola mɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Ŋe ntal mɛ̃ ngesɛ, onse mwiĩ a eluɔ okyɛ, eli y'anyam b'emfa bwɛn emfa b'edzwa ye b'ola, ye b'adzuu me bal-a-bal, y'anywɛn. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Mɛ̃ ngyoo nkii ngamɔ̃ elieel mɛ̃ bubu: “Piɛɛl, tɛɛn, bam bvool dza!” <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Mɛ̃ mveel wɛn: “Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, Mfam! Lɔɔ-okal, mɛ̃ kɛn a nzi eluɔ ki eluo ngel a Ayuda, ki ye mbiin wɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Nkii eyɛɛn mɛ̃ fa ywel nsa yi yuaal ndiri: “Eluɔ ki elieel Nziã ndiri eli tsɛtsɛ, oyɛɛ ke wal kyɛ onge ki ye mbiin wɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Esi obobɔ nsa tyel. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, andɛɛl eluɔ okyɛ eyɛn ywel. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Kɛn a me lio olɔ, abɔɔl atyel atɔ ke nzɔ yi éli bee. Bɔ áfi Sedzale, bvool átam bɔ ola mɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Ɔ̃fel a Nziã olieel mɛ̃ ndiri mɛ̃ ngyi ye bɔ, mbee ãnkɛn osa. Andoo ange-asɛɛn ba, ayesuul mɛ̃, bee esam onse nzɔ a Kooneye. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Ndɛ olieel bee emfa ki emwɛn ndɛ ãnzwel ãpal ola ndɛ, bu ãyɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: “Tam Simɔ̃ wu abeta me Piɛɛl mbel ota ke Dzope. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Ndɛ mbuul wu ayɛɛn yɛ ãndɔɔ m'ãbvuul yɛ ye baal a nzɔ a yɛ bam bueel.” <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Ŋe mvi mɛ̃ oyɛɛn, Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal osool nkal a bɔ, kɛn a m'emfa ki ésool ndɛ nkal a bia-byɛ k'obɛɛn. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ ngyeel ndɔɔ yi éyɛɛn Mfam bia-byɛ ndiri: “Dzaã áwi baal opongo b'ãdza, kɛn a byɛ, byɛ èwal opongo b'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">Ɛ̃sa 1.5</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />M'emfa okyɛ, okɛɛn Nziã owi bɔ ekab lili li éwi ndɛ bia-byɛ hɛ̃ ŋ'ékiool bia-byɛ Mfam Yeso Mãsia, bɛn mɛ̃ ndyam nã ndi wu ekeeluo Nziã k'asa b'edzii ndɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyoo bɔ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ aweel pi, bvool bu abvi Nziã olweel, ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, Nziã hɛ̃ osuo baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ nkuul yi akaal ɛ̃kwal, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ abɔɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu!»<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebvɔɔn li Antioswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Ãmpal m'áketuaal akiool me lio li ábam Etyɛn, ãsi kwɛn bɔ atsɔɔn m'ãmboo m'ãmboo. Bɔ ayɛn tiil ke Fenisi, ye Swipele k'Antioswe. Bɔ áketee Endɔɔ e Nziã kɛn ol'Ayuda. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, akiool bakyɛ onse bɔ b'áli Afi-Swipele ye Silɛn, ayɛn Antioswe, ayeyɛɛn hɛ̃ ye baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, bvool ayetsal bɔ Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Mfam Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Waan e Mfam éli ye bɔ. Obobɔ, baal bibi akaal ɛ̃kwal, bu ayii akiool a Mfam. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Nsia a bɔ ebvi m'ãtswi m'akiool b'Ebvɔɔn li Yelusalem. Bɔ bu ayuɔɔl Balanabas k'Antioswe. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Ŋ'etɔ ndɛ bvool omwɛn emfa ki esal nyiĩ a Nziã yi enɛn onse bɔ, esi ndɛ esɛ. Ndɛ owi bɔ bam bueel mpɛn yi akuru nzuru me Mfam ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Balanabas áli mbuul wa ngesɛ, wu áluul m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal y'okiool. M'emfa okyɛ, baal bibi akuru nzuru me Mfam.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Balanabas oyebii Sol ke Taase. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Ŋ'emwɛn Balanabas Sol, ndɛ oyi ye ndɛ k'Antioswe. Bɔ asi mvel ɔ̃tsiin onse Ebvɔɔn m'ɔ̃sal y'oyiool o baal bam bibi. K'Antioswe okɔ ku áti ayio nsa yi ɛ̃kwel m'akilisito. <verse eid="ACT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />M'ãtsoo omɔ̃, aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã afi Yelusalem ayɛn Antioswe. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ wɛn nkuũ Agabus, otɛɛn bu alieel m'Ɔ̃fel ndiri ɔ̃lɔɔ àyesam m'ɔ̃kiri a nsie ndyam wueel. Ɔ̃lɔɔ ondɛ áyi me lio li éli Kolode ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃nɛn wa Lom. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Obobɔ, ayio k'Antioswe akuru kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul, m'emfa ki obɔɔ o ndɛ, ayuɔɔl wuaal ol'andoo ba Yude. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Bɔ asi obobɔ. Bɔ ayuɔɔl wuaal olɔ ol'akuul-kuul b'Ebvɔɔn, me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ Balanabas ye Sol.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Abam Dzak, atyel Piɛɛl me bwal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Me lio olɔ, ɔ̃kwɛn Elode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elode áli muaan-nkyel a Elode Antipas, bvool áli ɔ̃tiɔɔl a Elode wu Ɔ̃nɛn.</char></note> obvi baal b'Ebvɔɔn bakyɛ mpal otuaal. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Ndɛ obam Dzak, wu muaan-ngoo a Dzaã, m'epwel. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ kwɛn ndɔɔ oyɔ esi Ayuda esɛ, ndɛ hɛ̃ otam Piɛɛl osiin. Éli me lio li pfuun li adza amampa bɛn k'ali ye lebviil wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Ke mbee a ŋ'esiin Elode Piɛɛl atyel me bwal, ndɛ otam ambwel-mbwel ndɛ okiaal. Ambwel-mbwel obɔ, ndɛ okab bɔ m'ãnkel ãnã, nkel bwɛn a nkel m'ambwel-mbwel anã. Ndɛ áli y'ãtsam m'atsiil ndɔɔ a ndɛ ke nkwel a baal, ke mbee a Pfuun li Onduru. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Obobɔ, Piɛɛl áli m'okiaal onse bwal. Kɛn Ebvɔɔn ékebuɛɛn Nziã me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, owuun wɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piɛɛl opal onse bwal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Me tsia wɛn ela esiool Elode ákaatsiil ndɔɔ a ndɛ ke nkwel a baal, ndɛ wu Piɛɛl áli me twal mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ ambwel-mbwel buaal. Ákuru ndɛ ebwal m'ãmpaa mbuaal. Ambwel-mbwel bakyɛ áli ke nkwel edzoo e nzɔ a bwal me ndɔɔ yi akiaal yɔ. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Enseel oŋɔ̃, ãnzwel ã Mfam Nziã ngamɔ̃ ãpal ola ndɛ, mbaa eyɛɛl bwal. Ãnzwel ãbɛɛl Piɛɛl m'ebɛɛ, m'oseel o ndɛ me twal. Mɔ̃ ãyɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: «Tɛɛn bam tswa-a-tswa!» Ãmpaa m'ãli me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndɛ ãbvi me nsie. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Ãnzwel ãlieel ndɛ bubu: «Laal ɔ̃sii me luu, laal asimpal.» Ndɛ osi obobɔ. Ãnzwel ãyɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: «Laal ekɔ e yɛ ki abendɔɔl ke ywel, oŋɔ̃ nɔɔn a mɛ̃.» <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Piɛɛl opal onse ngwel-a-nzɔ a bwal, bu aluɛɛn a mɔ̃. Ndɛ k'ákeyɛɛ kwɛn ãndɔɔ m'ékesa ãnzwel ãli mɔ̃-a-mɔ̃ wɛ. Ndɛ áketsam ndiri éli nduaal. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Ãnzwel ye Piɛɛl anduru nkel a ambwel-mbwel yi ɛ̃kwel, bvool yi mbuaal, bɔ atɔ k'edzoo e nzɔ a bwal ki m'ãbvieel, ki apal onse bviil. Kyɛ edzweel nzuru kyam-a-kyam ke nkwel a bɔ. Bɔ apal, bvool asam onse bal-bal ngɔmɔ̃. Enseel oŋɔ̃, ãnzwel ãsiil ndɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Obobɔ, Piɛɛl ãtsam m'ombuul ãyebvool, ndɛ oyɛɛn ndiri: «Meba ŋã, mɛ̃ ŋe mwɛn taa-taa kwɛn Mfam oyuɔɔl ãnzwel ã ndɛ, ãyebvuul mɛ̃ me kuɔɔl ki Elode, y'obi bam bueel b'ekedzii Ayuda mɛ̃ osa.»<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Ŋ'ebɔɔ Piɛɛl otsɛn o ndɔɔ oyɔ, ndɛ oyɛn nzɔ a Mali, wu ngoo a Dzaã, wu abeta hɛ̃ me Maak. Oŋɔ̃, baal bibi ábvɔɔn, bvool ákebuɛɛn. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Piɛɛl obɛɛl nzɔ, ɔ̃sal ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal, wɛn nkuũ Lodes osyel tsotsoo, me ndɔɔ yi ayweel. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Ndɛ ayeyɛɛ kwɛn oyɔ nkii a Piɛɛl, onse esɛ, ndɛ kɛn k'adzweel nzɔ wɛ, otsuu ntiin oyewa bakyɛ nsia ndiri Piɛɛl oli ke nkwel-a-nzi ku. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ bubu: «Yɛ ye laa li!» Ndɛ owɛɛl mpɛn m'oliaal o bɔ ndiri eli kɛn obobɔ. Bɔ bu abveel ndiri: «Owɛɛl ãnzwel ã ndɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Kwɛn ŋɛn Piɛɛl abebɛɛl kɛn obɛɛl. Bɔ adzweel nzɔ, amwɛn ndɛ, bu akam bam bibi. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Piɛɛl oyɛɛn ye bɔ m'ɔ̃liɛɛn kwɛn bɔ akal pi. Ndɛ olieel bɔ emfa ki epaal Mfam ndɛ onse bwal. Ndɛ hɛ̃ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Eyewa nsia oyɔ ola Dzak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dzak wu, wu mvɔɔl a Yeso.</char></note> bvool ol'andoo.» Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ opal oyɛn mboo nkyam.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Ŋ'etsi bviil, tsungaa obvi onse ambwel-mbwel, ndiri: «Ke Piɛɛl kwɛn ayɛn?» <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Elode otam ndɛ obii, kɛn a bɔ k'abɔɔ ndɛ wɛ. Ŋ'eman Elode ambwel-mbwel b'ákekiaal ndɛ ɛ̃mfuul ofuul, ndɛ otam bɔ obam. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ ombal nsie yi Yude, oyɛn bviil li Sedzale. Okɔ, ndɛ osi ãtsoo ke kwɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Epfu li Elode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Elode áli y'eka ye baal a Tiil ye ba Sidɔ̃. Bɔ akuru ɔ̃dzi, bu ayetal ndɛ. Bɔ abwel me Balasitos wu abetal ãndɔɔ ã nzɔ a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi abveel ondoo ye bɔ. Ke ngwel wɛ, bvi-odza bvi ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃ bɔ ékefa ɔ̃kiri a ndɛ wu Elode. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Me tsoo li ɔ̃sɛɛn, Elode olaal ekɔ e ndɛ bvi okwɛn, obvi nsɛn nkal a kiri e ndɛ li okwɛn, bu ayɛɛn ye bɔ ke nkwel a baal bueel. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Baal abvi obiool bubu: «Yi-bu k'ebekal nkii a mbuul wɛ, eyii yi nziã ngɔmɔ̃ bubu!» <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Enseel oŋɔ̃, ãnzwel ã Mfam ãpfel ndɛ eluɔ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ okiool dzuun li akaawa Nziã. Ɛ̃sɔ ɛ̃dzi ndɛ mwiĩ-a-mwiĩ, ndɛ bu atsuul mwiĩ.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Kɛn Endɔɔ e Mfam éketsɔɔn bvool ékeyi nkwel. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Me b'otal Balanabas ye Sol, ke mbee a ŋ'eman bɔ ɔ̃sal a bɔ me ndɔɔ a Yelusalem, bɔ abvool. M'oyi, bɔ abiri Dzaã wu abeta me Maak.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Ɔ̃fel a Nziã osueel Sol ye Balanabas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Onse Ebvɔɔn li Antioswe, éli y'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, y'atee ba: Balanabas, ye Simehɔ̃ wu abeta me Wa pi, ye Lusiyus wa Silɛn, ye Sol, ye Manayɛn. Ndɛ ákwel mboo mɔ̃ y'Elode, wɛn tsɔɔn áli mfam wa nsie yi Ngalile. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, ŋ'ékelweel bɔ Mfam bvool ákesa ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal, Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal oyɛɛn bɔ ndiri: «Esuul mɛ̃ Balanabas ye Sol me pyɛ, kwɛn bɔ asa ɔ̃sal wu eti mɛ̃ bɔ mbel.» <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Obobɔ, ke mbee a ŋ'esi bɔ ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal, bɔ andɔɔl Balanabas ye Sol mviɔɔl, bu asuul bɔ ayɛn.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balanabas ye Sol ke Swipele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Obobɔ, Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal otam Balanabas ye Sol ontam. Bɔ ayɛn bviil li Selesi. Oŋɔ̃, bɔ asam onse ãsua, bu ayɛn esanga ki Swipele. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ bviil li Salamine, bɔ abvi otee onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn m'Ayuda. Dzaã-Maak ákewuaal a bɔ.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, bɔ atsiil nsie yueel yi Swipele, bu atɔ bviil li Pafos. Okɔ, bɔ amwɛn Ɔ̃yuda ngɔmɔ̃ wu ata me Baal-Yeso. Ndɛ áli ngaa wu ákepfuru ndiri ndɛ oli ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Ndɛ ákekal ola Sɛɛdzus Polus, wu nga-ãyal, wu mfam wa nsie oyɔ. Mfam ondɛ otam Balanabas ye Sol mbel ota, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ odzii k'ayoo Endɔɔ e Nziã. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Kɛn a Baal-Yeso, wu abeta m'Elimas m'ɔ̃nywã wa Ngelek, ákekii Balanabas ye Sol, bvool ákesa kwɛn mfam ondɛ abee Endɔɔ e Nziã okiool.<verse eid="ACT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Obobɔ, Sol wu abeta hɛ̃ me Pool oluul m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, bu alɔ Elimas etɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />Ndɛ olieel ndɛ bubu: «Yɛ wu nga-ãyal ãbi, yɛ wu emfuru-baal, yɛ wu muaan a Ɔ̃pfu! Yɛ wu ɔ̃taal a ãndɔɔ mbueel mã dzu, ãnkuul ã Mfam ãli dzu, yɛ k'àyɔɔl k'akii baal mɔ̃ onɔɔn wɛ? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Meba ŋã, tal: Mfam àbɛɛl yɛ, yɛ mviil ãkwa, lio ngelemɔ̃ yɛ k'amwɛn mwiĩ wɛ.» Kɛn a me lio alili, Elimas mviil ãkwi, oyii akɛɛn kɛn okɛɛn, m'obii o wu abiri ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Ŋ'emwɛn mfam a nsie b'obwel, ndɛ oyii ɔ̃kiool, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ okam bibi m'ãtee m'ãtal Mfam.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ye Balanabas k'Antioswe mã Pisidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Pool ye b'ákedzuu ye ndɛ awel ãsua ke Pafos, bu ayɛn bviil li Pɛɛdze k'ɔ̃kiri wa Pamfili. Dzaã-Maak osiil bɔ, obvool Yelusalem. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Bɔ ambal Pɛɛdze, ayɛn bviil li Antioswe k'ɔ̃kiri wa Pisidi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:14">Me tsoo li saba, bɔ asam onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn, bu abvi nsɛn. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Ŋ'aman ɔ̃nkaan wu ãngel ye wu aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã otsiɔ, amfam a nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn ayuɔɔl mbuul oyeyɛɛn bɔ ndiri: «Andoo, okɛɛn byɛ eli y'ãyɛɛn m'ãwa baal mpɛn, oŋɔ̃ ewal oyɛɛn.» <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Pool otɛɛn, oyɛɛn m'ɔ̃liɛɛn kwɛn baal abva ɔ̃lii, ndɛ olieel bubu: «Afi-Isalayel, ye byɛ bueel b'ebelweel Nziã, eyoo! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Nziã a yam li Isalayel ásueel ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ. Ndɛ ásuul bɔ álɔɔ bam bibi ŋ'éli bɔ k'Edzipito. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ ápaal bɔ onse ɔ̃kiri ondɛ me waan e ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Ndɛ áliil bɔ mvel onse ab'ãku-ãna (40) k'ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ ábam ãyam ã baal nsiaan ke nsie yi Kanaan, áwɛɛl nsie a bɔ, áwi yɔ baal a ndɛ, kwɛn yɔ ekal yi bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel ã́si mvel nku-a-nku ɛ̃nkam ɛ̃nã y'ãku-ãtaan (450). Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ áwi bɔ ambiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Nziã mikyɛ ɛ̃ti ambiri m'antwel.</char></note> tiil lio li Samiɛɛn wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã.<verse eid="ACT 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Etɔ oŋɔ̃, ankiɔɔn a bee asɔɔ ɔ̃kwɛn. Nziã owi bɔ Sahul wu muaan a Kis, mbuul wa yam li Bɛnzamɛ̃. Ndɛ osi mvel ãku-ãna (40) m'okwɛn. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Kɛn a Nziã oyiri ndɛ wu Sahul. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ osuul David ɔ̃kwɛn a bɔ. Me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wu David, Nziã oyɛɛn bubu: “Mɛ̃ mbɔɔ David, muaan a Dzese. Ndɛ oli mbuul wu asa mɛ̃ esɛ, ndɛ akieel asa ãndɔɔ mam mbueel me nzii mɛ̃.” <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Eli onse yam e David ku épaal Nziã Yeso wu Ɔ̃mvuul a Isalayel, m'emfa ki éwi ndɛ lɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Ye k'eya Yeso, Dzaã átee baal bam bueel b'Isalayel k'ayewal opongo b'osuo kwɛn bɔ akaal ɛ̃kwal. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Ŋ'étɔ Dzaã ke ntɔ a ɔ̃sal a ndɛ, ndɛ áyɛɛn ndiri: “M'ãtsam ã byɛ, mɛ̃ nã ndi? Mɛ̃ ke ndi Mãsia wu ebekiaal byɛ wɛ! Kɛn a mbuul wu àya, mɛ̃ ke mvaan m'odzuul b'asimpal a ndɛ wɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Baan-ngoo a mɛ̃ ba yam li Abalayam, ye byɛ b'ebelweel Nziã, eli ola bia-byɛ k'áyuɔɔl Endɔɔ li ebvuul baal li. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Kɛn a baal a Yelusalem y'amfam a bɔ k'áyɛɛ ndiri Yeso oli Ɔ̃mvuul ondɛ wɛ. Ãndɔɔ m'ékel aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, m'abetsiɔ saba bwɛn a saba, bɔ hɛ̃ k'abɔɔ mɔ̃ otsɛn wɛ. Kɛn a bɔ asi ãndɔɔ m'élieel aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn omɔ̃, ŋ'éwi bɔ Yeso etumbu. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Onkyam ŋɛn bɔ k'ábɔɔ elyal ki abam ndɛ wɛ, bɔ asɔɔ ola Pilate ndiri awa ndɛ etumbu ki epfu. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Ke mbee a ŋ'esi bɔ mbueel m'ákel me ndɔɔ a Yeso, bɔ akuul ndɛ ke ywel ɔ̃ti, bu alɔ ndɛ onse mpiɛɛn. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Kɛn a Nziã oseel ndɛ onse b'ákwi-ákwi! <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ãtsoo bibi Yeso osuo nzuru ola baal b'áfi Ngalile ye ndɛ tiil Yelusalem. Meba ŋã, baal obɔ b'ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ndɛ ke nkwel a baal. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Bee bam ŋ'ewa byɛ Nsia yi ngesɛ wɛn: Lɔɔ li éwi Nziã ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />ndɛ osi lɔ bam ekoo me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ be baan a bɔ, ŋ'éseel ndɛ Yeso m'epfu, onge b'ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan wu Ãnzii wa mviaal, ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">“Yɛ li Muaan a mɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">mɛ̃ wu mburu yɛ nonɔ̃ ŋã.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Ãnz 2.7</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Nziã áseel Yeso onse b'ákwi-ákwi, m'emfa okyɛ nzuru a ndɛ k'ébwel wɛ. Oyɔ ndɔɔ yi éyɛɛn ndɛ tsɔɔn ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">“Mɛ̃ ekieel ewa byɛ eluɔ bvi ɔ̃nsensal bvi élieel mɛ̃ David,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">eluɔ bvi dzu, bvi ebvaan m'okiool.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Edz 55.3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Ke mboo yinkyɛ bvool áyɛɛn bubu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">“Yɛ k'ayɔɔl mbuul a yɛ wu Ɔ̃nsensal abwal wɛ.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Ãnz 16.10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Kɛn a m'omwiĩ o David, ndɛ áli ɔ̃sal a Nziã. Ndɛ ási m'ékedzii Nziã. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ ákwi, ádziool ndɛ mboo ngamɔ̃ y'ankiɔɔn a ndɛ. Ndɛ ábwel. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Kɛn a mbuul wu éseel Nziã k'ábwel wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Obobɔ, andoo a mɛ̃, ebvaan byɛ eyɛɛ bubu: Eli me nkuul a Yeso kwɛn Nziã abedzeel ãbi ã byɛ, oyɔ ndɔɔ yi eyɛɛn bee byɛ. Kɛn odzeel b'ãbi obɔ, byɛ k'ekoo k'ebɔɔ bɔ m'okiaal o ngel a Moyize wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Me nkuul a Yeso, mbuul bwɛn a mbuul wu akiool, Nziã àsuul ndɛ mbuul wa dzu. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Obobɔ, ekal y'onkyab kwɛn m'élieel aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã mã, ãbee ola byɛ oya:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />“Etal, byɛ ba y'ondɛɛl o nzuru!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Ekam bvool edziɔɔn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ èsa ndɔɔ yi ɛ̃kam me lio e byɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">ndɔɔ yɛn onkyam ŋ'ati byɛ yɔ ɔ̃sam, byɛ k'ekoo k'ekiool bam wɛ!”»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 1:5">Aba 1.5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Ŋ'epal Pool ye Balanabas onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn, aluɔɔn bɔ k'ayeyɛɛn ãndɔɔ mãmã me saba wu ɔ̃nɔɔn. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Ŋ'efi obvɔɔn, Ayuda bibi ye baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ b'abelweel Nziã aluɛɛn a Pool ye Balanabas. Onse ɔ̃sam a bɔ, Pool bwɛn a Balanabas ákewa bɔ luo k'akuru nzuru me nyiĩ a Nziã.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ye Balanabas akuru k'ayi ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Etɔ me tsoo e saba wu ɔ̃nɔɔn, ol'eyɛɛn wɛn baal a bviil bueel, abvɔɔn me ndɔɔ yi ayoo Endɔɔ e Mfam. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ŋ'emwɛn Ayuda ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal, bɔ ayoo ɔ̃kwal-nsɔɔ, abvi ãndɔɔ m'ékeyɛɛn Pool enkyam ota, bvool abvi ndɛ ɛ̃tswɛ oswel. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Kɛn a Pool ye Balanabas ayɛɛn bɔ y'ãŋã ndiri: «Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, al'ebvaan kwɛn atee Endɔɔ e Nziã ola byɛ b'Ayuda. Onge bɛn byam ebee lɔ bvool emwɛn kwɛn byɛ k'ebvaan m'obɔɔ b'elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu wɛ, bee ŋ'esɔɔn baal bɛn k'ali Ayuda wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Mfam atam bee ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">“Mɛ̃ nsuul yɛ mwiĩ wu àyɛɛl ɛ̃kiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">me ndɔɔ yi abiri obvuul tiil ke ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:6">Edz 49.6</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Ŋ'eyoo baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ asia mpaa, bu abvi Endɔɔ e Mfam olweel, ye baal bam bueel b'ésueel Nziã me ndɔɔ yi abɔɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu, bɔ bu ayii akiool. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Endɔɔ e Mfam etsɔɔn m'etswi e nsie ki Pisidi kyam kieel. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Kɛn Ayuda asi nsiɔɔl ol'akaal ba bvɛɛ b'abebuɛɛn Nziã a Ayuda, ye baal b'anɛn ba bviil olɔ. Obobɔ, bɔ atsɛɛn baal k'atuaal Pool ye Balanabas mpal, bvool atswɛɛl bɔ m'etswi e nsie e bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Pool ye Balanabas akweel ɔ̃fel wu áli me ntaã e bɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okweel b'ɔ̃fel wu áli me ntaã e bɔ, ŋ'esuo kwɛn ndɔɔ yi esi baal obɔ eli mbi-mbi. Yeso mbuul wu áyɛɛn atam a ndɛ k'asa obobɔ (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:10-11">Luk 10.10-11</ref></char>).</note>, bu ayɛn bviil li Ikonihum. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Me b'otal ayio b'alili k'Antioswe, oŋɔ̃ bɔ aluul m'esɛ, aluul m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal hɛ̃.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Pool ye Balanabas k'Ikonihum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />K'Ikonihum, Pool ye Balanabas ayɛn hɛ̃ ayesam onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn a Ayuda, bɔ atee m'emfa kyɛn Ayuda ye baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ bibi ayii akiool. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Kɛn Ayuda bakyɛ b'ábee okiool asi nsiɔɔl ola bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ k'akal y'ãtsam m'ãbi-ãbi m'andoo. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Kɛn a Pool ye Balanabas akool ãtsoo m'ɔ̃lɔɔ onse bviil olɔ. Bɔ ákeyɛɛn y'ãŋã, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ áketa kaã me Mfam. Ndɛ wu Mfam ákesuo otaa-taa b'Endɔɔ e nyiĩ a ndɛ yi nɛn me waan y'emwã bvi ékesa bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Baal ba bviil olɔ, akab ebaal bviaal, bɛn m'epie ki Ayuda, bɛn m'epie ki antam.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, y'Ayuda bwɛn amfam a bɔ awɛɛ k'atuaal antam mpal, bvool k'atyal bɔ ãnkɔɔn. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Ŋ'eyoo bɔ nsia oyɔ, bɔ abal onse ãbviil mã nsie yi Likahoni: Bviil li Lisitele ye li Dɛɛbe, ye mã nku-a-nku a mɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Okɔ, bɔ atee Nsia yi Ngesɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ye Balanabas ke Lisitele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Ke Lisitele éli ye bɔɔl ngɔmɔ̃ wu ékwi mviil. Ndɛ áli ekal fa mwiĩ a ngoo, ndɛ mwɛn-éndɛɛl kɛn adzuu wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Ndɛ ákeyoo m'ékeyɛɛn Pool. Ndɛ wu Pool olɔ ndɛ etɔ, omwɛn kwɛn ndɛ oli y'okiool me ndɔɔ yi abvuul. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Ndɛ bu ayɛɛn kokɔ ndiri: «Tɛɛn, kal dzu me ntaã e yɛ!» Mbuul ondɛ ayebiri kab lam nyã, obvi odzuu.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Ŋ'emwɛn baal b'esi Pool, bɔ abiool m'ɔ̃nywã wu Alikahoni ndiri: «Anziã ke bɛn awel emfa e baal, bu asool ola bee.» <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Bɔ ati Balanabas me nziã «Dzehus», Pool wu eti bɔ me nziã «Hɛɛmes», me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ wu ákeyɛɛn. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Nzɔ yi abebuɛɛn Dzehus éli k'ɔ̃nywã a bviil. Ngaa-a-nziã a Dzehus obiri alam b'angwɛmbɛ ye bviĩ bvi ebvɛ-ebvɛ nkal a bɔ, k'ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃ nzɔ oyɔ. Ndɛ ákedzii k'awa Pool ye Balanabas kab, mfoo ngamɔ̃ ye baal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emfa ki esi bɔ okyɛ, ki ebesa bɔ tsɔɔn, me ndɔɔ yi alweel anziã.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ŋ'eyoo antam ange-buaal ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ akɔɔl ekɔ e bɔ, ayɛn tswa-a-tswa onse baal, abiool ndiri: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />«Andoo, ki esa byɛ obobɔ emã? Bee hɛ̃ baal onge byɛ eli! Okɛɛn bee etee byɛ Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eyɔɔl anziã b'etiɔ bɛn otsɛn pyɛ ba, kwɛn byɛ ekɔɔl ola Nziã wa mwiĩ. Ndɛ wu ási ywel ye nsie, y'ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa, y'eluɔ bvieel bvi eli onse okɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn ndɛ áyɔɔl ãyam ã baal mam mbueel ã́nɔɔn ãnkuul ã bam. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Kɛn a ndɛ k'ákwɛɛn k'asuo bɔ obvɛ o ndɛ wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, fa ywel, ndɛ abeyuɔɔl byɛ amvel y'ekwɛn me lio li ngesɛ. Ndɛ hɛ̃ abewa byɛ bvi-odza bibi, bvool abeluul ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ m'esɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Onkyam ŋɛn Pool ye Balanabas ayɛɛn obobɔ, bɔ amwɛn fool bibi m'oluo o baal k'awa bɔ ãkab.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Me lio alili, Ayuda afi Antioswe y'Ikonihum. Bɔ asi baal nsiɔɔl k'adzoo Pool ãnkɔɔn. Onge bɛn bɔ áketsam ndiri ndɛ ŋ'akwi, bɔ adzuru ndɛ me nsie-a-nsie tiil k'apaal ndɛ onse bviil. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Kɛn ayio ayedzii ndɛ, ndɛ otɛɛn, bu abvool onse bviil. Ŋ'etsi bviil, ndɛ oyɛn Dɛɛbe ye Balanabas.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ye Balanabas abvool k'Antioswe mã Sili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Pool ye Balanabas atee Nsia yi Ngesɛ onse bviil li Dɛɛbe. Onse bviil olɔ, bɔ abɔɔ akiool bibi. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, bɔ abvool ke Lisitele, k'Ikonihum, bvool k'Antioswe mã Pisidi. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Bɔ awi ayio mpɛn, bvool awi bɔ luo k'asɛn ãnã onse okiool, ndiri: «Ebvaan bia-byɛ emwɛn fool bibi, m'osam onse Okwɛn o Nziã.» <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Onse Ebvɔɔn bwɛn a Ebvɔɔn, Pool ye Balanabas asueel baal b'akal akuul-kuul. Obobɔ, ke mbee a ŋ'ebuɛɛn bɔ bvool asi ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal, bɔ awi akuul-kuul obɔ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ Mfam wu élɔ bɔ okiool onse ndɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Ke mbee a ŋ'etsiil Pool ye Balanabas Pisidi, bɔ atɔ Pamfili. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Bɔ atee Endɔɔ e Nziã ke Pɛɛdze, bu ayɛn Atali. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Bɔ ambal oŋɔ̃, awel ãsua abvool Antioswe mã Sili, ke mboo yi áwi bɔ me nyiĩ a Nziã me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal wu efi bɔ osa. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ, bɔ abvool Ebvɔɔn, bu awi bɔ nsia a ãndɔɔ mbueel m'esi Nziã me nkuul a bɔ, y'emfa ki edzweel ndɛ baal bɛn k'áli Ayuda wɛ nkuul a okiool. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Pool ye Balanabas akal lio li ela y'ayio k'Antioswe.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Otsuun me ndɔɔ yi etal otsiil o nzuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Baal ke kwɛ afi Yude, ayi Antioswe. Bɔ abvi andoo a dzii otee bubu: «Okɛɛn k'atsiil byɛ onge b'etam ãngel ã Moyize wɛ, byɛ k'ekoo m'obvuul wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Pool ye Balanabas abveel ndiri k'obobɔ wɛ, ɛ̃tsuun mi kokɔ ɛ̃bvi kal-a-kal a bɔ. Obobɔ, baal akuru kwɛn Pool ye Balanabas ye baal k'Antioswe bakyɛ ayi Yelusalem, me ndɔɔ yi ayetal ndɔɔ oyɔ y'antam y'akuul-kuul b'Ebvɔɔn. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Ebvɔɔn li Antioswe ewi bɔ eluɔ bvieel me ndɔɔ a dzwɛ olɔ. Bɔ atsiil Fenisi ye Samali, ayɛɛn emfa ki ekaal baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ ɛ̃kwal ayi ola Nziã. Nsia oyɔ ékesa akiool bueel esɛ bibi.<verse eid="ACT 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ Yelusalem, Ebvɔɔn y'antam, y'akuul-kuul ayɔɔ bɔ. Pool ye Balanabas alieel bɔ mam mbueel m'esi Nziã me nkuul a bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Kɛn a baal ke kwɛ ba nkel a Afalisaye, b'ayii akiool, atɛɛn me ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛn ndiri: «Obvie atsiil akiool bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, bvool atam bɔ k'akiaal ãngel ã Moyize.»<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Antam y'akuul-kuul bu abvɔɔn m'otal o ndɔɔ oyɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Ke mbee a ŋ'emeetsuun emeetsuun bɔ, Piɛɛl otɛɛn bvool olieel bɔ bubu: «Andoo a mɛ̃, byɛ eyɛɛ kwɛn bɛɛn etel-nziil, Nziã asueel mɛ̃ onse byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ nsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, kwɛn bɔ ayoo yɔ bvool akiool. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Nziã wu oyɛɛ ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ baal, osuo kwɛn ndɛ oyɔɔ bɔ ŋ'ewi ndɛ bɔ Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal onge b'ési ndɛ me bia-byɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Ndɛ k'asi ɔ̃bɛɛ mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ bɔ ye bia-byɛ wɛ. Ndɛ osuɔɔl ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ, me ndɔɔ yi ekiool bɔ Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Meba ŋã, ndɔɔ mã yi epwee byɛ Nziã, ŋ'eywɛɛn byɛ ayio pfuũ lɛn, ekal ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ, ekal bia-byam, k'ekoo m'obiri o lɔ wɛ? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Bia-byɛ mpii ebekiool wɛn bia-byɛ ebvuul me nyiĩ a Mfam Yeso yi nɛn, emfa ngemɔ̃ onge bɔ!»<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Baal bueel b'ábvɔɔn abvi ɔ̃lii, me ndɔɔ yi ayoo k'eyɛɛn Balanabas ye Pool emwã y'emvieel bvam bvieel bvi ési Nziã me nkuul a bɔ ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Ŋ'eman bɔ oyɛɛn, Dzak abvuru oyɛɛn, olieel bubu: «Andoo a dzii, emeeyoo mɛ̃! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simɔ̃ olieel bia-byɛ emfa kyɛn fa obɛɛn, Nziã ndyam ákuru k'asuaal onse bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ baal b'àkal yam e ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãyi nkuul ngamɔ̃ y'ãyɛɛn m'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, ke ngwel wɛ ákel bubu:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />“Mfam oyɛɛn ndiri: Ke mbee oŋɔ̃ mɛ̃ èyebvool,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">me ndɔɔ yi efaal nzɔ a David yi étsɔɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">Mɛ̃ èfaal nzɔ a ndɛ yi átsal,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">bvool mɛ̃ ètɛɛl yɔ tɛ.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Obobɔ, baal bueel b'asiil àbii Mfam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">ngwanyã, ãyam omɔ̃ mbueel m'éti mɛ̃ mbel k'ãkal mã mɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">Omɔ̃ m'eyɛɛn Mfam, wu asa ãndɔɔ omɔ̃,<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />ndɛ wu asuo ãtsam ã ndɛ bɛɛn etel-nziil.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amo 9.11-12</ref></char></note>”»<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Dzak olweel ndiri: «Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ etsam wɛn, baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ b'akiool Nziã, ebee bɔ dzool ota. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Kɛn a bia-byɛ ekel bɔ bubu: “Ebee anyam ba mbiin b'awi ãkab ol'etiɔ odza. Ebee ntal obvool ye mbuul wɛn byɛ kɛn ebaal bakyɛ wɛ, ebee anyam b'akwa etsɔɔn odza, ebee ãkel hɛ̃ odza.” <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bɛɛn etel-nziil onse bviil bwɛn a bviil, baal abetee ãngel ã Moyize, nzal-a-ŋɛn abetsiɔ mɔ̃ onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn asaba bueel.»<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔ̃nkaan wu ayuɔɔl akiool bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Obobɔ, antam y'akuul-kuul y'Ebvɔɔn lam lueel akuru k'asuaal baal ke kwɛ onse bɔ b'èyuɔɔl bɔ Antioswe bwɛn a Pool ye Balanabas. Bɔ asueel Yuda wu abeta hɛ̃ me Balasabas, ye Silas, b'ékewal baal ye dzuun onse andoo. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Bɔ awi bɔ ɔ̃nkaan wu áswɛn bubu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">«Bee b'antam y'akuul-kuul, b'andoo a byɛ a dzii, bee ebio byɛ b'andoo bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, b'eli k'Antioswe, b'eli ke Sili ye b'eli ke Silisi. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Bee eyoo ndiri baal b'afi ola bee alɔ ɛ̃tswab onse byɛ bvool abiil ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ m'ãyɛɛn ã bɔ. Bee k'etam bɔ ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ osa wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn bee bueel ɔ̃dzoo ɔ̃mɔ̃, esueel baal me ndɔɔ yi eyuɔɔl bɔ ola byɛ. Bɔ àyesuul andoo a bia-byɛ Balanabas ye Pool, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />b'awi bwel me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Obobɔ bee eyuɔɔl Yuda ye Silas, bɔ baal b'àyɛɛn byɛ ãndɔɔ amãmã m'ɔ̃nywã a bam. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal ye bee myam, ekuru kwɛn bee ebee byɛ bvool ãngel ãkyam oywɛɛn. Kɛn a byɛ ebvaan ekiaal ãngel mã nkiin mã: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Ebee anyam b'awi ãkab ol'etiɔ odza, ebee ãkel odza, ebee anyam b'akwa etsɔɔn odza, ebee ntal obvool ye mbuul wɛn byɛ kɛn ebaal bakyɛ wɛ. Ŋɛn byɛ ebee ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ osa, byɛ ol'esi ngesɛ. Ekal obɔ!»<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Pool, ye Balanabas, ye Yuda, ye Silas ayelɛɛl Ebvɔɔn, ayɛn Antioswe. Okɔ, bɔ abvool nkel a akiool, bu awi bɔ ɔ̃nkaan. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Ŋ'atsiɔ ɔ̃nkaan ondɛ, bɔ bueel aluul m'esɛ m'ãyɛɛn ã ndɛ m'ã́kewa bɔ mpɛn. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yuda ye Silas b'áli bam hɛ̃ aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, ayɛɛn akiool ãndɔɔ bibi m'ãwa bɔ mpɛn bvool ãwɛɛl bɔ onse okiool. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Ke mbee a ŋ'ekal bɔ muaan-lio k'Antioswe, akiool alɛɛl bɔ ndiri abvool ngesɛ ola b'átam bɔ. [ <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Kɛn a Silas okuru k'asiil oŋɔ̃, Yuda bu abvool Yelusalem ndyam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi, k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Nziã mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>] <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Me b'otal Pool ye Balanabas, bɔ asiil k'Antioswe. Bɔ ákeyiool bvool áketsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Mfam, ye bakyɛ bibi.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool bwɛn Balanabas akab nzuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Ke mbee ãlio ke kwɛ, Pool oyɛɛn Balanabas bubu: «Ekɔɔl eyetal andoo a dzii onse ãbviil mam mbueel m'étee bia-byɛ Endɔɔ e Mfam, me ndɔɔ yi etal emfa ki eyii bɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Balanabas ákedzii kwɛn Dzaã-Maak ayi ye bɔ, <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />kɛn a Pool áketsam ndiri k'eli ngesɛ wɛ kwɛn bɔ awal mbuul wu áyiri bɔ ke Pamfili bvool k'áyesa ɔ̃sal ye bɔ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Ɛ̃tsuun ɛ̃yenduru, bɔ atsɔɔn. Balanabas owel Dzaã-Maak, bu asam ãsua ayɛn Swipele. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Me b'otal Pool, ndɛ osueel Silas. Akiool asɔɔ nyiĩ a Mfam me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wu Pool, ndɛ bu ayɛn. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Ndɛ otsiil Sili ye Silisi, awa Ãbvɔɔn mpɛn.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timote oyesuul Pool ye Silas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Pool otɔ Dɛɛbe, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ndɛ oyɛn Lisitele. Oŋɔ̃ éli y'ɔ̃yio ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Timote. Ngoo a ndɛ áli Ɔ̃yuda wu áyii ɔ̃kiool, kɛn a tal a ndɛ áli Ɔ̃gelek. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Andoo a dzii ba Lisitele ye b'Ikonihum ákeyɛɛn obvɛ bibi me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Pool ákedzii k'abiri ndɛ. Ndɛ owel ndɛ, otsiil ndɛ nzuru me ndɔɔ Ayuda b'áli m'etswi e nsie obvɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bueel áyɛɛ kwɛn tal a ndɛ áli Ɔ̃gelek. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Onse ãbviil mbueel m'ékebwel Pool ye Silas, bɔ ákeliaal akiool ãndɔɔ m'ékuru antam y'akuul-kuul a Yelusalem, bvool áketam bɔ mɔ̃ osa. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Ãbvɔɔn ãkewam onse okiool, bvool ɔ̃bvɛn wu akiool ákelɔɔ tsoo bwɛn a tsoo.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ati Pool mbel k'ayi Maseduaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal oluo Pool ye Silas k'atsal Nsia a Nziã onse etswi e nsie ki Adzi. Obobɔ, bɔ abwel ke Filidzi ye Ngalati. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ tsotsoo a Midzi, bɔ abɔɔ ãtsam m'ayi Bitini. Kɛn oŋɔ̃ bvool, Ɔ̃fel a Yeso k'awi bɔ nkuul wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn bɔ atsiil Midzi, bu ayɛn buu li Telohas. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Me tsia ngɔmɔ̃, Pool olueel ɔ̃tswɛ a twal, ndɛ omwɛn ɔ̃fi-Maseduaan ngɔmɔ̃ tɛ ke nkwel a ndɛ, ákeluɔɔn ndɛ bubu: «Bwel ke Maseduaan, bvool y'awuaal a bee!» <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Ke mbee emwɛn olɔ, bee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yi-bu mboo yɛn Luk wu ákel ɔ̃nkaan wu, áyebvɔɔn ye Pool me ndɔɔ yi ayesuul ndɛ ke dzwɛ.</char></note> eyii ebii k'eyi Maseduaan, ke ngwel wɛ bee éli y'okiool wɛn Nziã ŋ'ati bee mbel me ndɔɔ yi eyetsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ okɔ.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ke Filipese, Lidi okaal ɔ̃kwal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Bee esam ãsua ke Telohas, bu eyɛn nzu-tɛ k'esanga ki Samotelase. Ŋ'etsi bviil, bee eyɛn Nehapolis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Embal oŋɔ̃, bee eyɛn bviil li Filipese. Bviil olɔ eli li ɛ̃kwel li nsie yi Maseduaan, bvool eli ke nsɛn okwɛn o Lom. Bee esi ãtsoo ke kwɛ onse lɔ.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Me tsoo li saba, bee epal onse bviil me ndɔɔ yi eyi nku-a-nku a mvieel. Ke ngwel wɛ, bee éketsam wɛn okɔ ol'ekal ye mboo ãbuɛɛn m'Ayuda. Bee ebvi nsɛn, bu ebvi ɔ̃sam ota y'akaal b'ábvɔɔn ke mboo oyɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Ngɔmɔ̃ onse akaal obɔ wɛn nkuũ Lidi, áli ɔ̃fi-bviil li Tiatiil. Ndɛ áketiɔ ankaã b'abvɛ-a-bvɛ b'abɛbɛ, bvool ákelweel Nziã. Ndɛ ákeyoo bee. Mfam odzweel ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ kwɛn ndɛ akal y'onkyab onse ãndɔɔ m'ékeyɛɛn Pool. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Ndɛ owel opongo ye yam e ndɛ lueel, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ndɛ oti bee mbel ndiri: «Okɛɛn byɛ emwɛn wɛn taa-taa mɛ̃ nkiool Mfam, oŋɔ̃ eyebuo lɔɔ ola mɛ̃.» Ndɛ bu aywɛɛn bee k'ekiool.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ye Silas onse bwal ke Filipese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, bee ékeyi mboo a ãbuɛɛn. Ɔ̃sal ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal oyemwɛɛn ye bee. Ndɛ áli y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi wu ákesa kwɛn ndɛ ayɛɛn baal ãndɔɔ m'ãya. Amfam a ndɛ ákebɔɔ nzi bibi m'ãndɔɔ omɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Ndɛ ákenɔɔn a bee, bee ye Pool, ákebiool ndiri: «Baal ba ali asal a Nziã-a-Mpuu! Bɔ asuo byɛ nkuul yi abɔɔ obvuul!» <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Onge bɛn ndɛ ákesa obobɔ ãtsoo bibi, Pool oyi mpuru, okɔɔl, bu alieel ɔ̃fel ondɛ bubu: «Me nkuũ a Yeso Mãsia, mɛ̃ ntam yɛ wɛn pal onse ndɛ!» Ɛ̃kiri-anka oŋɔ̃, ɔ̃fel opal.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Ŋ'emwɛn amfam a ndɛ kwɛn kaã e bɔ li éketwal bɔ bvel me ndɛ ŋ'efi, bɔ asiin Pool ye Silas, bu abiri bɔ ke mbal ol'amfam. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Bɔ abiri bɔ ol'antwel a Lom, ndiri: «Baal ba ali Ayuda b'abelɔ tsungaa onse bviil e bia-byɛ, <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />bvool abeyiool onkɔɔ bɛn k'awi bia-byɛ ba ke nsie a Lom nkuul yi ekiool wuo yi enɔɔn wɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Embuul bu eyiool hɛ̃ nkal a Pool ye Silas. Antwel atswi bɔ ekɔ, bu atam ndiri apfel bɔ ɔ̃dzii. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Ke mbee a ŋ'epfel bɔ bɔ ɔ̃dzii wa kokɔ, bɔ atyel bɔ me bwal, bu atam ɔ̃nkiaal a bwal k'atal bɔ ngesɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Ŋ'eyoo ɔ̃nkiaal a bwal ontam obɔ, ndɛ oyewɔɔl bɔ onse etswi e bwal ki ke ntɔ, bu akuru bɔ ntaã me nkwii. <verse eid="ACT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Ŋ'eyii sua kuku, Pool ye Silas ákebuɛɛn bvool ákeyam m'olweel o Nziã, baal a bwal b'asiil ákeyoo bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Enseel oŋɔ̃, nsie enziool nzuru yam kokɔ, onziool obɔ osiɔ etsɛn bvi ebɔɔ e nzɔ a bwal. Ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃ nzɔ mvieel bu ɛ̃dzweel nzuru alili oŋɔ̃, bvool ãmpaa ã baal a bwal bueel ãpiool. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Ɔ̃nkiaal a bwal odzam me twal. Ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ kwɛn ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃ bwal ɛ̃mɛɛ̃dzweel nzuru, ndɛ odzuru epwel e ndɛ m'obam o nzuru, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ áketsam ndiri baal a bwal ŋ'amaabal. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Pool bu abiool bam kokɔ ndiri: «Bee nzuru obi osa, bee bueel eli ŋã!»<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Ɔ̃nkiaal a bwal osɔɔ mbunda, bu asam bam onse bwal ye nkaã, y'etiɔɔl e buɔ lueel, ndɛ otyel nzuru ke ntaã e Pool ye Silas. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ opaal bɔ, bu afuul bɔ bubu: «Abetaal, ki esa mɛ̃ emã, me ndɔɔ yi ebvuul?» <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ bubu: «Kiool Mfam Yeso, obobɔ yɛ àbvuul, yɛ ye baal a nzɔ a yɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Bɔ bu atee ndɛ Endɔɔ e Mfam, ndɛ ye baal bueel b'ákekal onse nzɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Kɛn a me lio alili nkal a kuku, ndɛ obiri bɔ me ndɔɔ yi asuɔɔl bɔ ãbwɔɔ. Ndɛ owel opongo alili oŋɔ̃, ye baal a ndɛ bueel. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Ndɛ obiri Pool ye Silas ke nzɔ a ndɛ, bu awi bɔ bvi-odza. Ndɛ osia mpaa, ndɛ ye baal a ndɛ bueel, me ndɔɔ yi akiool Nziã.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Ŋ'etsi bviil, antwel a Lom ayuɔɔl baal ayeyɛɛn ɔ̃nkiaal a bwal ndiri: «Paal baal obɔ!» <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Ndɛ oyeliaal Pool ndiri: «Antwel atam ndiri epaal byɛ. Meba ŋã, byɛ ekoo m'opal bvool ekoo m'oyi onse opi.» <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Pool obveel bɔ bubu: «Bɔ atam k'abɛɛl bee ke nkwel a baal bueel, k'atsiil ndɔɔ a bee kɛn wɛ! Kwɛn ŋɛn bee baal a Lom! Bɔ atyel bee me bwal. Bvool meba ŋã, bɔ ayii adzii k'apaal bee m'edziɔɔn? Mfya! Bam aya ayepaal bee!» <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Antam a mbal ayeyɛɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ol'antwel a Lom. Bɔ ayoo buɔ ŋ'eyɛɛ bɔ kwɛn Pool ye Silas baal a Lom ali. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Bɔ ayesɔɔ bɔ odzeel, apaal bɔ onse bwal, y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri apal onse bviil. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Ŋ'epal Pool ye Silas onse bwal, bɔ ayɛn ola Lidi. Bɔ amwɛɛn y'andoo a dzii, awi bɔ mpɛn, bu ayɛn.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Pool ye Silas ke bviil li Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Pool ye Silas abwel li Ãmfipolis ye li Apoloni, bu atɔ Tesalonik. Oŋɔ̃, Ayuda áli ye nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Pool oyɛn okɔ, onge b'ékesa ndɛ onse bviil bwɛn a bviil. Onse asaba atyel, ndɛ áketsuun y'Ayuda b'áli oŋɔ̃ me m'ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan wu Ɔ̃nsensal. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Ndɛ ákeyɛɛl bɔ mɔ̃ bvool ákesuo kwɛn, Mãsia ákeya fool omwɛn bvool ásiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi. Ndɛ ákeliaal bɔ ndiri: «Yeso wu ebetsal mɛ̃ byɛ nsia wu, ndɛ ondɛ Mãsia ali.» <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Ayuda ke kwɛ akiool, bɔ bu abvɔɔn ye Pool bwɛn a Silas. Agelek bibi b'abelweel Nziã ayi hɛ̃ ola bɔ, y'akaal ba bvɛɛ bibi.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Kɛn Ayuda bakyɛ aluul me nsɔɔ. Bɔ abvool baal ba ngwel-a-ngwel b'ákekɛɛn onse abal-bal, alɔ ɛ̃tsab onse embuul ye tsungaa onse bviil. Bɔ aloo ke nzɔ a Dzason m'oyebii o Pool ye Silas, kwɛn abiri bɔ ke nkwel a baal. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Kɛn a bɔ k'amwɛn bɔ wɛ. Obobɔ, bɔ abiri Dzason y'akiool ke kwɛ ke nkwel a mfam a bviil, bu abvi obiool ndiri: «Angaburu obɔ amaalɔ tsungaa onse ɔ̃kiri wueel, meba ŋã bɔ amaaya ŋã! <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Dzason oyɔɔ bɔ ola ndɛ. Bɔ bueel k'abekiaal ãngel ã Sedzaal wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ abeyɛɛn ndiri eli y'ɔ̃kwɛn ɔ̃kyam wɛn nkuũ Yeso.» <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Ŋ'eyoo embuul y'amfam a bviil ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, bɔ ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃bii. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Obobɔ, Dzason y'akiool bakyɛ afuru yaã, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ bɔ ayɔɔl bɔ.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ye Silas ke Bele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Ŋ'ebvi tsia, andoo a dzii asuul Pool ye Silas ayɛn Bele. Ŋ'etɔ bɔ okɔ, bɔ ayɛn onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn a Ayuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Ayuda b'oŋɔ̃ áli y'ãtsam mã ngesɛ, m'ãnduru mã ba Tesalonik. Bɔ ayɔɔ Endɔɔ e Nziã y'efua bibi. Tsoo bwɛn a tsoo, bɔ ákesɔɔl Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã me ndɔɔ yi atal okɛɛn m'ã́keyɛɛn bɔ ãli mã taa-taa. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Baal bibi onse bɔ ayii akiool. Onse Afi-ngelek, akaal ba bvɛɛ y'abɔɔl bibi ayii akiool hɛ̃.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Kɛn Ayuda ba Tesalonik ayeyoo ndiri Pool abetee Endɔɔ e Nziã hɛ̃ ke Bele, bɔ ayi oŋɔ̃, kwɛn ke mboo oyɔ hɛ̃, bɔ asa nsiɔɔl bvool alɔ tsungaa onse baal. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Tswa-a-tswa oŋɔ̃, andoo a dzii asuul Pool oyɛn me li nzal, kɛn a Silas ye Timote asiil ke Bele. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Baal b'ákedzoo Pool abiri ndɛ tiil Atɛn. Bɔ bu akɔɔl Bele y'ɔ̃kiɛɛn wu éyuɔɔl Pool Silas bwɛn a Timote ndiri anɔɔn a ndɛ bam tswa-a-tswa.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool k'Atɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Ŋ'ékekiaal Pool Silas bwɛn a Timote k'Atɛn, ndɛ oyoo nkyee bibi ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ kwɛn bviil olɔ eluul m'etiɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn, ndɛ áketsuun y'Ayuda ye baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ b'ákelweel Nziã, bvool tsoo bwɛn a tsoo, ndɛ áketsuun hɛ̃ ye b'ékemwɛɛn a ndɛ ye bɔ ke taan. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Anga-ãyal ba nkel yi Epikwiil ye yi Sitoyisiɛ̃ hɛ̃ abvi otsuun ye ndɛ. Bɛn ákefuul ndiri: «Nswɛ-nga-oliaal wu ãmã abeliaal?» Bakyɛ ndiri: «Ndɛ onge wu abetee anziã b'ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃kyam.» Ke ngwel wɛ, Pool áketsal Nsia a Yeso ye yi osiool o b'ákwi-ákwi. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Bɔ awel ndɛ, bu abiri ndɛ ke mbal a bviil. Bɔ afuul ndɛ bubu: «Bee ekoo m'oyɛɛ ãtee m'alili m'ebeyɛɛn yɛ? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Yɛ abeyɛɛn bee ãndɔɔ m'ɛ̃kam, obobɔ bee edzii k'eyɛɛ otsɛn o mɔ̃ ngesɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Ke yam, Afi-Atɛn bueel y'anzii b'ákekal oŋɔ̃ ákesuul lio e bɔ ékebwel kɛn a m'obeyɛɛn wuo m'obeyoo ãtee m'alili.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul à Athènes" file="WA03981b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade, © United Bible Societies, 1989" ref="17.16-31" /><verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Pool ayetɛɛn nkal a mbal a bviil, olieel bubu: «Afi-atɛn, mɛ̃ emwɛn kwɛn byɛ ebelweel anziã m'ãndɔɔ mbueel. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'ekedziɔɔn mɛ̃ bviil e byɛ bvool eketal etiɔ e byɛ bvi ngel, mɛ̃ bam emwɛn nkiin ngamɔ̃ yi awa ãkab aswɛn ãmpiri mã: “Ola nziã wɛn baal k'ayɛɛ wɛ.” Taa-taa bam, ki ebelweel byɛ oyɛɛ wɛ okyɛ, ki ngyi mɛ̃ byɛ otee. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Nziã wu ábuo ɔ̃kiri ye bvieel bvi eli onse ndɛ, oli Mfam a ywel ye nsie. Ndɛ k'abekal onse ãnzɔ m'etuu mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Ndɛ hɛ̃ k'ali ye kɔɔ lɛn mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal ɛ̃sa ndɛ onkyam ɔ̃sal k'ɔ̃mã wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ wu abewa eluɔ bvieel elaã y'ɔ̃fiaal, ye bvieel bvi esiil. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Bɛɛn me mbuul ngɔmɔ̃, ndɛ obuo ãyam ã baal mbueel, bvool osuul mɔ̃ me nsie yueel. Ndɛ oyɛɛl mɔ̃ ɛ̃bvu, bvool otsiil ɛ̃ndel m'ãmboo m'ekal mɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Nziã ási obobɔ me ndɔɔ yɛn baal abii ndɛ, bvool abɔɔ ndɛ ŋ'afaan afaan. Ke yam, Nziã k'ali lela ye mbuul bwɛn a mbuul onse bia-byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Ke ngwel wɛ, áyɛɛn ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">“Eli me ndɔɔ a ndɛ kwɛn bia-byɛ eli y'elaã,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">kwɛn bia-byɛ ebedzuu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">bvool kwɛn bia-byɛ eli.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Bakyɛ onse ãyam a byɛ áyɛɛn yɔ hɛ̃ ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">“Bia-byɛ hɛ̃ eli baan a ndɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Obobɔ, ŋɛn bia-byɛ baan a ndɛ eli, bia-byɛ k'ekoo m'otsam wɛn Nziã oli emfa ngemɔ̃ y'etiɔ ki ɔɔl, ki nzi wuo ki nkɔɔn, ki abuo m'ãyal y'ãtsam ã baal wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Ke yam, Nziã k'abesiɔɔl ãlio m'éli baal onse odzɛɛn wɛ. Kɛn a meba, ndɛ abeta baal bueel b'ãmboo mbueel mbel m'okaal b'ɛ̃kwal. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ ál'amaayɛɛl tsoo li ètsiil ndɛ ãndɔɔ ã baal b'ɔ̃kiri wueel m'emfa ki dzu. Ndɛ ál'amaasuaal mbuul me ndɔɔ oyɔ. Ndɛ ásuo baal bueel kwɛn ndɛ ásueel ndɛ, ŋ'éseel ndɛ ndɛ onse b'ákwi-ákwi!»<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Ŋ'eyoo bɔ Pool oyɛɛn me ndɔɔ osiool o b'ákwi-ákwi, bakyɛ abvi ndɛ osɔɔl, bakyɛ ayɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: «Bee èyoo yɛ me ndɔɔ oyɔ lio ekyam!» <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Pool bu asiil bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Kɛn a baal ke kwɛ anɔɔn a ndɛ, bu ayii akiool. Onse bɔ, éli ye wu ata me Denis, ngɔmɔ̃ onse baal a mbal a bviil, y'ɔ̃kaal wɛn nkuũ Damalis, ye bakyɛ bvool.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Pool ke Kolinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Pool ombal Atɛn, bu ayɛn Kolinte. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Okɔ, ndɛ omwɛɛn y'Ɔ̃yuda ngɔmɔ̃ wu abeta m'Akilas, ɔ̃fi-etswi e nsie ki Ponte. Ndɛ áyi alili oŋɔ̃ k'áfi Itali y'ɔ̃kal a ndɛ Pilisile, ke ngwel wɛ ɔ̃kwɛn Kolode átam Ayuda bueel k'ambal ke Lom. Pool onam ye bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Ɔ̃sal a kuɔɔl a Pool áli wuwu ye wa bɔ, wu abetuu ãnzɔ mã m'ebaan bvi anyam. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ndɛ oyekal ola bɔ, bɔ bu asal mboo mɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Tsoo bwɛn a tsoo li saba, Pool ákewal oyɛɛn ke nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn, bvool ákesa mpɛn yi aswɛɛl Ayuda y'Agelek ãtsam.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Me lio li eyi Silas ye Timote k'afi Maseduaan, Pool owel lio e ndɛ lueel m'otee o Nsia a Nziã. Ndɛ ákesuo ke nkwel Ayuda wɛn Yeso oli Mãsia. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Kɛn Ayuda k'ákekiool ndɛ wɛ, bvool áketoo ndɛ. Obobɔ, ndɛ okweel ɔ̃fel wu ekɔ e ndɛ, bvool olieel bɔ bubu: «Yɔɔl etsob okyɛ ebva nkal ɛ̃tswɛ ɛ̃ byam! Mbyel k'ebekal yi mɛ̃ wɛ. Bɛɛn meba ŋã, mɛ̃ èyi ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Ndɛ ombal ke mboo oyɔ, bu ayɛn ola mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Titihus Yusitus. Mbuul ondɛ k'áli Ɔ̃yuda wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ ákelweel Nziã, bvool nzɔ a ndɛ éli tsotsoo a nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kilisipus wu mfam a nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn okiool Mfam, ndɛ ye yam e ndɛ lueel. Afi-Kolinte bibi b'ákeyoo Pool akiool bvool awel opongo.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Tsia ngɔmɔ̃, Mfam olieel Pool onse emwɛn bubu: «Bee ye buɔ okal! Yɛɛn kɛn oyɛɛn, bee pi okal. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ndyam ndi ye yɛ. Mbuul wu andɔɔl kuɔɔl nkal a yɛ m'osa o yɛ obi k'ali wɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn bibi onse bviil li ali ba mɛ̃.» <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Pool okal ke Kolinte mvel ngɔmɔ̃ y'etswel m'otee b'Endɔɔ e Nziã.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Me lio li éli Ngaliɔ̃ mfam a etswi e nsie ki Akayi ki ke nsɛn a okwɛn o Lom, Ayuda ayɛn Pool mfoo, bu abiri ndɛ ke mbal. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Bɔ afɛn ndɛ bubu: «Ngaburu wu abetam baal k'alweel Nziã m'emfa kyɛn ãngel k'ãtam wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Ŋ'eyii ebii Pool k'ayɛɛn, Ngaliɔ̃ olieel Ayuda bubu: «Okɛɛn al'eli etsob wuo ndɔɔ yi enɛn, mɛ̃ ekeewal lio li ekeeyoo byɛ, byɛ b'Ayuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Kɛn onge bɛn eli ɛ̃tsuun me ndɔɔ ãyɛɛn, y'ãnkuũ, ye ngel a byam, ndɔɔ oyɔ etal byam. Mɛ̃ ke nzii k'ekal ntwel a ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ wɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Ndɛ bu atswɛɛl bɔ ke mbal. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Obobɔ, bɔ bueel ayiool me Sositɛn wu mfam a nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn, bu abvi obɛɛl ke nkwel a baal a mbal. Kɛn a Ngaliɔ̃ k'asiɔɔl ndɔɔ wɛ.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool obvool Antioswe mã Sili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Pool okal kɛn ke Kolinte lio li ela, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ndɛ olɛɛl andoo a dzii, bu awel ãsua m'oyi o Sili, ndɛ bwɛn a Pilisile y'Akilas. Ndɛ ál'akie mfu ke Sankele, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ ál'alab ɔ̃kyel ke nkwel a Nziã. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ k'Efedze, ndɛ osiil Pilisile y'Akilas, oyɛn nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn, bu ayii atsuun y'Ayuda okɔ. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Bɔ aluɔɔn ndɛ k'akal oŋɔ̃ ãtsoo bibi, kɛn a ndɛ k'adzii wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Ndɛ olɛɛl bɔ y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã bubu: «Okɛɛn Nziã odzii, mɛ̃ ekieel eyebvool ola byɛ.» Ndɛ ombal Efedze m'ãsua, <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />obwel ke Sedzale, bu ayɛn Yelusalem m'oyebio b'Ebvɔɔn, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ndɛ oyɛn Antioswe mã Sili. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Ndɛ okal muaan-lio onse bviil olɔ, bu abvool. Ndɛ obwel ke Ngalati ye Filidzi m'owɛɛl b'ayio bueel.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolos k'Efedze bvool ke Kolinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Ɔ̃yuda ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Apolos wu Ɔ̃fi-alekesandele, áyi Efedze. Ndɛ áli ɔ̃yɛɛn wu ɔ̃nɛn, wu áli y'oyɛɛ b'Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ngesɛ. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Áyiool ndɛ k'anɔɔn nkuul a Mfam. Y'ãŋã mbueel, ndɛ ákeyɛɛn bvool ákeyiool ãndɔɔ m'ãtal Yeso ye nzyal yueel, oŋɔ̃ ŋɛn opongo b'éyɛɛ ndɛ kɛn a bo Dzaã. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Ndɛ obvi oyɛɛn y'onzɔɔ̃ onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn. Ŋ'eyoo Pilisile y'Akilas ndɛ, bɔ awel ndɛ, bu abiri ndɛ ola bɔ, me ndɔɔ yi asuo ndɛ nkuul a Nziã ngesɛ-ngesɛ. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, onge bɛn ndɛ ákedzii k'ayi Akayi, andoo a dzii awi ndɛ mpɛn yi ayi okɔ, bɔ akel ayio b'etswi e nsie okyɛ ɔ̃nkaan kwɛn bɔ ayɔɔ ndɛ ngesɛ. Ŋ'etɔ ndɛ okɔ, ndɛ osi obvɛ bibi me baal b'ayii akiool me nyiĩ a Nziã yi nɛn. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ke nkwel a baal bueel, y'onzɔɔ̃ bueel, ndɛ ákebee m'ékeyɛɛn Ayuda. Ndɛ ákesuo bɔ onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri Yeso oli Mãsia.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Pool k'Efedze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Me lio li éli Apolos ke Kolinte, Pool otsiil ãnkio mã Ngalati ye Filidzi, bu atɔ Efedze. Ndɛ oyebɔɔ ayio ke kwɛ oŋɔ̃, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />bvool ofuul bɔ bubu: «Ŋ'eyii byɛ akiool, byɛ éyɔɔ Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal?» Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, bee lɔɔ-okal kɛn eyoo k'ayɛɛn ndiri eli y'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal ngɔmɔ̃ bubu wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Pool bu afuul bɔ ndiri: «K'opongo b'éwel byɛ, ale bɛn?» Bɔ abveel bubu: «Opongo o Dzaã.» <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Pool olieel bɔ bubu: «Dzaã ákepongo baal b'ákekiool k'akaal ɛ̃kwal, bvool ndɛ ákeyɛɛn yam li Isalayel k'alɔ okiool me mbuul wu ákeya ke mbee a ndɛ, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri me Yeso.» <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Ŋ'eyoo bɔ ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, bɔ awel opongo me nkuũ a Mfam Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Pool ondɔɔl bɔ mviɔɔl, Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal bu asool nkal a bɔ. Obobɔ, bɔ abvi enywã ɛ̃kyam oyɛɛn, bvool abvi ãndɔɔ m'ãfi ola Nziã oyɛɛn. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Baal obɔ bueel áli onse abekuun ye buaal.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Pool ákeyi nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn, bvool ákewal oyɛɛn y'ãŋã. Onse nswii tyel, ndɛ ákeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ Okwɛn o Nziã, bvool ákesa mpɛn yi aswɛɛl ãtsam ã b'ákeyoo ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Kɛn onge bɛn bakyɛ ákesa ɔ̃tswɛ mpɛn, ákebee k'akiool bvool ákesyob nkuul a Mfam ke nkwel a bvɔɔn, Pool osiil bɔ, obiri ayio me pyɛ. Ndɛ ákeyiool bɔ tsoo bwɛn a tsoo onse lekɔɔl e mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Tilanos. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Esi mvel yuaal, m'emfa okyɛ baal b'ákekal k'etswi e nsie ki Adzi, b'áli Ayuda ye bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, ayoo Endɔɔ e Mfam.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baan a Sebva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Nziã ákesa emvieel bvi emwã me nkuul a Pool. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />M'emfa okyɛ, ákewal ekɔ wuo ɛ̃suaal mi énywɛn a nzuru a Pool, ákendɔɔl myɛ̃ nkal anga-ãluu, bɔ ákebvuul, bvool ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi ɛ̃kepal onse bɔ.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Éli y'Ayuda ke kwɛ b'ákeyi m'ãmboo m'ãmboo m'otswɛɛl b'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi. Bɔ akie k'atswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi onse baal, me nkuũ a Mfam Yeso. Bɔ ákeyɛɛn ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi bubu: «Me nkuũ a Yeso wu ebetee Pool, bee etam byɛ wɛn epal!» <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />B'ákesa ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, éli baan nsiaan ba mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Sebva, wu ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn wu Ɔ̃yuda. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Kɛn a tsoo ngelemɔ̃, ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi obveel bɔ bubu: «Yeso, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ndɛ ngesɛ, Pool hɛ̃, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ndɛ. Ke byɛ, byɛ anã eli?» <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Mbuul wu áli y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi oyiool nkal a bɔ, bu abvel bɔ bueel mpɛn. Ndɛ otueel bɔ mpal m'emfa kyɛn bɔ apwɛɛn ke nzɔ oyɔ odzuũ y'ãbwɔɔ mbueel.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Baal bueel b'ákekal k'Efedze, Ayuda ye bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, ayoo ndɔɔ oyɔ. Bɔ bam bueel buɔ obɔɔ, bvool ayii awal nkuũ a Mfam Yeso ye bvɛɛ bibi. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Bibi onse b'ál'ayii akiool ákeya bvool ákekiool ãbi ã bɔ ke nkwel a baal. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Baal bibi onse b'ákesa ãngaa, ákeya y'ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ bɔ mi ongaa bvool áketsoo myɛ̃ mbaa ke mviil ã baal bueel. Ŋ'asiɔɔl ɔ̃bvɛn wu abetiɔ ɛ̃nkaan omyɛ̃, amwɛn ndiri ol'esi nzi yi ãbvieel amiil ãku-ãtaan (50.000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bvieel e nzi ngelemɔ̃ éli furu li ɔ̃sal wa tsoo ɔ̃tsiin.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />M'emfa okyɛ, me waan e Mfam, baal bam bibi ákeyoo Endɔɔ e Nziã bvool ákekiool lɔ.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsungaa k'Efedze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Pool okuru k'ayi Maseduaan ye Ngelek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngelek nkuũ a nsie yi Akayi yinkyɛ.</char></note>, ye k'eyi ndɛ Yelusalem. Ndɛ oyɛɛn bubu: «Mɛ̃ èmbal okɔ, ebvaan kwɛn mɛ̃ eyi Lom hɛ̃.» <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Ndɛ oyuɔɔl awuaal a ndɛ buaal, Timote y'Elasite, ke Maseduaan, kɛn a ndyam osiil ãlio ke kwɛ ke nsie yi Adzi.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Me lio olɔ, tsungaa wu ɔ̃nɛn obvi k'Efedze me ndɔɔ a nkuul a Mfam. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Demetilihos, wu ákebuo eluɔ bvi ãbvieel, ákebuo etiɔ bvi nzɔ a nziã ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal, wɛn nkuũ Aatemis, me bvieel li aadzã. M'ɔ̃sal ondɛ, bɔ ákebɔɔ nzi bibi, ndɛ y'asal a ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, ndɛ obvool asal obɔ ye baal b'ákesa ɔ̃sal wɛn onge ondɛ. Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Andoo a mɛ̃, byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn opfel o bia-byɛ obeya m'ɔ̃sal wu. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Kɛn a byɛ ebemwɛn bvool ebeyoo m'ãbebwel: ɔ̃bvu-ayi Pool wu, amaasa mpɛn yi aswɛɛl ãtsam ã baal bibi, ke kɛn a k'Efedze ŋã wɛ, ekoo m'oyɛɛn wɛn onse nsie yi Adzi yueel. Ndɛ atɔ m'oyɛɛn ndiri anziã b'asi me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal k'ali anziã wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãkoo k'ãsa kwɛn ɔ̃sal a bia-byɛ akal ngwel, bvool kwɛn nzɔ a nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn wu ɔ̃kaal wu Aatemis dzuun efa. Obobɔ, bvɛɛ e ndɛ ol'efi, ndɛ wu nziã wu ɔ̃kaal wu ebelweel baal bueel me nsie yi Adzi bvool onse ɔ̃kiri a nsie wueel!»<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Ŋ'eyoo bɔ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ mpuru eyi, bu abvi obiool ndiri: «Aatemis wu Efedze, nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn ali!» <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Ekiin ebvi onse bviil lueel, baal bueel ayɛn tswa-a-tswa ke mboo yi abesa ɛ̃taan. Ŋ'ékebwel bɔ, bɔ asiin Gahios y'Alisitaak, Afi-Maseduaan b'áyɛn dzwɛ ye Pool. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Pool ákedzii k'apal ke nkwel embuul, kɛn ayio akii ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Asal a nga-furu ba bvɛɛ ke kwɛ ba nsie yi Adzi b'áli andoo a ndɛ hɛ̃ ayuɔɔl ndɛ ɔ̃kiɛɛn me ndɔɔ yi alɛɛn ndɛ ndiri abee ke mboo yi abesa ɛ̃taan oyi.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Me lio olɔ, ɛ̃tswab ɛ̃́li onse embuul: Bɛn abiool nkyam, bɛn hɛ̃ abiool nkyam, bvool bibi onse bɔ k'áyɛɛ otsɛn b'ébvɔɔn bɔ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Onse embuul, baal ke kwɛ alieel mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Alekesandele otsɛn o m'ãbwel. Mbuul ondɛ wɛn Ayuda áketsɛɛn ke nkwel. Obobɔ, ndɛ ondɛɛl kuɔɔl, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ ákedzii k'ayɛɛn y'embuul. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Kɛn a ŋ'eyeyɛɛ bɔ kwɛn ndɛ áli Ɔ̃yuda, bɔ bueel abvi obiool tiil nku-a-nku ãlio mbuaal bubu: «Aatemis wu Efedze nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn ali!»<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Kɛn ɔ̃swɛn-ɛ̃nkaan wa bviil osi kwɛn embuul ebvi ɔ̃lii, ndɛ oyɛɛn bubu: «Afi-Efedze, baal bueel ayɛɛ kwɛn bviil li Efedze eli ɔ̃nkiaal a nzɔ a nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn wu ɔ̃kaal wu Aatemis ye wu etiɔ e ndɛ, ki etswel fa ywel. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Mbuul wu abee yɔ k'ali wɛ, oŋɔ̃ ebvaan kwɛn byɛ ewuun pi, bvool ebee ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ osa me nkaã. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Ke ngwel wɛ, baal b'ebiri byɛ ŋã ba k'asi ndɔɔ yi mbi me nzɔ a nziã wɛ, bɔ hɛ̃ k'asiaan nziã a bia-byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Okɛɛn Demetilihos y'andoo a ndɛ b'ɔ̃sal ali y'esal bwɛn a mbuul, ãmbal ãli y'antwel, okɔ mboo yi abva mbal! <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Bvool okɛɛn byɛ eli ye ndɔɔ nkyam yi esuo, atal yɔ ke bvɔɔn li ebetsiil ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki etam ãngel. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn afɛn bia-byɛ ndiri bia-byɛ elɔ tsungaa me m'ãbwel nonɔ̃, ɔ̃dzoo wu ewa me ndɔɔ obvɔɔn ba k'ali wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyɛɛn ɔ̃swɛn-ɛ̃nkaan obobɔ, ndɛ otsal obvɔɔn.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Pool obvool Maseduaan ye Ngelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ŋ'efi tsungaa, Pool obvool ayio. Ke mbee a ŋ'ewi ndɛ bɔ mpɛn, ndɛ olɛɛl bɔ, bu ayɛn Maseduaan. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Ndɛ otsiil etswi e nsie okyɛ, owi ayio mpɛn m'ãtee bibi, bu ayɛn Ngelek. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Okɔ, ndɛ osi nswii tyel. Ŋ'eyii ebii k'ewal ndɛ ãsua m'oyi o Sili, ndɛ oyeyɛɛ ndiri Ayuda akuru ndɛ mfoo yi mbi. Ndɛ bu awɛɛ k'abvool me li Maseduaan. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />B'ákedzuu ye ndɛ áli bɔ ba: Sopatɛɛl wu muaan a Pilos wu ɔ̃fi-bviil li Bele, y'Alisitaak bwɛn a Sekundus, Afi-Tesalonike, ye Gahios wu Ɔ̃fi-Dɛɛbe, ye Timote, bvool ye Titswike bwɛn a Telofime, Afi-Adzi. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Bɔ obɔ atsɔɔn nkwel, ayekiaal bee ke Telohas. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Me b'otal bee, ke mbee a pfuun li adza amampa bɛn k'ali ye lebviil wɛ, bee ewel ãsua ke Filipese, bu eyemwɛɛn ye bɔ ke Telohas ke mbee ãtsoo ãtaan. Bee esi ãtsoo nsiaan oŋɔ̃.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool oseel Ehutike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Tsoo li ɛ̃kwel li eyenge, bee ebvɔɔn me ndɔɔ yi edza ɔ̃laan a Mfam. Onge bɛn Pool ela esiool ákeyi, ndɛ ondɛɛl oyɛɛn tiil nkal a kuku. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Ándɛɛl ambunda bibi k'etswi e nzɔ ki ywel, ku ébvɔɔn bee. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Nsam a bɔɔl ngamɔ̃ yɛn nkuũ Ehutike, ábvi nsɛn ke fenetel. Onge bɛn oyɛɛn o Pool óli b'ola, ndɛ áyiool me twal. Onse enzuũ e twal, ndɛ opiool fa ɔ̃kiri a nzɔ wu ɛ̃tyel, bu ayiool me nsie. Ŋ'ayii abii k'atɛɛl ndɛ, amwɛn ndɛ ɔ̃kwa-akwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Pool osool, opfɔɔn nkal a ndɛ, owel ndɛ onse mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndɛ, bu alieel ndiri: «Ebee ɛ̃kwal ke ywel okal, ndɛ oli mwiĩ!» <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Ŋ'ekɔɔl Pool ywel, ndɛ otsiil mampa, bvool odzi. Ndɛ bvool ondɛɛl oyɛɛn tiil ŋ'epal tal, bu ayɛn. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Ayebveel nsam a bɔɔl mwiĩ, baal bueel bu abɔɔ mpɛn yam bibi.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ombal Telohas, oyɛn Milet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Me b'otal bee, bee ewel ãsua ɛ̃kwel, bu eyɛn Asos, oyɔ mboo yi èkiaal bee Pool, me ndɔɔ yi ewal ndɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ ádzii obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ ákuru k'ayi okɔ me nkuul yi nsie. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Ŋ'eyebɔɔ ndɛ bee k'Asos, bee ewel ndɛ m'ãsua, bu eyɛn bviil li Mitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Bee embal oŋɔ̃, enɔɔn k'eyi m'ãsua, ela esiool, bee eyetɔ nsɔ̃-a-nsɔ̃ a esanga ki Kio. Ela esiool, bee etɔ esanga ki Samos, tsoo li enɔɔn bee eyetɔ bviil li Milet. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Pool ákuru kwɛn ndɛ k'atɛɛn k'Efedze wɛ, kwɛn ndɛ abee oyiil k'Adzi. Ndɛ ákesa tswa-a-tswa, owɛɛl ndɛ otɔ Yelusalem me tsoo li Pantekot.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool obvi oyɛɛn y'akuul-kuul b'Efedze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Ke Milet, Pool otam akuul-kuul b'Ebvɔɔn mbel ota k'Efedze. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ ola ndɛ, ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ bam eyɛɛ ngesɛ emfa ki nkal mɛ̃ ye byɛ lio lueel, bɛɛn tsoo li ɛ̃kwel li étɔ mɛ̃ Adzi. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Mɛ̃ nsal me ndɔɔ a Mfam y'okuaal o nzuru bueel, onse elel y'ãmpal me mwɛn mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ ãmfoo m'Ayuda. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn ndɔɔ yueel yi nkiin me ndɔɔ a byɛ, mɛ̃ ke nduɔɔn byɛ yɔ wɛ. Mɛ̃ ntee byɛ yɔ, bvool ngyiool byɛ yɔ ke nkwel a baal bueel bvool onse ãnzɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn Ayuda ye bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ k'akaal ɛ̃kwal bvool akal y'okiool me Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Meba ŋã, Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal atam bam kwɛn mɛ̃ ngyi Yelusalem. Mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ m'ã̀ya me mɛ̃ okɔ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Yi ngyɛɛ mɛ̃ yɛn ke bviil bwɛn a bviil Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal ayɛɛn mɛ̃ ndiri, mɛ̃ èmwɛn ãmpal bvool èsam bwal. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Ke yam, mɛ̃ k'ewal omwiĩ o myam y'ɔ̃bvɛn wɛ. Ndɔɔ yi y'ɔ̃bvɛn me mɛ̃, yi ebiri mɛ̃ ontam o mɛ̃ tiil ntɔ, bvool embɛɛl ɔ̃sal wu ewi Mfam Yeso mɛ̃. Ɔ̃sal ondɛ, wu etee mɛ̃ Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi nyiĩ a Nziã yi nɛn.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Mɛ̃ mbwel onse byɛ m'otee b'Okwɛn o Nziã. Kɛn a meba ŋã, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ bam ngesɛ wɛn byɛ bvool k'èbemwɛn mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn nonɔ̃ ŋã, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ŋɛn byɛ k'eluɛɛn me ngyiool mɛ̃ wɛ, etsob okyɛ k'ebetal mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ntee byɛ mbueel m'éwɛɛ Nziã, yi ndwɔɔn mɛ̃ pyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Obobɔ, ekal y'onkyab me byam, y'ekel li emɛmɛɛ̃ li esuul Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal byɛ ambiri. Ebiri bvool eliil Ebvɔɔn e Nziã, Ebvɔɔn li ébvuul ndɛ m'ãkel ã ndyam. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Mɛ̃ bam ngyɛɛ wɛn ke mbee oyi o mɛ̃, baal bɛn onge anyam a mpuru akieel asam onse byɛ, bvool k'àyoo ekel li emɛmɛɛ̃ ãwua wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Onse byam hɛ̃, baal bakyɛ akieel ayɛɛn ãndɔɔ mã mfya, kwɛn ayio anɔɔn a bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />M'emfa okyɛ, ekal angɔ-mwiĩ! Ebee odzɛɛn wɛn, mvel tyel, tsia mwiĩ, mɛ̃ ke ngyɔɔl k'ewa ngɔmɔ̃-ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ ãnkunkwa wɛ, y'elel kieel.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Meba ŋã, mɛ̃ ngwi byɛ me Nziã y'Endɔɔ e nyiĩ a ndɛ. Ndɛ oli y'omfam b'asa kwɛn byɛ ekwel onse okiool, ye b'awa byɛ ɔ̃swal b'ékwee ndɛ ba ngel bueel. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Mɛ̃ ke ndɔ eluɔ e mbuul ɔ̃kwal wɛ: Ekal nzi, ekal ɔɔl, ekal ekɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Byɛ bam eyɛɛ ngesɛ wɛn, mɛ̃ nsal me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ myam, me ndɔɔ yi esoo ãkɔɔ ã mɛ̃ ye mã b'abedzuu ye mɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />M'ãndɔɔ mbueel, mɛ̃ nsuo byɛ wɛn ebvaan asal m'emfa okyɛ m'owuaal b'aywal. Eyeel m'éyɛɛn Mfam Yeso ndyam ndiri: “Esɛ ki owa enduru ki obɔɔ.”»<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Ŋ'eman Pool obobɔ oyɛɛn, ndɛ obvi ãbuo me ndɔɔ yi abuɛɛn ye bɔ bueel. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Baal bueel ákebool elel bvool ákelyal ndɛ ke nkii, me ndɔɔ yi abuun ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Ãwua ã bɔ bvel-bvel ã́li me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ álieel bɔ ndiri bɔ kieel k'abemwɛn ndɛ bvool wɛ. Bɔ bu ayesuul ndɛ tiil k'ãsua.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Pool oyɛn Yelusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Ŋ'esiil bee akuul-kuul b'Efedze obɔ, bee esam m'ãsua, bu eyɛn dzuu-tɛ k'esanga ki Kos. Ela esiool, bee etɔ esanga ki Lodes. Oŋɔ̃, bee eyɛn Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Okɔ, bee emwɛn ãsua m'ã́keyi Fenisi. Bee bu esam eyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Ŋ'eyii bee tsotsoo y'esanga ki Swipele, bee esiil kyɛ me kuɔɔl ki ekal, eluɛɛn nkuul a bee mpyal a Sili, eyesiɛɛn ke Tiil, oyɔ mboo yi ákepaal eluɔ onse ãsua. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Bee emwɛn ayio oŋɔ̃, bee bu esi ãtsoo nsiaan ye bɔ. Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal osuo bɔ ãndɔɔ m'ã̀ya me Pool ke Yelusalem. Bɔ bu alieel ndɛ ndiri abee okɔ oyi. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Kɛn a ŋ'ekoo ãtsoo nsiaan, bee eyɛn. Bɔ bueel, y'akaal ye baan b'atsi-atsi, ayesuul bee. Bee epal onse bviil, bvool ebvi ãbuo nku-a-nku a nzal, me ndɔɔ yi ebuɛɛn. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Ŋ'elɛɛl bee bakyɛ, bee esam onse ãsua, bɔ bu abvool. <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Bee esɛɛl odzuu o bee m'ãsua ŋ'embal bee Tiil eyɛn Petolemayis. Oŋɔ̃, bee ebio andoo, bu esi tsoo ngelemɔ̃ ye bɔ.<verse eid="ACT 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Ŋ'etsi bviil, bee eyɛn, bu etɔ Sedzale. Okɔ, bee esam onse nzɔ a Filipe wu ɔ̃liaal-Nsia, bu ebuo lɔɔ ola ndɛ. Ndɛ áli ngɔmɔ̃ onse baal ange-nsiaan b'ásueel me ndɔɔ yi awuaal antam. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Ndɛ áli ye baan b'akaal anã bɛn ale kɛn ayɛɛ abɔɔl wɛ. Bɔ áli aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Onge bɛn, bee ébɔɔ ãtsoo bibi oŋɔ̃, ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Agabus ofi nsie yi Yude oyi oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Ndɛ oyi ola bee. Ndɛ owel ɔ̃sii a Pool wu abelaal me luu, okuru mviil ye mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndyam, bu ayɛɛn bubu: «Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal olieel ndiri: “Nga-ɔ̃sii wu, Ayuda akieel akuru ndɛ m'emfa ki ke Yelusalem, me ndɔɔ yi atiɔ ndɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ.”» <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Ŋ'eyoo bee obobɔ, bee y'akiool ba Sedzale elɛɛn Pool kwɛn ndɛ abee Yelusalem oyi. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Kɛn a ndɛ obveel ndiri: «Ki elel byɛ bvool esa kwɛn mɛ̃ nzuru esool emã? Mɛ̃ ndyam emeewal ɔ̃yɛɛl wɛn me nkuũ a Mfam Yeso, akuru mɛ̃ ɛ̃si bvool abam mɛ̃ ke Yelusalem.» <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Onge bɛn bee ale k'ekoo k'eswɛɛl ãtsam ã ndɛ wɛ, bee k'ebelɛɛn ndɛ wɛ, bu eyɛɛn wɛn: «Yɔɔl kwɛn Mfam asa b'edzii ndyam!»<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Ke mbee ãtsoo omɔ̃, bee ewel ɔ̃yɛɛl, bu eyɛn Yelusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Ayio ke kwɛ ba Sedzale ayesuul bee. Bɔ abiri bee ke nzɔ a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wa Swipele wɛn nkuũ Menasɔ̃, wu ébuo bee lɔɔ ola ndɛ. Ndɛ ál'amayiil onse okiool.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool omwɛn ye Dzak ke Yelusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Ŋ'etɔ bee Yelusalem, andoo ayɔɔ bee y'esɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Ela esiool, Pool oyɛn ye bee ola Dzak. Akuul-kuul b'Ebvɔɔn bueel ábvɔɔn okɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Pool obio bɔ, bu abvi bɔ ɔ̃sal ngɔmɔ̃-ngɔmɔ̃ osuo wu esi Nziã ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, me nkuul a ndɛ.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Ŋ'eyoo akuul-kuul ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ alweel Nziã, bu alieel Pool ndiri: «Ndoo, yɛ amwɛn, Ayuda amiil bibi ayii akiool. Bɔ bueel ali y'ebal me ndɔɔ ãngel ã Moyize. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Kɛn a bɔ ayoo ɔ̃nyiin ndiri yɛ abetee Ayuda b'ali ke nsie y'onzii ndiri atiɔ ãngel ã Moyize eboo, abee baan a bɔ b'abɔɔl otsiil, bvool abee onkɔɔ b'Ayuda obenɔɔn. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Oŋɔ̃ eyii bwɛn esa? Enkyam pyɛ, bɔ al'ayoo ndiri yɛ amaaya. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Obobɔ, sa b'eyɛɛn bee yɛ. Onse bee eli ye baal anã b'alab ɔ̃kyel ke nkwel a Nziã. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Wal bɔ bvool sa ɔ̃kiri wu akal tsɛtsɛ ye bɔ, bvool furu nzi yi etsal bɔ me ndɔɔ ãkab, kwɛn bɔ akie ɛ̃tswɛ. Obobɔ, baal bueel ayɛɛ kwɛn ãndɔɔ m'eyoo bɔ me ndɔɔ a yɛ k'ãli mã taa-taa wɛ, bvool kwɛn yɛ hɛ̃ abenɔɔn a ãngel. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Me b'otal baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ b'ayii akiool, bee emeekel bɔ wɛn abee anyam b'awi anziã b'etiɔ ãkab odza, abee hɛ̃ anyam b'akwa etsɔɔn odza, abee ãkel hɛ̃ odza. Bɔ abee ntal obvool ye mbuul wɛn bɔ kɛn abaal bakyɛ wɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Ela esiool, Pool owel baal obɔ, osi ɔ̃kiri wu akal tsɛtsɛ ye bɔ, bvool osam onse Nzɔ a Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi ayeyɛɛn tsoo li efa ɔ̃kil ondɛ ye lio li awa kab me ndɔɔ a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃-ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asiin Pool onse Nzɔ a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ŋ'eyii efa ãtsoo ãnge-nsiaan m'ɔ̃kiri, Ayuda bakyɛ ba nsie y'Adzi b'ámwɛn Pool onse Nzɔ a Nziã, alɔ tsungaa onse baal bueel, bvool asiin ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Bɔ abvi obiool bubu: «Baal b'Isalayel, ewuaal a bee! Etal mbuul wɛn ãmboo mbueel, abewa baal bueel ãtee m'ãbi-ãbi, me ndɔɔ a yam e bia-byɛ, y'ãngel ã Moyize, ye Nzɔ a Nziã. Meba ŋã, ndɛ olɔ onkyam baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ onse Nzɔ a Nziã, m'emfa okyɛ, ndɛ ŋ'abiil mboo yi ngel.» <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ tsɔɔn ámwɛn Telofime wu Ɔ̃fi-Efedze onse bviil ye ndɛ, bwɛn bɔ b'áketsam ndiri ndɛ áswɛɛl ndɛ onse Nzɔ a Nziã.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Ekiin ebvi onse bviil lueel, baal ayii aya m'ãntiin m'etswi bvieel. Bɔ asiin Pool bvool apaal ndɛ onse Nzɔ a Nziã, akuru ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃ yɔ myam mvieel alili oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Ŋ'eyii ebii bɔ k'abam ndɛ, nsia etɔ ola kapiri a ambwel-mbwel a Lom ndiri tsungaa obvi me Yelusalem wueel. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Tswa-a-tswa oŋɔ̃, ndɛ owel ambwel-mbwel y'ambiri a bɔ, bu ayɛn me ntiin ke mboo yi éluul baal. Ŋ'emwɛn baal kapiri y'ambwel-mbwel, bɔ k'abebɛɛl Pool wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Obobɔ, kapiri osyel tsotsoo, osiin Pool, bvool otam ndɛ okuru m'ãmpaa mbuaal. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ ofuul ndiri: «Mbuul wu nã? Ndɛ emã asi?» <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Onse embuul, bɛn abiool emfa ekyam, bɛn hɛ̃ abiool emfa ekyam. Onge bɛn kapiri a ambwel-mbwel k'ákoo k'ayɛɛ otsɛn o tsungaa ngesɛ-ngesɛ wɛ, ndɛ otam k'abiri Pool onse ekɔɔ ki ambwel-mbwel. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Ŋ'etɔ ndɛ ke mboo yi awuaal me ndɔɔ yi asam nzɔ, ambwel-mbwel andɛɛl ndɛ me ndɔɔ a kɔɔ-kɔɔ a baal, <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />ke ngwel wɛ baal bueel ákenɔɔn a ndɛ, abiool ndiri: «Bam ndɛ!»<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool oyɛɛn y'Ayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Me lio li ayii abii k'aswɛɛl Pool onse ekɔɔ ki ambwel-mbwel, ndɛ olieel kapiri ndiri: «Yɛ koo k'awa mɛ̃ nkuul yi eyɛɛn yɛ ndɔɔ?» Kapiri obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Onkyel yɛ yɛɛ k'ayɛɛn ɔ̃nywã wa Ngelek! <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Yɛ ŋɛn ke li ɔ̃fi-Edzipito wɛn lyal álɔ tsungaa onse baal, bvool ábiri baal amiil anã b'áli y'ãta me mviɔɔl k'ɔ̃baan wɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Ndɛ obveel ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃ mfam, mɛ̃ ndi Ɔ̃yuda, ɔ̃fi-bviil li ye nsia li Taase, li nsie yi Silisi. Mɛ̃ mbuɛɛn yɛ, wa mɛ̃ nkuul yi eyɛɛn ye baal.» <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Kapiri owi ndɛ nkuul yi ayɛɛn. Ndɛ otɛɛn ke mboo yi awuaal me ndɔɔ yi asam nzɔ, oyɛɛn ye bɔ m'ɔ̃liɛɛn kwɛn bɔ akal pi. Ɔ̃lii wa bibi bu abvi. Obobɔ, ndɛ oyɛɛn ye bɔ m'ɔ̃nywã wu Ebele bubu:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />«Baan-ngoo a mɛ̃ y'abetaal, meba ŋã, emeeyoo be nzii mɛ̃ byɛ oyɛɛn me ndɔɔ yi esuun nzuru a mɛ̃.» <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Ŋ'eyoo bɔ kwɛn Pool ayɛɛn ye bɔ m'ɔ̃nywã wu Ebele, bɔ bvool abvi ɔ̃lii wu onduru. Ndɛ bu ayɛɛn bubu: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />«Mɛ̃ ndi Ɔ̃yuda wa bviil li Taase li nsie yi Silisi. Kɛn a mɛ̃ ékwel ke Yelusalem ŋã, bvool Gamalyel mbuul wu áyiool mɛ̃ ãndɔɔ mbueel m'onkɔɔ o bia-byɛ. Mɛ̃ éli y'ebal me Nziã, onge byɛ bueel hɛ̃ nonɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Mɛ̃ étueel baal b'anɔɔn a nkuul a Yeso mpal tiil epfu, esiin akaal y'abɔɔl etyal me bwal. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Ngaa-a-nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn ye nkel yi akuul-kuul akoo k'atsweel wɛn mɛ̃ otaa-taa ebeyɛɛn. Bɔ bam baal b'áwi mɛ̃ ɛ̃nkaan kwɛn mɛ̃ ngyi yensuul myɛ̃ ola baan-ngoo ba Damas. Mɛ̃ éyɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn akiool b'eyebɔɔ mɛ̃ okɔ, mɛ̃ nsiin bɔ bvool mbiri bɔ ke Yelusalem kwɛn awa bɔ etumbu.»<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ayɛɛn emfa ki ekaal ndɛ ɔ̃kwal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />«Mɛ̃ éli me nkuul, bvool alengyii tsotsoo a Damas, enseel oŋɔ̃, ŋ'eyii sua tal dzu, mbaa yi nɛn yi efi ywel enyɛɛn edzii mɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Mɛ̃ bvi me nsie, bvool ngyoo nkii ngamɔ̃ eyɛɛn mɛ̃ bubu: “Sol, Sol, ki ebetuaal yɛ mɛ̃ mpal emã?” <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Mɛ̃ mfuul ndiri: “Yɛ nã li, Mfam?” Nkii oyɔ ebveel mɛ̃ ndiri: “Mɛ̃ ndyam ndi Yeso wa Nadzalet wɛn yɛ ndyam abetuaal mpal.” <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Baal b'ákeyi ye mɛ̃ amwɛn mbaa yam ngesɛ. Kɛn a bɔ k'akwaal otsɛn o nkii a mbuul wu ákeyɛɛn ye mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Mɛ̃ bu mfuul ndiri: “Mfam, mɛ̃ ngyii bwɛn esa?” Mfam obveel mɛ̃ ndiri: “Tɛɛn, yi Damas, okɔ, àyɛɛn yɛ mam mbueel m'ètam Nziã yɛ osa!” <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Kɛn onge bɛn onyɛɛn o mbaa oyɔ óbwel mɛ̃ mviil, b'áli ye mɛ̃ asiin mɛ̃ me kuɔɔl, bu abiri mɛ̃ Damas.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Ananias áli oŋɔ̃. Ndɛ ákuru nzuru me Nziã, y'ãngel ã Moyize. Ayuda bueel b'ákekal ke Damas áketuɛɛn ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Ndɛ oyi ola mɛ̃ bvool olieel mɛ̃ ndiri: “Sol, ndoo a mɛ̃, mwɛn bvool!” Kɛn a me lio alili, mviil ã mɛ̃ ãdzweel nzuru, mɛ̃ bu mwɛn ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Ndɛ olieel mɛ̃ bubu: “Nziã a nkiɔɔn a bia-byɛ tsɔɔn ásueel yɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn, yɛ yɛɛ b'edzii ndɛ, bvool mwɛn Yeso wa dzu, bvool kwɛn yɛ yoo nkii a ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ kieel wu ayeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ndɛ ke nkwel a baal bueel, m'ãndɔɔ m'emwɛn yɛ ye m'eyoo yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Meba ŋã, ki ekiaal yɛ bvool emã? Tɛɛn, y'awal opongo, kwɛn Nziã adzeel ãbi ã yɛ, ŋ'eta yɛ nkuũ a ndɛ mbel.”»<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ayɛɛn emfa ki átam ndɛ ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />«Ŋ'ebvool mɛ̃ Yelusalem, me lio li ékebuɛɛn mɛ̃ onse Nzɔ a Nziã, mɛ̃ Ɔ̃fel osiin. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Mɛ̃ mwɛn Mfam. Ndɛ olieel mɛ̃ bubu: “Mbal Yelusalem bam tswa-a-tswa, ke ngwel wɛ baal a bviil li k'àkiool b'eyɛɛn yɛ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ wɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Mɛ̃ mveel bubu: “Ke Mfam, bɔ ayɛɛ ngesɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ ékeyi onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn me ndɔɔ yi etyal b'akiool yɛ onse bwal, bvool ebɛɛl bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Ŋ'ábam Etyɛn wu áketee Nsia a yɛ, mɛ̃ ndyam éli oŋɔ̃. Mɛ̃ étsweel ãndɔɔ ã baal b'ábam ndɛ, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ékwee ekɔ e bɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Mfam bu alieel mɛ̃ bubu: “Yi, mɛ̃ ndyam ètam yɛ lela, ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ.”»<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ye kapiri a ambwel-mbwel a Lom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Baal ayoo Pool. Kɛn a ndɛ ayeyɛɛn ndɔɔ oyɔ, bɔ abvi ɛ̃sɔɔl okuaal bvool ayɛɛn ndiri: «Akwa! K'ebvaan asuul ngaburu wu mwiĩ wɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Bɔ ákekuaal ɛ̃sɔɔl, ákenzɔɔ ekɔ e bɔ, bvool ákedzweel ɔ̃fel ke ywel. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Obobɔ, kapiri otam k'aswɛɛl Pool onse ekɔɔ ki ambwel-mbwel, bvool k'abɛɛl ndɛ, kwɛn ndɛ aliaal elyal ki ákeyiri ndɛ ɛ̃sɔɔl. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Ŋ'ayii akuru ndɛ ɛ̃sii, ndɛ olieel mbiri a ambwel-mbwel wu áli oŋɔ̃ ndiri: «Mbuul a Lom wɛn mbal kɛn etsiil ndɔɔ a ndɛ wɛ, awi yɛ nkuul yi abɛɛl ndɛ?»<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Ŋ'eyoo mbiri obobɔ, ndɛ oyeyɛɛn ye kapiri ndiri: «Mfam, yɛ bwɛn asa? Mbuul wu oli mbuul a Lom!» <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Kapiri bu ayefuul Pool ndiri: «Yɛɛn mɛ̃, taa-taa, yɛ mbuul a Lom li?» Pool obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃!» <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Kapiri olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ndyam éfuru nzi bibi m'okal o mɛ̃ mbuul a Lom.» Pool obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Kɛn a mɛ̃ ndi mbuul a Lom wu emburu-ngoo!» <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Alili oŋɔ̃, b'ákebii kwɛn Pool ayɛɛn m'ɔ̃dzii, asyel lela ye ndɛ. Kapiri buɔ obɔɔ ndɛ, ŋ'eyɛɛ ndɛ kwɛn mbuul wu etam ndɛ ɛ̃si okuru oli mbuul a Lom.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ke mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Kapiri ákedzii k'ayɛɛ ngesɛ-ngesɛ elyal ki éfɛn Ayuda Pool. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ela esiool, ndɛ otam kwɛn anyiɔɔn Pool ɛ̃sii, bvool otam kwɛn amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã ye mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda abvɔɔn. Ndɛ otam k'asool ye Pool, bu asuul ndɛ ke nkwel a bɔ.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Pool otal baal a mbal pii, bu ayɛɛn bubu: «Baan-ngoo a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ nkal y'epfuũ bvi ngesɛ ke nkwel a Nziã tiil nonɔ̃ ŋã.» <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn Ananias otam b'áli tsotsoo ye Pool ndiri abɛɛl ndɛ k'ɔ̃nywã. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Obobɔ, Pool olieel ndɛ bubu: «Wu àbɛɛl yɛ Nziã, yɛ wɛn onge ebɔɔ ki akel eyuɛ̃ li fuu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Me lio olɔ, ákekel eyuɛ̃ li fuu m'ebɔɔ m'oluɔɔn b'elyal.</char></note>. Ki ebvi yɛ nsɛn oŋɔ̃, me ndɔɔ yi atsiil ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ m'emfa ki etam ngel. Kɛn a yam fel ngel, ŋ'etam yɛ mɛ̃ obɛɛl!» <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />B'áli oŋɔ̃ ayɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ too ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn ɛ̃tswɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Ndɛ obveel bubu: «Baan-ngoo, mɛ̃ k'eyɛɛ wɛn ndɛ oli ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã bubu: “Oyɛɛ ke yɛɛn obi-obi me mfam a yam e yɛ wɛ.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:27">Opa 22.27</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Onge bɛn ndɛ áyɛɛ kwɛn baal bibi onse mbal áli Asaduseyɛ̃, bakyɛ Afalisaye, ndɛ obiool ke nkwel a bɔ bubu: «Baan-ngoo, mɛ̃ ndi Ɔ̃falisaye, wu eburu Afalisaye! Okɛɛn abiri mɛ̃ nonɔ̃ ke mbal, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ ebeta kaã wɛn baal b'ákwi-ákwi akieel asiool!» <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Ŋ'eyɛɛn ndɛ obobɔ, ɛ̃tsuun ɛ̃bvi mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ Afalisaye y'Asaduseyɛ̃. Mbal bu ekab nzuru ebaal bviaal. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Asaduseyɛ̃ abeyɛɛn ndiri b'ákwi-ákwi kieel k'asiool wɛ, ãnzwel k'ãli wɛ, ɔ̃fel hɛ̃ k'ali wɛ. Kɛn Afalisaye abekiool ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Nkyal yi kokɔ ebvi. Ayiool b'ãngel b'áli onse nkel a Afalisaye atɛɛn abvi obee bam kiningi ndiri: «Bee k'emwɛn obi si ngɔmɔ̃ b'esi mbuul wu wɛ. Owɛɛl ɔ̃fel ngɔmɔ̃ wuo ãnzwel ngãmɔ̃ ãyɛɛn ye ndɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Onge bɛn, nkyal ékewɛɛn kɛn owɛɛn, kapiri obal owɛɛl bɔ ayetsɔɔ Pool m'etswel etswel. Ndɛ bu atam ambwel-mbwel k'asool, me ndɔɔ yi ambaal Pool onse bɔ, bvool abveel ndɛ onse ekɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Me tsia wu onɔɔn, Mfam opal ola Pool, bu ayɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: «Kal ye mpɛn. Emfa ngemɔ̃ ki eyɛɛn yɛ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ ke Yelusalem, emfa kiki hɛ̃ ebvaan yɛ àyeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ ke Lom.»<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akuru Pool mfoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Ŋ'etsi bviil, Ayuda bakyɛ akuru mfoo. Bɔ alab ɔ̃kyel wɛn bɔ k'akoo k'adza wɛ, k'akoo k'anywã hɛ̃ wɛ, tiil ye k'ebam bɔ Pool. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Baal b'ákuru mfoo oyɔ áli ãku-ãnã (40) y'esiɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Bɔ ayebɔɔ amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'akuul-kuul, alieel bɔ ndiri: «Bee elab ɔ̃kyel ke nkwel a Nziã wɛn bee k'eliin eluɔ wɛ, tiil ye k'ebam bee Pool. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Obobɔ, me b'otal byɛ, ekuru mfoo ye baal a mbal, eyɛɛn kapiri a ambwel-mbwel wɛn aya byɛ ye Pool, onge bɛn byɛ edzii k'etal ndɔɔ a ndɛ ngesɛ-ngesɛ. Me b'otal bee, bee emeewal ɔ̃yɛɛl wu ebam ndɛ ye k'etɔ ndɛ ŋã.»<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, muaan-nkyel a Pool oyoo nsia a mfoo oyɔ. Ndɛ oyɛn k'ekɔɔ ki ambwel-mbwel, osam, bu awi Pool nsia oyɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Obobɔ, Pool oti ngɔmɔ̃ onse ambiri b'ambwel-mbwel mbel, bvool olieel ndɛ bubu: «Biri nsam a bɔɔl yi ola kapiri, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ oli ye ndɔɔ yi aliaal ndɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Mbiri a ambwel-mbwel oyɛn ye nsam a bɔɔl ola kapiri, bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Pool wu mbuul a bwal oti mɛ̃ mbel, olieel mɛ̃ ndiri mbiri nsam a bɔɔl yi ola yɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ oli ye ndɔɔ yi aliaal yɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Kapiri osiin nsam a bɔɔl me kuɔɔl, oyɛn ye ndɛ me pyɛ, bu afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Ndɔɔ yi eyɛɛn yɛ mɛ̃ mã?» <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Ndɛ obveel ndiri: «Ayuda amaakuru mfoo yi aluɔɔn yɛ kwɛn ɔ̃suu, yɛ ya bɔ ye Pool ke mbal. Bɔ asa onge bɛn, bɔ adzii k'atal ndɔɔ a ndɛ ngesɛ-ngesɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Kɛn oyɛɛ ke kiool bɔ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ baal ãku-ãnã (40) y'esiɔ ayebva ndɛ edzel. Bɔ alab ɔ̃kyel wɛn bɔ k'akoo k'adza wɛ, k'akoo k'anywã hɛ̃ wɛ, tiil ye k'ebam bɔ ndɛ. Meba ŋã, bɔ amaawal ɔ̃yɛɛl, ayii ebekiaal kɛn ãtsam ã yɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Obobɔ, kapiri olieel ndɛ ndiri abee ndɔɔ oyɔ mbuul oliaal. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ oyɔɔl ndɛ oyɛn.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayuɔɔl Pool ola mfam Felikese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Kapiri oti baal buaal onse ambiri b'ambwel-mbwel mbel. Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Ebvool ambwel-mbwel ɛ̃nkam mviaal (200), ye baal ɛ̃kuun-nsiaan (70) b'anɔɔn ke ywel aswebval, ye baal ɛ̃nkam mviaal (200) b'atyal ãyuo. Bɔ àwal ɔ̃yɛɛl wu ayi bviil li Sedzale me lio li bva wa tsia. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Eyɛɛl aswebval hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a Pool, kwɛn byɛ ebiri ndɛ nzuru kɛɛ-kɛɛ ola mfam Felikese.» <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, kapiri oswɛn ɔ̃nkaan ndiri:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />«Mfam Felikese, mɛ̃ wu Kolode Lisias mbio yɛ! <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Mbuul wu èyuɔɔl mɛ̃ yɛ wu, Ayuda asiin ndɛ, bvool ákebii k'abam ndɛ. Ŋe ngyoo mɛ̃ kwɛn ndɛ oli mbuul a Lom, mɛ̃ nsam ongwel a ndɛ y'ambwel-mbwel a mɛ̃, bvool mvuul ndɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Onge bɛn mɛ̃ ekedzii k'eyɛɛ ngesɛ-ngesɛ elyal ki éfɛn bɔ ndɛ, mɛ̃ mbiri ndɛ ke mbal a bɔ yi nɛn. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Mɛ̃ mwɛn kwɛn bɔ áfɛn ndɛ m'ãndɔɔ m'ãtal ãngel ã bɔ. Kɛn elyal k'éli wɛ ki abam ndɛ wuo alɔ ndɛ bwal. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Alieel mɛ̃ ndiri bɔ amaakuru mfoo yi abam ndɛ. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn kɛn alili ŋã, mɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl yɛ ndɛ. Mɛ̃ ntam b'afɛn ndɛ wɛn ayebva ndɛ mbal ola yɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Ambwel-mbwel asi m'átam bɔ osa: Bɔ awel Pool bvool abiri ndɛ tsatsa tiil bviil li Ãntipatilis. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Ela esiool, ambwel-mbwel abvool ekɔɔ e bɔ, ayɔɔl b'áli ke ywel a aswebval ayɛn ye Pool. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Ŋ'etɔ baal obɔ Sedzale, bɔ awi mfam Felikese ɔ̃nkaan, bvool asiil Pool me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Ke mbee a ŋ'etsiɔ mfam Felikese ɔ̃nkaan, ndɛ ofuul Pool etswi e nsie ki efi ndɛ. Ŋ'eyoo ndɛ kwɛn ndɛ oli Ɔ̃fi-Silisi, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />ndɛ olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ èyoo yɛ ŋ'ètɔ baal b'afɛn yɛ.» Ndɛ bu atam k'akwɛɛ Pool onse nzɔ a Elode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzɔ oyɔ yi ékekal amfam a Lom ke Sedzale. Mfam wa tsɔɔn, Elode wu ɔ̃kuul, mbuul wu átuu yɔ.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Ayuda abvi Pool mbal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Ke mbee ãtsoo ãtaan, ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn Ananias otɔ Sedzale y'akuul-kuul ke kwɛ bwɛn ɔ̃yɛɛn ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Tɛɛtulus. Bɔ ayi ola mfam Felikese me ndɔɔ yi abva Pool mbal. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Ndɛ bu ayuɔɔl Pool ɔ̃sia-mpɔɔl. Tɛɛtulus obvi buu li ndɛ oliaal bubu: «Mfam, bee eli bam onse opi me ndɔɔ a yɛ. Yɛ faal ɔ̃kiri a bia-byɛ kwɛn mbueel ãyi ngesɛ, ke ngwel wɛ yɛ li y'ɔ̃nyiã. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Mfam Felikese, bee ekiool obvɛ obɔ ãlio mbueel y'ãmboo mbueel, bee etuɛɛn yɛ ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ mbee yɛ lio bibi owal, mɛ̃ mbuɛɛn yɛ k'ayoo bee me lio etsi-tsiri, ke ngwel wɛ yɛ li mbuul wa ngesɛ wu abesio baal nyiĩ. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Ngwanyã, bee emwɛn kwɛn ngaburu wu ndyam ɔ̃bi ali. Ndɛ abelɔ tsungaa onse Ayuda b'ɔ̃kiri a nsie wueel. Ndɛ oli mfam a nkel yi Afi-Nadzalet. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Ndɛ akekie k'asiaan Nzɔ a Nziã. Bee bu esiin ndɛ. [Bee ekedzii k'etsiil ndɔɔ a ndɛ m'emfa ki etam ãngel ã bee, <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />kɛn a kapiri Lisias osam ongwel a ndɛ, bu awɛɛl ndɛ onse mviɔɔl ɛ̃ bee m'ãnkɔɔl. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Ndɛ wu Lisias otam bee ndiri eyebva ndɛ mbal ola yɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ãndɔɔ mã, k'ákel mɔ̃ onse ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>] Yɛ afuul ndɛ me yam, yɛ olɔ mwɛn otaa-taa b'ãndɔɔ m'ebvi bee ndɛ mbal.» <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Ayuda atsweel m'ékeyɛɛn Tɛɛtulus, ndiri: «Eli taa-taa!»<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buu e Pool ke nkwel a Felikese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Mfam Felikese opyel Pool me ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛn. Pool ayebvuru oyɛɛn, olieel bubu: «Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ kwɛn yɛ abesa ontwel onse ɔ̃kiri a bia-byɛ fa mvel bibi. Obobɔ, mɛ̃ ndi ye kaã li eliaal buu li mɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Yam koo k'abwɛɛl ngesɛ, ãtsoo kɛn anduru kuun ye mbuaal wɛ me ntɔ mɛ̃ Yelusalem me ndɔɔ yi elweel Nziã. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />K'eli ye mboo yi ayebɔɔ mɛ̃ etsuun ye mbuul wuo elɔ tsungaa onse baal wɛ, ekal onse Nzɔ a Nziã, ekal onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn, ekal onse bviil. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Baal ba k'ali y'eliĩ ki esuo otaa-taa b'ãndɔɔ m'ebvi bɔ mɛ̃ mbal meba wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ ekiool ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃ ke nkwel a yɛ: Mɛ̃ ebesal me ndɔɔ a Nziã a ankiɔɔn a mɛ̃, m'onɔɔn o nkuul yi nyiɔɔn, yi eyɛɛn bɔ ndiri yi mbi. Mɛ̃ ebekiool mbueel m'ákel onse ɛ̃nkaan mi ãngel ye mi aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Mɛ̃ ndi ye kaã li ebeta mɛ̃ me Nziã, kaã lɛn bam b'abvi mɛ̃ mbal abeta lɔ hɛ̃ ndiri Nziã akieel aseel b'ákwi-ákwi, abi y'abvɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ebesa mpɛn yi ekal y'epfuũ bvi ngesɛ ke nkwel a Nziã bvool ke nkwel a baal.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Ke mbee a mvel bibi yɛn mɛ̃ k'éli ke Yelusalem wɛ, mɛ̃ yemvool okɔ, me ndɔɔ yi eyewa wuaal li nzi ola aywal b'onse yam e mɛ̃, bvool me ndɔɔ yi ewa Nziã ãkab. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Omɔ̃ ãndɔɔ m'ekesoo mɛ̃ ŋ'eyebɔɔ bɔ mɛ̃ onse Nzɔ a Nziã. Oŋɔ̃ ke mbee a ŋ'eman mɛ̃ ɛ̃kiri mi akal tsɛtsɛ osa, embuul pyɛ, tsungaa hɛ̃ pyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Kɛn Ayuda ke kwɛ ba nsie yi Adzi baal b'áli oŋɔ̃. Okɛɛn bɔ abɔɔ mɛ̃ y'elyal, bɔ baal b'akaaya mɛ̃ mbal obva ola yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Okɛɛn baal obɔ k'ali ŋã wɛ, oŋɔ̃ yɔɔl kwɛn bɔ ba, ameyɛɛn ndɔɔ yi enɛn yi nsi mɛ̃ ŋ'etsuun mɛ̃ ke mbal yi nɛn. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Eli kɛn a ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃ yi ebiool mɛ̃ tɛ ke nkwel a bɔ wɛn: “Mɛ̃ ebekiool wɛn b'ákwi-ákwi akieel asiool.” Oyɔ ndɔɔ yi abvi mɛ̃ mbal ola yɛ nonɔ̃.»<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Felikese wu áyɛɛ otsɛn o nkuul a Mfam ngesɛ, oswɛɛl esal lɔɔ. Ndɛ olieel b'ábvi Pool mbal bubu: «Kapiri Lisias àya, mɛ̃ ètsiil esal e byɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Ndɛ otam mbiri a ambwel-mbwel ndiri asuul Pool onse bwal, kɛn a ndɛ àkal ndii, bvool awa andoo a ndɛ nkuul yi awuaal a ndɛ.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ke nkwel a Felikese ye Dolusile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Ke mbee ãtsoo ke kwɛ, Felikese oyi y'ɔ̃kal a ndɛ Dolusile wu áli Ɔ̃yuda. Ndɛ wu Felikese otam Pool mbel ota, bvool oyoo k'eyɛɛn ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi etal okiool me Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Kɛn a me lio li ebvi Pool oyɛɛn me ndɔɔ emfa ki akal dzu, ki akal y'osɛ-mwiĩ, bvool y'otsiil b'ãndɔɔ b'òyeya, Felikese buɔ obɔɔ, bu alieel Pool bubu: «Yɛ koo k'ayi. Ŋ'èbɔɔ mɛ̃ lio, mɛ̃ èta yɛ mbel bvool.» <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Felikese áketa kaã hɛ̃ ndiri Pool ále ol'owi ndɛ nzi. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ndɛ áketa ndɛ mbel ɛ̃nswɛɛl-ɛ̃nswɛɛl me ndɔɔ yi ata ɔ̃sam ye ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Mvel yuaal bu ekoo m'emfa okyɛ, Pookius Fesitus bu akiri mboo a Felikese. Onge bɛn ndɛ ákedzii k'asa Ayuda esɛ, ndɛ okwee Pool onse bwal.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Pool osɔɔ kwɛn abiri ndɔɔ a ndɛ ola Sedzaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Ãtsoo ãtyel ke mbee a ŋ'ewel Fesitus omfam, ndɛ ombal Sedzale, oyɛn Yelusalem. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Okɔ, amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'amfam b'Ayuda ayebva Pool mbal ola ndɛ. Bɔ asi ɔ̃tɛɛ̃, <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />m'obesɔɔ kwɛn ndɛ asio bɔ nyiĩ yi ayɔɔl Pool aya Yelusalem. Bɔ ákekuru k'abva ndɛ edzel, kwɛn abam ndɛ me nkuul. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Kɛn a Fesitus obveel bɔ ndiri Pool oli me bwal ke Sedzale, bvool ndiri ndyam hɛ̃ ŋ'asa akɔɔl okɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Ndɛ olweel bubu: «Yɔɔl kwɛn amfam a byɛ ayi Sedzale ye mɛ̃, kwɛn okɛɛn mbuul wu asi ndɔɔ yi mbi, bɔ ayefɛn ndɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fesitus k'asi ãtsoo ãnduru mpuɔ̃ wuo kuun ke Yelusalem wɛ, bu ayebvool Sedzale. Ela esiool, ndɛ obvi nsɛn ke mbal, bu atam Pool owal. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Ŋ'etɔ ndɛ, Ayuda b'áfi Yelusalem adzii ndɛ, bu abvi ãbuu oliaal ndiri ndɛ opwee etsob bibi, kɛn a bɔ k'ákekoo k'asuo otaa-taa b'ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Kɛn a Pool olieel buu li ndɛ bubu: «Mɛ̃ ke nsi obi si omɔ̃ wɛ, ekal me ngel a Ayuda, ekal me Nzɔ a Nziã, ekal m'ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃nɛn Sedzaal.»<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Onge bɛn Fesitus ákedzii k'asa Ayuda b'áli oŋɔ̃ esɛ, ndɛ ofuul Pool ndiri: «Yɛ dzii k'ayi Yelusalem kwɛn atsiil ndɔɔ a yɛ yi ke nkwel a mɛ̃?» <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Pool obveel ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ŋã ndi ke mbal yi me nsie a Sedzaal, yi mboo yi atsiil ndɔɔ a mɛ̃. Onge b'eyɛɛ yam bam ngesɛ, mɛ̃ ke nsi Ayuda ndɔɔ yi mbi wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Okɛɛn mɛ̃ nsi obi, bvool okɛɛn mɛ̃ nsi ndɔɔ mbi pyɛ yɛn obvie abam mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke mbee k'ekwa wɛ. Kɛn okɛɛn otaa-taa k'oli onse ãbuu m'elieel bɔ me mɛ̃ wɛ, ãngel ã Lom k'ãwa mbuul nkuul yi awa mɛ̃ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ bɔ wɛ. Yɔɔl kwɛn ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃nɛn atal ndɔɔ a mɛ̃.» <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Obobɔ, Fesitus ayekuru mfoo y'antwel a ndɛ, obveel Pool bubu: «Yɛ sɔɔ kwɛn abiri ndɔɔ a yɛ ola Sedzaal, yɛ ŋ'àyi ola ndɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ke nkwel Agilipa ye Belenise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Ke mbee ãtsoo ke kwɛ, ɔ̃kwɛn Agilipa ye nkyel a ndɛ Belenise ayi Sedzale me ndɔɔ yi abio Fesitus. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Onge bɛn bɔ ákesa ãtsoo bibi oŋɔ̃, Fesitus olieel ɔ̃kwɛn ndɔɔ a Pool ndiri: «Ŋã eli ye mbuul wu ésiil Felikese onse bwal. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Ŋ'éyɛn mɛ̃ Yelusalem, amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'akuul-kuul b'Ayuda ábvi ndɛ mbal bvool ásɔɔ kwɛn mɛ̃ ngwa ndɛ etumbu. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Mɛ̃ ébveel bɔ wɛn ãngel m'Afi-Lom k'ãwa nkuul yi awa mbuul me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ b'abvi ndɛ mbal wɛ. Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel kɛn, ebvaan ndɛ ayoo buu e b'afɛn ndɛ ke mbal. Oŋɔ̃, ndɛ fi abetsuun ye bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Obobɔ, bɔ ayi ŋã ye mɛ̃. Onge bɛn mɛ̃ k'édzii k'esiaal ãndɔɔ lela wɛ, ela esiool, mɛ̃ mvi nsɛn ke mbal, bu ntam mbuul ondɛ owal. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Ŋ'éyi b'ábvi ndɛ mbal, bɔ k'ásuo ãndɔɔ m'ãbi m'éketsam mɛ̃ wɛn ndɛ owɛɛl ási wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Bɔ áketsuun kɛn a me ndɔɔ onziã o bam bvool me ndɔɔ a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Yeso wu ákwi, kɛn a Pool abeyɛɛn ndiri ndɛ oli mwiĩ. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Me b'otal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ mbii ãyal m'etsiil ndɔɔ yi obobɔ okwɛɛn. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn Pool ndiri ayi Yelusalem kwɛn atsiil ndɔɔ a ndɛ okɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Kɛn a ndɛ ásɔɔ kwɛn ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃nɛn Sedzaal atsiil ndɔɔ a ndɛ. Mɛ̃ bu ntam kwɛn asuul ndɛ kɛn akal onse bwal me muaan-lio, ye k'eyuɔɔl mɛ̃ ndɛ ola Sedzaal.» <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agilipa olieel Fesitus bubu: «Mɛ̃ nzii k'eyoo mbuul ondɛ me myam.» Fesitus obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ɔ̃suu yɛ àyoo ndɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Ela esiool, Agilipa ye Belenise ayi ye dzuun lueel, bvool asam onse mbal y'amfam b'ambwel-mbwel y'akuul-kuul a bviil. Ayi ye Pool, onge b'etam Fesitus osa. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Obobɔ, Fesitus oyɛɛn bubu: «Ɔ̃kwɛn Agilipa ye byɛ bueel b'eli ye bee ŋã, etal mbuul wu: Ayuda bueel, ekal ke Yelusalem, ekal ŋã, ayeyɛɛn buu me ndɔɔ a ndɛ ola mɛ̃ ndiri: “Ndɛ k'abvaan bvool m'okal mwiĩ wɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Me b'otal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke mwɛn ndɔɔ yi esi ndɛ yɛn obvie awi ndɛ etumbu ki epfu wɛ. Kɛn onge bɛn ndyam osɔɔ kwɛn Sedzaal atsiil ndɔɔ a ndɛ, mɛ̃ nkuru k'eyuɔɔl ndɛ ola ndɛ ke Lom. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Mɛ̃ ke ndi ye ndɔɔ yi nkwa yɛn mɛ̃ olɔ nswɛn Sedzaal me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wɛ, obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ ngyi ye ndɛ ke nkwel a byɛ, bvel-bvel ke nkwel a yɛ wu ɔ̃kwɛn Agilipa. Me fuul ndɛ buu, ke mbee a buu e ndɛ, mɛ̃ olɔ mbɔɔ ndɔɔ yi eswɛn. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Ke ngwel wɛ, k'eli ngesɛ wɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl mbuul a bwal ke Lom, okɛɛn mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛn ngesɛ-ngesɛ elyal ki alɔ ndɛ bwal wɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Pool olieel buu li ndɛ ke nkwel a Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agilipa olieel Pool bubu: «Awi yɛ nkuul yi aliaal buu li yɛ.» Pool ayendɛɛl kuɔɔl, olieel buu li ndɛ bubu: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />«Ɔ̃kwɛn Agilipa, nonɔ̃ mɛ̃ ndi y'esɛ ki eliaal buu li mɛ̃ ke nkwel a yɛ me mbueel m'efɛn Ayuda mɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ yɛɛ bam ngesɛ onkɔɔ b'Ayuda y'ãndɔɔ m'ebetsuun bɔ me mɔ̃. Obobɔ, mɛ̃ mbuɛɛn yɛ, meyoo mɛ̃ y'osɛ-mwiĩ bueel.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Ayuda bueel ayɛɛ emfa ki ékekal mɛ̃ fa obwee o mɛ̃, onse yam e mɛ̃ ke Yelusalem. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Mɛ̃ éli ngɔmɔ̃ onse nkel a Afalisaye, nkel a onziã o bee, yi enduru k'etal ãndɔɔ ngesɛ-ngesɛ. Okɛɛn bɔ adzii, bɔ akoo m'otsweel wɛn taa-taa. Ke ngwel wɛ, etel-nziil bɔ ayɛɛ mɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Meba, abvi mɛ̃ mbal me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ ebeta kaã me lɔɔ li éwi Nziã ankiɔɔn a bee. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Lɔɔ lɛn ãyam ã bee kuun ye mbuaal, m'ãbebuɛɛn Nziã y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ tsia mwiĩ, ãbeta kaã ndiri Nziã àsa kwɛn lɔɔ ekoo. Ee ɔ̃kwɛn, kaã olɔ li esi kwɛn Ayuda afɛn mɛ̃! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Otsɛn omã b'ebetsam byɛ, byɛ b'Ayuda, wɛn Nziã k'akoo k'aseel b'ákwi-ákwi wɛ? <verse eid="ACT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Myam hɛ̃ tsɔɔn ŋ'ɛ̃kwel éketsam wɛn mɛ̃ olɔ nsi mbueel me ndɔɔ yi eluo baal nkuũ a Yeso okiool. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Oyɔ ndɔɔ yi ési mɛ̃ ke Yelusalem. M'omfam b'ékewa amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndɔ akiool bibi bwal. Ŋ'ákewɛɛ wɛn ebvaan bɔ àbɔɔ etumbu ki epfu, mɛ̃ éketsweel wɛn asa obobɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Mɛ̃ ékebwel onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn mbueel me ndɔɔ yi ewa baal etumbu, bvool ékeywɛɛn bɔ k'asiaan nkuũ a Yeso. Onge bɛn mpuru a mɛ̃ ye bɔ énduru ɔ̃ndel, mɛ̃ éketuaal bɔ mpal tiil k'ãbviil m'ãnzii.»<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool oyɛɛn emfa ki ekaal ndɛ ɔ̃kwal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />«M'emfa okyɛ, tsoo ngelemɔ̃, mɛ̃ ékeyi Damas. Amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã átam mɛ̃ okɔ y'omfam b'esiin akiool. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Ɔ̃kwɛn, mɛ̃ éli me nkuul, sua tal dzu, mɛ̃ mwɛn mbaa efi ywel, enduru tal m'onyɛɛn, edzii mɛ̃ ye b'áli ye mɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Bee bueel ebvi me nsie, bvool mɛ̃ ngyoo nkii ngamɔ̃ eyɛɛn mɛ̃ m'ɔ̃nywã wu Ebele ndiri: “Sol, Sol, ki ebetuaal yɛ mɛ̃ mpal emã? Yɛ abetɛn nzuru yam onge ngwɛmbɛ wu abedzwaan y'ɔ̃mpaã a mfam a ndɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Mɛ̃ mveel wɛn: “Yɛ nã li, Mfam?” Mfam obveel ndiri: “Mɛ̃ ndyam ndi Yeso wɛn yɛ ndyam abetuaal mpal. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Oŋɔ̃ siool, bvool tɛɛn dzu. Otsɛn be mpal mɛ̃ ola yɛ, bɔ ba: Mɛ̃ èsuul yɛ ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃. Yɛ àkal ntam a mɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛn emfa ki emwɛn yɛ mɛ̃ nonɔ̃, yɛ hɛ̃ àliaal m'ekieel esuo mɛ̃ yɛ ke nkwel. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Mɛ̃ ekieel ebvuul yɛ me mviɔɔl mi Ayuda, ye mi baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, b'ètam mɛ̃ yɛ ola bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Mɛ̃ ètam yɛ m'odzweel o bɔ mviil, kwɛn bɔ apal onse lempeel aya ke mbaa, bvool kwɛn bɔ apal onse waan e Satana, aya ola Nziã. Bɔ akiool mɛ̃, bɔ àbɔɔ odzeel b'ãbi, bvool akab ɛ̃swal ɛ̃ ba ngel.”»<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool oyɛɛn me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal a ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />«Obobɔ, ɔ̃kwɛn Agilipa, mɛ̃ ke nkwɛɛn k'elweel m'émwɛn mɛ̃, m'ã́fi ola Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, mɛ̃ ntee baal a Damas, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ntee ba Yelusalem, ntee ke Yude wueel ye baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ. Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn wɛn ebvaan bɔ akaal ɛ̃kwal, bvool akɔɔl ola Nziã, asa ãndɔɔ m'ãsuo kwɛn bɔ akaal ɛ̃kwal. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Obɔ otsɛn b'esiin Ayuda mɛ̃ onse Nzɔ a Nziã, bvool abii k'abam mɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Kɛn onge bɛn Nziã abekiaal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ kɛn ndi mwiĩ, bvool ebeyɛɛn kɛn oyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a Yeso ke nkwel akiɔɔl y'akuul. M'ebeliaal mɛ̃, m'élieel Moyize y'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã bakyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Bɔ álieel ndiri Mãsia akieel amwɛn fool. Bɔ hɛ̃ álieel ndiri ndɛ akieel akal mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel wu àsiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi, bvool àtee Nsia yɛn onge mwiĩ wu asa kwɛn Ayuda ye bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ abɔɔ obvuul.»<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool olieel Agilipa ndiri akiool Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Ŋ'ékeliaal Pool buu li ndɛ, Fesitus olieel kokɔ ndiri: «Pool, yɛ ye laa li? Yɛ ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃nduru, bu eti yɛ laa!» <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Pool obveel ndiri: «Mfam Fesitus, mɛ̃ ke ndi ye laa wɛ. Ke yam, ãyɛɛn m'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ ãli mã taa-taa, bvool ãli mã y'otsɛn. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Ɔ̃kwɛn Agilipa oyɛɛ ãndɔɔ mã mbueel, obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ eyɛɛn ye ndɛ k'ebveel kuul mbee wɛ. Mɛ̃ nkiool wɛn ndɛ yi adzɛɛn pyɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel k'ãbwel m'edziɔɔn wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Ɔ̃kwɛn Agilipa, yɛ abekiool m'élieel aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã? Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ wɛn yɛ abekiool mɔ̃!» <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agilipa olieel Pool ndiri: «Yɛ ŋ'atsam wɛn yɛ olɔ si kwɛn mɛ̃ nkal ɔ̃kiool me lio etsi-tsiri bubu?» <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Pool bu abveel ndiri: «Ekal alili ŋã, ekal ke mbee ãlio bibi, mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn, me mpɛn a Nziã, yɛ ye b'abeyoo mɛ̃ nonɔ̃, ekal onge mɛ̃, kɛn a byɛ k'ekal mã mpaa bubu wɛ!»<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Obobɔ, ɔ̃kwɛn Agilipa ye mfam Fesitus, ye Belenise, ye bueel b'áli me nsɛn ye bɔ, atɛɛn. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Ŋ'eyii eyi bɔ, bɔ abvi oyɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Mbuul wu yi asi pyɛ yɛn ebvaan ndɛ akwa wuo asam bwal.» <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Me b'otal Agilipa, ndɛ olieel Fesitus bubu: «Al'okɛɛn mbuul wu k'asɔɔ kwɛn Sedzaal atsiil ndɔɔ a ndɛ wɛ, kɛn ekeepaal ndɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Oyi b'Itali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Ŋ'ákuru wɛn ebvaan bee eyi Itali, awi Pool ye baal a bwal akyam ke kwɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ mbiri a ambwel-mbwel ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Dzulihus, wa nkel yi ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃nɛn Oguste. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Bee eyesam onse ãsua mã bviil li Adalamite, m'ã́keyi ãbuu mã nsie yi Adzi, bu eyɛn. Alisitaake wu ɔ̃fi-Maseduaan wa bviil li Tesalonik, áli ye bee.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Ela esiool, bee etɔ Sidɔ̃. Onge bɛn Dzulihus ási Pool obvɛ, ndɛ owi ndɛ nkuul yi ayetal andoo a ndɛ b'oŋɔ̃, kwɛn bɔ awuaal a ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Bee embal oŋɔ̃ m'ãsua, bu eyɛn nku-a-nku esanga ki Swipele, me ndɔɔ yɛn amfel ákebveel bee mbee. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Ŋ'etsiil bee ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa mã tsotsoo a nsie yi Silisi ye yi Pamfili, bee etɔ Mila, ke Lisi. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Oŋɔ̃, mbiri a ambwel-mbwel obɔɔ ãsua mã bviil li Alekesandele m'ã́keyi Itali. Ndɛ oswɛɛl bee onse mɔ̃.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Ãtsoo bibi, bee ékeyi m'ɔ̃kwal m'ɔ̃kwal, bu eyetɔ bviil li Kinide ye fool lam bibi. Kɛn a mfel k'ákewa bee nkuul yi eyi nkwel m'olɔ wɛ. Obobɔ, bee ebwel me li esanga ki Kelete, sua Salomone. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Bee esyel nkwel onse fool lam bibi, bu etɔ mboo yi ata m'«Ãbuu m'ãbvɛ», tsotsoo a bviil li Lasee.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Onge bɛn bee lio ebwel lam bibi, bee k'ebekoo k'enɔɔn a nkuul a bee wɛ: Dzwɛ al'eyii ye fool lam bibi, bvool eyii ebii epfu e baal. Tsoo li abesa ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tsoo olɔ eli tsoo e pfuun li Ayuda li odzeel b'ãbi. Me tsoo olɔ, ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn ákewa kab me ndɔɔ ãbi ã yam lam lueel li Isalayel (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 16:29-34">Lev 16.29-34</ref></char>). Pfuun olɔ ékebva me nswii wa bva wuo ŋ'eyebɛɛn nswii wa kuun. Me lio olɔ dzwɛ me nzal eli ye fool ãyal pyɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn olɔ lio li amfel a mpuru.</note> al'emeebwel. Pool bu awi baal ãnkunkwa bubu: <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />«Andoo a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ mwɛn wɛn dzwɛ li ãsua li k'èywɛn a mpal wɛ, ekal me ndɔɔ ãsua mam, ekal me ndɔɔ a eluɔ bvi obɔɔ̃, onkyam me ndɔɔ a bia-byam.» <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Kɛn a mbiri k'áketa kaã m'ãyɛɛn ã Pool wɛ, ndɛ éketa kaã me wu ákedzoo ãsua ye nga-mɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Ndɔɔ yinkyɛ yɛn, onge bɛn buu k'ébvaan m'obwel b'ɔ̃bvu wa mfyɛ oŋɔ̃ wɛ, baal bibi onse ãsua akuru k'ambal oŋɔ̃. Bɔ ákebii k'atɔ buu ngelemɔ̃ li Kelete li ata me Fenikese, m'etswi ki edziin tal, kwɛn ɔ̃bvu wa mfyɛ abwel bɔ okɔ.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfel a mpuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Emfe-mfel ki efa etswi ki nsɛn ebvi opob, baal b'ãsua abvi otsam ndiri bɔ ol'asi m'éwɛɛ bɔ. Bɔ bu ayɛn bvool akie k'asyal nkwel nku-a-nku ekwel ki esanga ki Kelete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Kɛn a ke mbee a muaan-lio, mfel a mpuru wu ata me «mfel wu etswi ki epal tal» ofi ãnkio m'esanga, bu abvi opob. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Mfel obiri ãsua, ndɛ obvel mɔ̃ mpɛn. Bee bu eyɔɔl mfel obiri bee. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Bee ebwel ke nsɛn a muaan-esanga ki ata me Kahuda, ki ékebal bee mfel etsi-tsiri. Onse fool lam, bee esi mpɛn k'esiin bvuaal b'obvuul baal. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Bee eyelɔ bvuaal obɔ onse ãsua. Bee hɛ̃ ewel ɛ̃sii mi ɛ̃nɛn me ndɔɔ yi edzii ãsua, kwɛn mɔ̃ ãkal y'ɔ̃kiin. Bɔ ákebal owɛɛl ãsua ãyesiɛɛn nkal ɔ̃nka wu esɛɛ bvi Libi, bɔ bu atyel eluɔ ki esa kwɛn mɔ̃ ãbee me ntiin oyi. Mfel bu ayii abiri mɔ̃ m'ɔ̃kwal m'ɔ̃kwal.<verse eid="ACT 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Mfel a mpuru ákenziool bee kɛn onziool kokɔ. Ela esiool, baal abvi eluɔ bvikyɛ otyal onse ãdza. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Tsoo li ãtyel, bam b'adzoo atyel esɔɔl bvi ãsua m'ãdza. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Ãtsoo bibi, tal k'épal wɛ, angam-a-ngam hɛ̃ k'ápal wɛ. Onge bɛn mfel áli kɛn ye mpuru, bee kaã li ebvuul efi lam.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Esi ãtsoo bibi mɛn bee k'édzi wɛ. Obobɔ, Pool ayetɛɛn onse baal b'ãsua, olieel bubu: «Andoo a mɛ̃, ale kɛn byɛ ekeeyoo mɛ̃, bvool al'ekeebee Kelete ombal. M'emfa okyɛ, bia-byɛ k'ekeemwɛɛn ye mfel a mpuru wu wɛ, bvool k'ekeedzeel eluɔ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Kɛn a meba, mɛ̃ ewa byɛ luo wɛn ekal ye mpɛn, ke ngwel wɛ ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ k'àkwa wɛ, kɛn ãsua ãyi nkel. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Ngwanyã, ãnzwel ã Nziã wɛn mɛ̃ ndi wa ndɛ bvool esal me ndɛ, ãpal ola mɛ̃ me tsia wu. <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />Mɔ̃ ãlieel mɛ̃ bubu: “Pool, bee ye buɔ okal, ebvaan atsiil ãndɔɔ ã yɛ ke nkwel a Sedzaal, bvool Nziã, me nyiĩ a ndɛ yi nɛn, abvuul baal bueel b'ali ye yɛ onse ãsua, me ndɔɔ a yɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />M'emfa okyɛ, andoo a mɛ̃, ekal y'onzɔɔ̃, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ndi y'okiool me Nziã wɛn ãndɔɔ ãbwel kɛn a m'emfa ki eyɛɛn ndɛ mɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Kɛn ãsua ã̀tyal bia-byɛ nkal esanga ngemɔ̃ bubu.»<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Ondɛ al'eyii tsia wa kuun y'anã wɛn mfel afa ye bee ngwel abwel a bee ngwel nkal a nzal yi Meditelane. Sua kuku, b'asal m'ãsua ayebɔɔ ãtsam ndiri bee al'eyii ebiɔɔn ekwel. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Bɔ atyel emvɛɛl, bu amwɛn kwɛn dzio li ãdza éli ametele ãku-ãtyel ye nsiaan (37). Bɔ asyel ãnku-nkwel, bvool atyel emvɛɛl, bu amwɛn kwɛn dzio al'eyii ametele ãku-mbuaal ye mpuɔ̃ (28). <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Onge bɛn bɔ ákebal kwɛn ãsua ãbee ãnkɔɔn obvool, bɔ atyel alongo anã b'atɛɛl ãsua. Bɔ áli ɔ̃kwal mbaa-mbaa kwɛn bviil otsa tswa-a-tswa. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Kɛn a onge bɛn b'asal m'ãsua ákebii k'abal, bɔ atyel bvuaal onse ãdza. Bɔ asi empa onge b'atyal alongo b'atɛɛl ãsua ke nkwel. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Pool olieel mbiri y'ambwel-mbwel a ndɛ bubu: «Okɛɛn baal ba k'akal onse ãsua wɛ, byɛ k'ekoo m'obvuul wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Obobɔ, ambwel-mbwel atsiil ɛ̃sii ɛ̃ bvuaal, bu ayɔɔl bɔ otsi.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Ye k'etsa bviil, Pool oluɔɔn baal bueel k'adza. Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Nonɔ̃ eyii ãtsoo kuun y'ãnã m'ebekiaal byɛ ɛ̃kwal ke ywel, bvool m'eli byɛ me nzal, k'edza eluɔ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ nduɔɔn byɛ wɛn edza, ke ngwel wɛ byɛ eli ye kɔɔ e bvi-odza me ndɔɔ yi ebvuul. Onse byɛ, mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ wu èpiool onkyam efu li ɔ̃tswɛ a ndɛ k'àkal wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Ndɛ aman obobɔ oyɛɛn, owel mampa, obveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn ke nkwel a baal bueel, otsiil ndɛ, bu abvi odza. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />M'emfa okyɛ, baal bueel abɔɔ mpɛn, bu adzi hɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Bee bueel éli ɛ̃nkam mviaal y'ɛ̃kuun-nsiaan y'asɛɛn (276) onse ãsua. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Ŋ'edzi baal bueel ayool, bɔ atyel nsia e bele m'ãdza, kwɛn ãsua ãkal yɛɛ.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Odziin b'ãsua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Ŋ'etsi bviil, b'asal m'ãsua k'abeyɛɛ nsie wɛ, kɛn a bɔ ataal ekwel ke ntɔ a mpampa, akuru k'ayesiɛɛn ãsua oŋɔ̃, okɛɛn bɔ al'akoo. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Bɔ anyiɔɔn alongo b'atɛɛl ãsua, kwɛn bvɛ eyi me nzal. Bɔ hɛ̃ apeel ɛ̃sii mi eluɔ ki ebebiri ãsua, kwɛn bɔ adzoo mɔ̃. Bɔ asuul ekɔ ke nkwel a mɔ̃, kwɛn mfel atsɛɛn mɔ̃, bɔ bu asyel sua ekwel. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Kɛn a bɔ ayetsob y'esɛɛ, ãsua k'ãbetsiɔ̃ wɛ. Etswel ki nkwel esam onse esɛɛ, kyɛ k'ebekoo k'epal wɛ. Epoo bvi kokɔ bu ebwel etswel ki mbee.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Ambwel-mbwel ákuru k'abam baal a bwal, kwɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ abee obal m'onyiã. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Kɛn onge bɛn mbiri a ambwel-mbwel ádzii k'abvuul Pool, ndɛ oluo bɔ k'asa b'ékuru bɔ. Ndɛ otam kwɛn b'ayɛɛ k'anyiã abva m'ãdza ɛ̃kwel, me ndɔɔ yi ayi k'ekwel. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Baal b'asiil ánɔɔn a bɔ nkal ãbɛɛ wuo nkal etswel bvi ãsua. Obobɔ, baal bueel asiɛɛn kɛɛ-kɛɛ, ndɔɔ pyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Pool k'esanga ki Malate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Ŋ'etɔ bee kɛɛ-kɛɛ, alieel bee ndiri nkuũ a esanga okyɛ Malate. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />B'ákekal k'esanga okyɛ ayɔɔ bee bam ngesɛ. Bɔ ayɔɔ bee tsotsoo a mbaa yi nɛn yi éndɛɛl bɔ me ndɔɔ yɛn mvel wa bibi ákendwɔɔ, bvool mfyɛ ékesa. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Pool otwel pfoo e nkwii yi nkɛɛ, m'olɔ o yɔ onse mbaa. Mpel ngɔmɔ̃ ayeyɔɔ mbaa, opal onse yɔ, bu andɛɛl ndɛ me kuɔɔl. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Ŋ'emwɛn baal b'esanga okyɛ ntaal atsuu lyal-a-lyal me kuɔɔl e ndɛ, bɔ alieel bam-a-bam ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mbuul wu ɔ̃bam a baal ali, nzal-a-ŋɛn onkyam ŋɛn ndɛ obvuul m'ãdza, nziã wa dzu k'awa ndɛ nkuul yi akal mwiĩ wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Kɛn a Pool okweel ntaal ondɛ onse mbaa, eluɔ si ngemɔ̃ k'esi ndɛ mpuru wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Baal áketsam ndiri ndɛ nzuru ol'ebiin, wuo ol'okwi bam alili oŋɔ̃. Kɛn a bɔ akieel lio bibi, amwɛn kwɛn ndɔɔ yi mbi si ngamɔ̃ yi etɔ me ndɛ pyɛ. Bɔ bu aswɛɛl ãtsam, abvi oyɛɛn ndiri Pool nziã ali.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />M'opal obɔ, éli y'ekɔɔ ngemɔ̃ ki mfam a esanga okyɛ wɛn nkuũ Pubilihus. Ndɛ wu áyɔɔ bee, bvool áwi bee lɔɔ y'ondoo bueel ãtsoo ãtyel. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Tal a ndɛ áli bɔ me ndɔɔ a bal ye tsob li ãdza-ãdza. Pool osam onse nzɔ a ndɛ, obuɛɛn me ndɛ, ondɔɔl ndɛ mviɔɔl, bvool oboo ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Obobɔ, anga-ãluu bakyɛ b'esanga okyɛ ayi hɛ̃ ola Pool, bɔ bu abvuul. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Awi bee dzuun lam bibi. Ŋ'eyii eyi bee, bɔ abuun bee bvi éli bee ye kɔɔ e bvɛ.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ombal Malate oyɛn Lom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Bee al'émbal oŋɔ̃ ke mbee a nswii tyel, bu eyɛn m'ãsua m'Alekesandele, mɛn nkuũ Diosikules. Lio li mfyɛ ébwel ãsua omɔ̃ ke buu ngelemɔ̃ li esanga okyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Bee esiɛɛn ke bviil li Silakuse, bu elaal ãtsoo ãtyel oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Bee embal oŋɔ̃, eyɛn me nzal-a-nzal, bu etɔ bviil li Lengio. Ela esiool, mfel wa nsɛn obvi opob, m'ãtsoo mbuaal bee etɔ bviil li Pudzoles. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Oŋɔ̃, bee emwɛn andoo, b'aluɔɔn ola bee kwɛn bee ekal ãtsoo nsiaan ye bɔ. Okyɛ emfa ki éyɛn bee Lom. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Andoo a bviil olɔ ábɔɔ ãnsia ã bee. Bɔ bu ayemwɛɛn ye bee tiil ke Yu li Apihus bvool tiil ke mboo yi ata m'«Ãnzɔ-m'anzii-ãtyel». Ŋ'emwɛn Pool bɔ, ndɛ otuɛɛn Nziã, bvool obɔɔ mpɛn.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ke Lom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Ŋ'etɔ bee Lom, awi Pool nkuul yi akal me pyɛ ye mbwel-mbwel wu ákekiaal ndɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Ke mbee ãtsoo ãtyel, Pool oti amfam b'Ayuda mbel k'abvɔɔn. Ŋ'ebvɔɔn bɔ, ndɛ obvi bɔ oliaal bubu: «Baan-ngoo, mɛ̃ ki nsi yam e bia-byɛ wuo onkɔɔ b'ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ pyɛ. Kɛn a asiin mɛ̃ ke Yelusalem, bu awi me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal a Lom. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Ŋ'efuul bɔ obɔ mɛ̃ ɛ̃mfuul, bɔ amwɛn kwɛn mɛ̃ yi mbi yi nsi yi awa mɛ̃ etumbu ki epfu pyɛ. Bɔ bu akuru k'ayɔɔl mɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Kɛn Ayuda abee. Mɛ̃ bu mwɛn kwɛn ebvaan mɛ̃ nsɔɔ kwɛn Sedzaal atsiil ndɔɔ oyɔ. Ke yam, mɛ̃ k'eli y'ãtsam m'efɛn baal a myam wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Obɔ otsɛn b'esɔɔ mɛ̃ nkuul yi emwɛn byɛ bvool eyɛɛn ye byɛ, ke ngwel wɛ okɛɛn akuru mɛ̃ ãmpaa mã, me ndɔɔ a mbuul wu eta Isalayel kaã me ndɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Bee k'eyɔɔ ɔ̃nkaan si ngɔmɔ̃ wu ofi Yude me ndɔɔ a yɛ wɛ. Muaan-ngoo si ngɔmɔ̃ hɛ̃ k'ayewa bee nsia wuo ayeyɛɛn ndɔɔ yi mbi me ndɔɔ a yɛ wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Kɛn a bee edzii k'eyoo k'eyɛɛn yɛ m'etsam yɛ m'ɔ̃nywã a yam. Ke ngwel wɛ bee eyɛɛ wɛn ãmboo mbueel baal abeyɛɛn obi me nkel yi ekuru yɛ nzuru me yɔ oyɔ.»<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Bɔ akuru lɔɔ ye ndɛ. Me tsoo li esɛɛn bɔ, bɔ ayemwɛɛn ye ndɛ bam bibi ke lɔɔ e ndɛ. Onse ãyɛɛn ã ndɛ, ndɛ ákeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ Okwɛn o Nziã. M'ɛ̃nkaan mi ãngel ã Moyize y'ɛ̃nkaan mi aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, ndɛ ákesa mpɛn kwɛn ãtsam ã bɔ ãswɛɛl emfa me b'otal Yeso. Ndɛ osi obobɔ fa epal tiil ãnkunkwal. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Bakyɛ akiool m'ékeyɛɛn ndɛ, bakyɛ k'akiool wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Ŋ'eyii eyi bɔ, bɔ k'áli ɔ̃nywã ngɔmɔ̃ wɛ, Pool olweel kɛn a bubu: «Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal áli y'ɔ̃dzoo ŋ'élieel ndɛ ankiɔɔn a byɛ m'ɔ̃nywã wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã Edzayi bubu:<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />“Yi ola yam li, liaal lɔ bubu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">Byɛ èyoo bam ngesɛ, kɛn a byɛ otsɛn okwaal wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">byɛ ètal, kɛn a byɛ ki èmwɛn pyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃kwal a yam li oyii y'olyam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ãtswi ã bɔ ãyii embi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Bɔ akuru mviil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">kwɛn bɔ abee omwɛn me mviil ã bɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">abee oyoo m'ãtswi ã bɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">abee otsɛn okwaal m'ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">abee ɛ̃kwal okaal, kwɛn mɛ̃ hɛ̃ mbee bɔ oboo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Edz 6.9-10</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Pool bu ayesɛɛl ndiri: «Oŋɔ̃ eyɛɛ wɛn Nziã oyuɔɔl Endɔɔ e ndɛ li obvuul ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ: Bɔ bam akieel ayoo lɔ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 28:28">[ <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Ndɛ ayɛɛn obobɔ, Ayuda ayɛn, ayi atsuun bam kokɔ bam-a-bam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔ̃luo ondɛ k'áli onse ɛ̃nkaan mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>]<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Pool okal mvel yuaal ke nzɔ yi ékefuru ndɛ. Ndɛ ákeyɔɔ bueel b'ákeya ndɛ otal. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Ndɛ áketee Okwɛn o Nziã, bvool ákeyiool baal ãndɔɔ m'ãtal Mfam Yeso Mãsia k'ákebveel kuul mbee wɛ, wu ákeluo ndɛ nkuul pyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>